<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JER" style="id">Jeremiah</book>
  <para style="h">Jeremiah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jeremiah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jeremiah</para>
  <para style="mt">Jeremiah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Benjamin ram Anathoth khua ih ummi puithiam pawl lakih puithiam pakhat Hilkiah an timi ih fapa Jeremiah ih thusimmi pawl cu hiti in a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amon fapa Josiah in Judah ram siangpahrang a ṭuannak kum hleithum kum ah Bawipa ih ṭongkam cu Jeremiah hnen ah a thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Josiah fapa Jehoiakim ih siangpahrang a ṭuan tik khalah Bawipa ih ṭongkam cu a hnen ah a rung thleng sal. Cuih hnuah Josiah fapa Zedekiah in siangpahrang a ṭuannak kum hleikhat kum tiang Bawipa ih ṭongkam cu a hnen an voi tampi a ra thleng. Cuih kum thla nga thla ah Jerusalem mi pawl cu saltaannak ih hruai hlo an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa in ka hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Na nu ih pum sungih ka lo seemter hlan ihsin ka lo thei zo ih na suah hlan ihsin miphun tampi hnenih profet si dingah ka lo hril zo a si,” i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutikah kei in, “Maw Cungnungbik Bawipa , ṭong thiammi ka si lo; ka no tuk lai,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Asinain Bawipa in ka hnen ah, “Ka no tuk lai ti hlah; ka lo thlahnak misenpi hnenah feh sawn awla sim dingih thu ka lo pek vekin an hnenah sim aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ṭih aw hlah, na hnen ah ka um ding ih ka lo hum ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo a si,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule Bawipa cun a kut a hun sam ih ka hmur i tham hnuah, “Ngai aw, na ṭong dingmi ka thu pawl cu na kaa sungah ka ret zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuih sunah miphun hmuahhmuah le siangpahrang ukmi ram tampi parah phawi theinak le bal theinak, siatsuah theinak le hlon theinak, sak theinak le din theinak thu ka lo pek a si,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in, “Jeremiah, ziangso na hmuh?” tiah i sut. Kei in, “Khumkhal thingkung hnge ka hmu,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Na hmu dikzet; ka ṭong ciami pawl an kimnak ding ka zoh lai a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Bawipa in, “A dang teh ziangso na hmuh?” tiah i sut sal. Kei in, “Saklam ah a so hluahhlomi beel, hi lam ah a rung lei-aw mi ka hmu,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in, “Siatsuahnak cu saklam ihsin tiso bangin hi ramsung mi hmuahhmuah parah a rung liam ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ziangahtile saklam ram pawl cu hi ram rung thleng dingin ka ko zo. An siangpahrang pawl in Jerusalem khawpi kotka le a kulhnak phar kimvel ah le Judah ram khua dangdang kimvel ah an bawi tokham an ret ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka minung pawl parah ka mihremnak cu ka thlenter ding; an sual ih in dungtun ruangah, khuavang dangdang hnenah raithawinak an pek ih milem pawl anmah ih kut rori in tuah tahrat in an biak ruangah ka cawh hai ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Curuangah Jeremiah, na timtuah aw; feh awla sim dingih thu ka lo pekmi hmuahhmuah an hnenah sim ṭheh aw. Ṭih hai hlah; culole an hmai na thlen tikah ka lo ṭihter sinsin ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jeremiah, ngai hnik! Hi ramsungmi hmuahhmuah Judah ram siangpahrang le a kut thuai bawi pawl le puithiam pawl le mi senpi pawl in an lo ral ding. Sikhalsehla anmah do theinak ah thazaang ka lo pe ding; ralhruang ih kulhmi khawpi vek na si ding, thir ṭhuam bangtuk le daar ih tuahmi phar bangtuk na si ding. Na hnenah ka um ding ih ka lo hum ding. Curuangah zo hman in an lo neh lo ding. Bawipa keimah in ka lo sim zo,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa ih ṭong cu ka hnenah a ra thleng ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem khawsungih ummi hmuahhmuah hnenah a thuailam bangtuk in sim aw, i ti. “Tleirawl na si laiah rinsantlak na si zia le, Kan ṭhit awk pekte in i duh zia kha ka ciing ringring. Nelrawn lakah i thlun ih zohmanih thlawh dah lo ram khalah i thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw Israel, nang cu keimah lawngih ta na si; Ka neihmi mithianghlim na si. Nangmah a lo tuahmawhtu parah cun, harsatnak le siatsuahnak ka thlen ter a si; Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jakob tesinfa pawl, Israel ih cithlahmi pawl, Bawipa ih thusimmi hi ngaihnik uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Nan pu le nan pa pawl in ka parah ziang sualpuh dingso an neih? Ziangruangah so in dungtun? Santlai lomi milem an biak ih anmah khal zianghman lo ah an cang zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zianghman ah in siar lo, ‘In suahtu Pathianó an ti dah lo; Izipt ram sung ihsin ka suahter, Thlaler ramṭhing in ka hruai; Nelrawn ram le vunnel khur thukmi, Ram caar le khawthim sahzet ram le ram ṭihnung, Zohman an um, an feh dah lonak ram sungin ka hruai hai naón zianghman in poisa lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ram ṭhazet sungah ramsung suakmi thil ṭha le a rah pawl ei dingah ka thlenpi hai. Asinain ka ram an siatsuah riangri. Ka pekmi ram an borhhlawhter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Puithiam pawl in, “ Bawipa khuiah a um?” an ti lo. Daan a tongthamtu ka puithiam pawl hman in in thei nawn lo. An hotu pawl in in dodal ih, An profet pawl khal in Baal khawzing hmin in thu an sim ih zianghman si lomi milem an biak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Curuangah Keimah Bawipa in, Ka minung pawl parah mawhthluk thu ka rel ding; An tesinfa pawl par khalah thu ka nei ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nitlaknak lamah Saipras tikulh tiang feh uh; Nisuahnak lamah Kedar ram tiang mi thlah uh! Hitiih a cangmi bangtuk thil cangmi khuihman ah nan hmu lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Miphun dang zohman in, an pathian an thleng dah keel lo, pathian ngai si lo hman sehla! Sikhalsehla ka minung pawl cun an Pathian in thleng; An parih sunlawinak a thlentertu Pathian cu, An hrangih zianghman ṭhahnem lo, khuavang ah in thleng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Curuangah maw van tla, Mangbang in hnin ṭheh uh; Ninghang riahsia in khur ṭheh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ziangahtile ka minung pawl in thil sualral pahnih an tuah: Nunnak cerhti Keimah in hnong ih, tidai zianghman a li thei lo, a khingmi tikhur an lai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Israel cu sal a si lo; ṭuangsuak sal a si dah lo. Asinain ziangah so a ral pawl in suk le so ah an hual ciamco?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A ral pawl in kiosa bangin an auh hnawh; A ram cu nelrawn ah an canter. A khawpi pawl cu khawrop ah an tuah ih an tlansan ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Asi, Memfis mi le Tahpanhes mi in, a luruh an khuai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Maw Israel, lamzin ih ka lo hruai lai rori ah, Bawipa na Pathian Kei i tlansan ruangah, Hi thil poimawh hi na parah nangmah in na thlenter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Izipt ram ah feh ih Nail tivapi tidai innak in ziang ka ngah ding tiah so na ruat? Assiria ram ah feh in ziangso hlawh na tum? Zufrates tivapi tidai innak in ziang ka ngah ding tiah so na ruat?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangmah ih sual tuahmi lala in a lo hrem ding ih, Zinpeng na zawhnak hin a lo mawhthluk ding a si. Keimah Bawipa na Pathian i dungtun ih, Ka parah ṭihzahnak zianghman na neih nawn lo ruangah, Na hrangih thil ṭha lo le thil poimawh a sizia hi na thei vivo ding. Ziangkimtithei Bawipa , Pathian Keimah in ka sim zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in, “Maw Israel, hlanlai ihsin ka thu na rak el zo; Ka thu na thlun duh lo ih i bia duh lo. Tlang sang kipah le thing niim thuai tinah milem na biak ih hlawhhlang na ṭuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sabit hri sung ihsin a ṭha ce bangin ka lo phun, Ci ṭha sungin hrilmi na si. Asinain ziang na cang hi zohhnik! A thu a ṭawtmi le santlai lo Sabit hri na si zo hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Satpia ṭha bik hman in kholh aw khal cila, Na sualnak neh cu ka hmu thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ziangtin so mi borhhlawh ka si lo, Baal ka bia dah lo na ti thei? Horkuam sungih na sualzia zohhnik! Thilsual na tuahzia hi zoh ṭha hnik! Hrem theih lomi kalauk nu na bang; A hur laiah cun amah duhduh in a tlanmi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Vunnel lakah a pet ciamcomi kalauk nu vek na si; A hur laimi kalauk cu zoso a uk thei ding? Kalauk cang hrangah hawl rero hman a ṭul lo; A hur laiah cun olte in ngah theih a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Maw Israel, khawzing dangdang na dawinakah na ke bangter duh hlah, Na dang khal carter duh hlah. Sikhalsehla nang cun, ‘Ka kir thei nawn lo, Ram dang khawzing ka ngai tuk thlang ih, Ka dawi vivo ding na ti,’” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Fifir an kaih ih a ning a zah bangin Israel mi pawl cu nan ning a zak ding: nan siangpahrang, nan hotu bawi pawl, nan puithiam le nan profet pawl tiangin ningzahnak tumpi nan tuar ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thingkung hi kan pa a si a titu le lungto hi kan nu a si a titu nannih pawl cu nan ning a zak ding. Ka hnenah kir sawn loin ka hnen ihsin nan tlan ruangah hi bangtuk ningzak le mualpho in nan um ding a si. Cule mangbang le vansaangih nan um tikah cun, ‘Ra awla in ra run aw,’ in ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nanmah hrangih nan tuahmi nan biakmi nan khawzing pawl cu khuiah so an si? Nan harsat tikah lo bawm hai seh, an lo bawm thei asile! Maw Judah, khawpi na neihzat in khawzing khal tampi na nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka parih na vuihramnak ziangso a si? Ziangah so i dodal?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka lo hrem naón na hrangah a ṭhahnem lo. Nunsim ṭha khal na si lo. A hrang zetmi kiosa bangin nanmah ih ralnam lala in nan profet pawl nan that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Maw Israel mi pawl, ka sim mi hi ngaihnik uh! Nan hrangah hin nelrawn caar vek maw, ram thim le ram ṭihnungza vek maw ka rak si? Ziangah so, ‘Kan luat ih kan duh vekin kan nung ding, na hnenah cun kan kir lo ding,’ in ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Fala in a hlawnthil a hngilh thei dah maw si? Mo thar in ṭhit-umnak hnipuan a hngilh thei dah maw si? Sikhalsehla ka minung pawl cun in hngilh ih a ni le a thla hman ka siar cawk nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A lo ngaitu pawl duhzawng ih umtlandan cu nan thiamzet. Nunau ṭha lo bik hnen hmanah zirh theimi nan nei lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nan hnipuan cu thisen in a neh; cuih thisen cu rukru misualral pawl ih thisen si loin mawh nei lo farah pawl ih thisen a si. “Cucingin nanmah cun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />‘Mawhnak kan nei lo, Pathian cu kan parah a thin a heng lo ding,’ nan ti lai. Sikhalsehla nan sualnak nan phat ruangah hin keimah Bawipa rori in ka lo hrem hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Miphun dang khawzing hnenih nan tlan ruangah hin nanmahte in man nei lo ah nan tuah aw. Assiria parih nan bei a dong zo vek khan Izipt khal in nan beidong in a lo tuah hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Izipt lam hoi duh nawn loin nan lu ah na kut nan sih ding ih ningzak in leilung nan bih ding. Nan rinsanmi pawl cu keimah Bawipa ih ka hnon ciami an si ruangah an hnen ihsin zianghman nan ngah lo pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Mi pakhat cu a nupi a mak ih cu nu in mipa dang a pasal hnuah cu nu cu a nupi ah a lak sal pei maw? A lak sal asile an ram a borhhlawhter a si. Sikhalsehla Israel, nang cun ngaitu tampi na neih hnuah ka hnen ih ra kir sal na duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tlangzim kip khi zohhnik! Hlawhhlang na ṭuan lonak hmun pakhat tal a um maw?. Nelrawn ramṭhing ah Arab mi in a ral a bawh vekin lamzin tluan kipah na ngaimi na hngak a si. Hlawhhlang na sinakin hi ram cu na borhhlawhter ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Curuangah a si ruah a sur thei lo ih thlatang ruah tiangin a sur lonak hi! Na hmuihmel tiangin hlawhhlang na bang zo ih ningzah tikhal na nei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Atu-ah ka hnenah ‘Nang cu ka pa na si ih ka nauhak lai ihsin i rak duhtu na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka parah kumkhua in na thin a heng lo pei ih na ai a thok ringring lo pei cu,’ i ti. Maw Israel, na hmurka cun cutin na ṭong, a sinan thilsual cu na tuah theizat in na tuah fawn,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Josiah siangpahrang a si laiah Bawipa in ka hnenah, “Hlawhhlang nunau vek a si mi Israel ih thiltuahmi hi na hmu maw? Ka hnen ihsin a tlan ih tlang sang kip le thing niim thuai tinah hlawhhlang in a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hi bangtuk thil a tuah hnuah cun ka hnenah a ra kir sal tengteng ding tiah ka ruat. Asinain a kir cuang lo. Cule zumtlak lo a si mi a unau nu Judah in a hmu ṭheh fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hnenih a ra kir lo ruangah le hlawhhlang ih a um ruangah Israel cu ka maak ih ka dawi hlo khal cu Judah in a hmu ṭheh ko. Sikhalsehla zumtlak lo a si vemi Israel ih unau nu Judah cun ṭihnak zianghman nei cuang loin anih khal hlawhhlang a cang ve ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />zianghman ningzahnak a nei lo. Hi ram cu a balhter ṭheh ih lungto le thingkung biak tahrat in mah ih pasal ṭaang sung ihsin mipa dang ngaitu ah a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi hmuah hnuah Israel ih unau hlawhhlang nu Judah cu ka hnenah a kir sal vekin a tuah aw. Asinain a thinlung taktein a kir lo. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in ka hnenah, “Israel cun i dungtun zo naón zumtlak lo nu Judah hnak cun a ṭha deuh lai hrih a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Curuangah Israel hnenah va feh awla, ‘Maw zumtlak lo Israel, ka hnenah ra kir sal aw. Zaangfahnak neitu ka si ih ka thin a heng lo ding. Kumkhua cun na parah ka thin a heng lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa na Pathian parah na sual zo ih amah na dodalnak cu feltein phuang aw. Ka thukham pawl na thlun lo ih thing niim kipih thuai ah ramdang khawzing pawl ngai in na um hi phuangṭheh aw. Bawipa Keimah in ka sim zo a si,’ va ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Maw zumtlak lo minung pawl, ra kir sal uh; Keimah ih ta nan si. Khua pakhat in mi pakhat ciar le hnam khat in mi pahnih fingfing ka lo lak ding ih Zion tlang ah ka lo kirpi hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka thu a thluntu hotu pawl ka lo pe ding ih fimnak le theihthiamnak thawn an lo uk ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cule cuih ram ah nan karhzai ding ih cutikah cun mi in ka Thukham Kuang thu an rel nawn lo ding. Cuih Kuang thu cu an ruat nawn lo ding ih a ciin khal an ciing nawn lo ding; a ṭul khal an ṭul nawn lo ding. Cuvek Kuang khal an tuah nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cuih tikcu a thlen tikah Jerusalem khua cu ‘ Bawipa ih Bawi tokham,’ an ti ding ih miphun hmuahhmuah cutawkah keimah biak dingah an khawm aw ding. An thinlung ruh le thinlung siava ih a fialmi ruahnak pawl thawn thil an tuah nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel in Judah a kom ding ih sal ih an taannak hmun saklam ram ihsin hmun khatah, nan pu le nan pa pawl hnenah kumkhua hrangin ka pekmi ram ah, an kir ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Maw Israel, Ka fapa si dingah ka lo duh; Ram ṭha le leilung tlun ih ram mawi bik na hnenih pek dingah ka duh a si. ‘Ka pa,’ tiih i kawh dingah le, Ka hnen ihsin tlan nawn lo dingah ka lo duh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Asinain rintlak lo nupi bangin, ka hrangah rintlak lo na si ṭheu. Bawipa Keimah in ka sim zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tlangpar phul lak ihsin thawmvang a thang, Israel mi pawl sualral in an nung; Bawipa an Pathian an hngilh ṭheh zo ruang ih an ṭahhramnak le an ngennak aw thawng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipa a dungtuntu mi pawl tla, ra kir sal uh; A lo damter ding ih rintlak ah a lo tuah ding a si. Nannih in, “Asi, Bawipa hnenah kan ra kir, ziangahtile amah cu kan Pathian a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tlangpar ih khuavang biaknak in kan hrangah ṭhathnemnak zianghman in pe lo. Israel rundamnak cu Bawipa kan Pathian hnen lawngin a ra a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sikhalsehla ningzakza a si mi Baal khawzing biaknak in khuahlan laiih kan pupa pawl ih hna an rak ṭuan mi man, an tuu rual le an caw rual, an fanu le an fapa pawl tiangin a ei ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ningzak in kan it pei ih kan mualphonak cun in khuh seh. Kanmah siseh, kan pupa pawl siseh, Bawipa kan Pathian parah kan no lai ihsin tuih sun tiang a sual ringringtu kan si. Ziangtik khalah a mai thu ngai lotu kan si,” nan ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Maw Israel mi pawl, kir sal nan duh ahcun ka hnenah ra kir sal uh. Ka ningsin zetmi milem biaknak cu nan hlon ih ka hmaiah rintlak le hngetkhoh ih nan um ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ka hmin sal in siatserhnak nan tuah tikah thudik le dingthluk lairelnak le dingfelnak thawn nan tuah a si ahcun nan hrangah a ṭhami a si ko ding. Cuticun miphun hmuahhmuah in an parih thlawsuah pe dingah in dil ding ih in thangṭhat ding a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa in Judah mi le Jerusalem khua mi hnenah, “Nan leileh hrih lomi cu let thlang uh, nan thlaici cu hling lakah vorh hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maw Judah mi le Jerusalem mi pawl, nan Bawipa keimah thawn nan tuahmi thukamnak cu kimternak in ka hmaiah serhtanmi si uh; cuticun ka hrangah thianghlim zetin hlan-aw uh. Cutiih nan tuah lo asile thil nan tuahsual ruangah nan parah ka thinhengnak cu meisa bangin a alh ding ih a hmit theitu zohman an um lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi ramsung khuazakip ah tawtawrawt tum uh, Ringzet le fiangzetin tum uh. Judah mi le Jerusalem mi pawl cu ralhruang ih kulhmi khawpi sungih tlan dingin sim uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zion fehnak lamzin hmuh uh; Himnak hmunah tlan uh; Muangcang hlah uh! Bawipa in harsatnak a thlenter ding; Saklam ihsin a nasazetmi siatralnak a thleng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A relhnak ihsin kiosa a rat vekin, Ram tampi siatsuahtu a tho zo; Judah siatsuah dingin a ra lai rero. Judah khua pawl cu khawrop ah an cang ṭheh ding ih, zohman a sungah an um lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Curuangah buri hnipuan hruk uhla, ṭap-ai in rak ciamco uh; Ziangahtile Bawipa ih thinhengnak cu Judah par ihsin a kiang hrih lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in, “Cuih ni ahcun siangpahrang le a kut thuai bawi pawl ih ralṭhatnak a cem ding. Puithiam pawl an khawruah a har ding ih profet pawl khal mangbangin an um ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah kei in, “Maw Cungnungbik Bawipa , Jerusalem mi pawl hi nasazetin na bum hai a sihi! Daihnak a um ding, tiah na sim naón ralnam cu an hngawng thawn a dai-aw thlang a si,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jerusalem mi pawl lamah nelrawn ih tlangram ihsin thlipi nasazetin a hrang ding ti simfiang ding can a thleng zo a si. Cuih thli cu meisa vekih a sami thlipi a si ding. Fanghii a seemtu thlizil nem a si lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa ih thupek in a ra hrangmi thli cu cuhnak ih a cak deuhmi thli a si ding. Cuih thli cu a minung pawl parih thu ṭhennak a si dingih thu a petu cu Bawipa amah a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zohhnik uh, ral pawl khawdur bangin an ra. An rangleng pawl cu phusiing thli hnakin an cak deuh ih an rang pawl cu muvanlai hnakin an zamrang deuh. Kan lamzin a pit! Kan cem a si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Maw Jerusalem, thilsual na tuahmi pawl cu na thinlung ihsin kholhfai ṭheh awla cutiin runnak na ngah ding. Ziangtik tiangso thilsual cu na thinlung in na ngaihtuah hrih ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Dan khua le Efraim tlangpar ram ihsin thuthang sia thantu dingah tirhmi an ra thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ral pawl ram hlapi ihsin an ra ding tiah miphun pawl le Jerusalem ralrinnak pe dingah an ra a si. Ral pawl in Judah khua pawl cu an auh ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />mi in an lo an kil vekin Jerusalem khawpi cu an kulh ṭheh ding. Ziangahtile a minung pawl in Bawipa an dodal in ral an tho a si. Bawipa in a sim zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Maw Judah, na nunzia le na thil tuahmi in hi thil poimawh cu na parah na thlengter. Na sualnak in hi tuarnak cu a suahter. Feipi bangin na thinlung a lo sun zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A va na ve! A nat ka tuar thei lo! Ka thinlung a na! Ka thin a tur dukdo! Daite in ka um theilo. Tawtawrawt tum thawm ka thei! Raldonak au thawm ka thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Siatralnak pakhat hnu pakhat an thlun aw; Ram pumpi cu hnawmpen ah a cang; Rinlopi in kan puanthlam pawl cu siat ṭheh an si. An puanzar pawl cu an thlek ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ziangtik tiangso raldo awknak thawng hi ka theih ding ih, Tawtawrawt tum thawm cu ka theih hrih ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Ka minung pawl hi an aa a si; Keimah in thei nawn lo, Nauhak aa vek an bang; Theihthiamnak zianghman an nei lo. Thilsual tuah cu an thiamzet, Asinain thil ṭha cu an tuah suak dah lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Leilung ka zoh ih ṭiosanmi ramṭhing le hnawmpen a si. Van ka hun zoh ih tleunak zianghman a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tlangsaangpi ka zoh ih an hnin aw durdo; Tlang fate pawl an seep-aw rero.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Milai zohman an um nawn lo; Vate pawl khal an zamhlo ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ram ṭhazet cu nelrawn ah a cang zo. An khawpi pawl cu hnawmpen ah an cang ṭheh zo. Bawipa ih thinhengnak ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Leilung pumpi cu ramṭhingah a cang ding, asinain ka siatter ṭheh lo ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Leilung cu mithi a ngai ding; Van tla khi a thim ṭheh ding. Bawipa in a sim zo ih a thinlung a thleng nawn lo ding. A thu a ruat cat zo ih, dungah a siip nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Rang ralkap le conkiang ralkap pawl ih thawmvang an theih tikah zokhal an tlan ṭheh ding. Mihrek cu tupi sungah an relh ding, Midang cu lungkhaamah an van ding. Khua hmuahhmuah in a ṭhing ṭheh ding ih milai zohman an um sal nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Maw Jerusalem, na cem riai a si! Ziangah so hnipuan sen in na thuam awk ciamco? Ziangah so nan sui le nan ngun hlawnthil nan suah ih nan thuam awk hi? Ziangah so nan mit tla mawinak sii nan hnih? A lakah nan mawi-awter men a si! A lo ngaitu na tlangval pawl in an lo hnong zo ih, thah an lo tum sawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nunau nau neih tikih ai thawm bangtuk ka thei; Fatir nau neih ih ṭah-ai thawm vek a si. Cumi cu Jerusalem in a thaw a thawh thei lo ih ai thawm a si. A kut a hun thlir ih, “Kei cu ka cem zo e, Keimah thah dingah an ra zo,” tiih a ainak thawm a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Jerusalem mi pawl, Nan khawsung lamzin tluanah hin tlan vivo uhla, Khuadang tang in zoh hnik uh. Dawr tuahnak hmun pawl tiangin hawl hnik uh! Dingthluk lairelnak a hawltu le thil dik a tuahtu, Mi pakhat tal nan tong pei maw? Nan hmu asile Jerusalem cu Bawipa in a ngaithiam ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa ih hmin saal in thu nan kam-aw naón nan ṭong vek cun nan tum ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa ih hawlmi cu thudik a si. A lo vuak naón zianghman nan poisa lo. A lo palcih naón zianghman nan thlun duh cuang lo. Mi lungruh nan si ih nan sualnak ihsin nan kir duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule ka thinlung in, “Himi pawl cu mi farah le mi lungmol, thu thei lo pawl an si! An Pathian ih daan an thei lo, A duhmi khal an tuah thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuneitu upa hnenah ka feh pei ih thu ka sim ding; Annih cun an Pathian daan an thei ih, an Bawipa ih dingnak khal an thei ko a si,” tiah ka ruat. Asinain an zatein Bawipa ih thuneihnak cu an el ih, a thupekmi an thlun duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah tupi sungih kiosa in a deh hai ding; Nelrawn ih cinghnia in a bohthlek ṭheh hai ding. Tlavang pawl khal an khawsungah an vak ciamco ding; Khawlengih an suah tikah sahrang in a bohthlek ṭheh hai ding. Ziangahtile an sualnak a tamtuk ih, atu le atu an Pathian an dungtun a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Ziangah so ka minung pawl ih sualnak cu ka ngaithiam ding? Ka hnen ihsin an tlan ih Pathian ngaingai a si lomi khawzing pawl an biak. An pum puar zetin ka cawm hai; Asinain nupa sualnak an tuah ih, An caan cu hlawhhlang pawl hnenah an hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anmah pawl cu cawm thau zetmi rang cang hur an bang; An innhnen pa ih nupi sualpi ding lawng an hiar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi vek thilsual an tuah ruangah hin, ka hrem lo ding maw? Hi bangtuk miphun parah hin zoso phuhlam loin a um thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka minung pawl ih sabit hri sattan dingah an ral pawl ka thlah ding. Asinain a cem ṭheh hlan lo siatsuahtu an si lo ding. A hnge sattan dingah ka sim ding, Ziangahtile a hnge pawl cu ka ta an si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Judah mi le Israel mi pawl in in phiar zo; Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa cu a minung pawl in zianghman ah an siar lo ih, “Zianghman a tuah zik lo; vansiat malmaknak khal kan tong lo ding; Raldonak le paamnak khal kan tuar lo ding,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule, “Profet pawl cu zianghman an si lo, thli vek lawng an si; Bawipa hnen ihsin a rami thusim ding zianghman an nei lo,” tiah an ti. Cungnungbik Bawipa Pathian in, “Jeremiah, ka minung pawl in hi bangtuk ih an ṭong ruangah na kaa sungih ka retmi ka thu cu meisa bangtuk ka siter ding. Hi minung pawl cu zanthing vek an si ding ih meisa in a kaang ṭheh hai ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Maw Israel mi pawl, ram hlapi ihsin miphun phunkhat nanmah do dingah Bawipa in a rak hruai a si. Miphun hlun le miphun cakzet a si ih an ṭong nan theih lomi le an aan khal nan cin lomi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An conkiang ralkap pawl cu mi cakzetzet an si ih zaangfahnak zianghman nei loin mi an that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nan lo rawl siseh, nan inn rawl siseh, an ei ṭheh ding ih nan fanu le fapa pawl tla an that ṭheh ding. Nan tuurual le nan cawrual pawl khal an that ṭheh hai ding ih nan sabit hri le nan theipi kung tla an hau ṭheh ding. Nan rinsan zetmi, ralhruang in kulhmi khawpi pawl cu an ralkap in an siatter ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Cubangtuk tiang a thlen khalle ka minung pawl cu ka siatsuah ṭheh lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hi bangtuk in ziangah so kan parah thil na tuah? ti ih in sut tikah, Jeremiah ṭhatein sim aw: Keimah in tlansan ih an ram sungah hin miphun dang ih khawzing an biak ih an rian ruangah an ram a si lomi ah, miphun dang riantu ah an cang ding a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa in Jeremiah hnenah, “Jakob tesinfa pawl le Judah mi pawl hiti in sim aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ṭhatein ngai uh, nannih mi aa le mi lungmal pawl, mit nei na ih zianghman hmu thei lo pawl, hna nei na ih zianghman thei thei lo pawl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Keimah hi Bawipa cu ka si. Ziangah so in ṭihzah lo? Ka hmaiah ziangah so nan khur rero lo? Tifinriat kapvel ah vunnel a rettu, tidai in ziangtik hmanih lansuak thei lo dingih a rettu ka si. Tisuar cu suk le so ah a seep ding. Asinain a kap ih vunnel lengah a lan thei lo ding. Tilet khal a tho ding, asinain a pahsuak thei dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nannih pawl hi cu thinlung ruh le dodalnak thinlung lawng nan nei a si. In dungtun ih in tlansan zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Fur ruah le ṭhal ruah ka surter ih kumtin rawl laknak tikcu ka lo pek naón upatnak pek ding hmanah in ruat dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nan sualnak in nan hrangih thil ṭha ding hman hi a tisual ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Ka minung lakah mi ṭha lo pawl an um. Mi in vate awk dingah thang an kam ih an bawh vekin annih in minung awknak ah thang thawn mi an bawh. Mi awk dingah thang an kam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mihrio pa in a inn ah vate a khahter vekin mi sual pawl in an inn sungah mi an rammi thil in an inn an khatter. Curuangah a si milian le thunei zetih an can cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Curuangah a si neinungzet le pumpuar in an um ih an thaunak cu! An thilsual tuahmi cu cem ni a nei lo. Nu le pa nei lo ngakṭah farah hnenah an covo an pe dah lo; namnuaimi parah dingthluk lairelnak thawn an nung dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Sikhalsehla hi bangtuk thil an tuah ruangah keimah Bawipa in ka hrem hai ding. Hi miphun parah phu ka la ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hiram ah mangbang ṭihnungza le rapthlakza thil an tuah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Profet pawl in thuphan an sim; profet pawl ih thupek vekin puithiam pawl in mi an uk ih ka minung zohman in an el lo. A netnak tikcu a thlen tikah ziangtinso an um leh ding?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Benjamin mi pawl, himnak hmun ah tlan uh; Jerusalem ihsin tlansuak uh! Tekoa ah tawtawrawt tum uhla Beth Hakkherem ah meisa in theihternak langter uh. Harsatnak le siatralnak cu saklam ihsin a rung ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zion khawpi, a mawizet le a nal zenzenmi cu siatsuah ṭheh a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutawkah an ralkap pawl thawn siangpahrang an riak ding. Khawpi kimvel ah an riahbuk an sak ding ih an duhnak kip ah an riak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cu pawl in, “Jerusalem nam dingah timtuah uh, tiar-aw uh, sun ah kan do ding,” tiah an au ding. Asinain, “A tlai tuk zo; khua a tlai zo ih thimlam a pan zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zan khuathim ah kan do ding ih khawpi kulhnak phar pawl kan balsiat ṭheh ding,” an ti sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in hi siangpahrang pawl hnenah Jerusalem khawsung thingkung pawl hau dingah le Jerusalem donak hrangih leipawng dawl dingah thu a pek. Bawipa in, “Hi khawpi cu namnuainak in a khah ruangah ka hrem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tikhur in tidai a thar a irh ringring bangin hi Jerusalem khawpi in thilsual a thar in a suah ringring. Thawiawknak le siatsuahnak in a khat ih hi khawpi sungah natnak le hma lawnglawng ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maw Jerusalem mi pawl, hi harsatnak hi nan ralrinnak ah cang seh. Culole nannih cu ka lo dungtun ding ih nan khawpi cu zohman an um duh lonak nelrawn ah ka tuah ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in ka hnenah, “Israel cu sabit rah an lawh faimi sabit hmuan kolh bangin a kolh ve ding. Curuangah tikcu a um laiah na runsuak theizat na run pei,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah kei in, “An hnenah ka ṭong ih ralrinnak thu ka sim khalle zo inso in ngai duh ding? Mi lungruh an si ih an hna phit in nangmah ih thu hman an ngai duh lo; an hnenah phuan dingih i simmi hman an hnihsan men a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An parih na thinhengnak cu ka sungah meisa bangin a alh ve ih daitein ka umpi thei nawn lo a si Bawipa ,” tiah ka ti. Cutikah Bawipa in ka hnenah, “Ka thinhengnak cu lamzin ih nauhak pawl parah le a bur in a tlangmi mino pawl parah burh aw. Nupi le pasal pawl khal an kaih hnuah an fehpi ṭheh ding ih nutar le patar pawl khal an zuah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An innpi pawl midang kut ah a thleng ding ih an lo le an nupi pawl khal midang hnenah pek an si ding. Hi ram mi pawl hi ka hrem thluh hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi ram mi pawl zozo khal a tum a seen in a ding lo zawng ih tangka ngah lawng an tum. Profet le puithiam pawl hman in mi an bum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka minung pawl ih hma cu a vun hiik men hma ah an ruat ih, “A ṭha ko, a ṭha thluh ko,” an ti. A ṭha thluh ko cu a rak si naisai fawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi vek fihnungza thil an tuah ruangah ningzah teh an thiam maw? Thiam hlah! Ningzah zianghman an nei lo. An mithmai hman a sen lo! Curuangah midang vekin nasazetin an tlu ding. Ka hrem tikah cun an cemnetnak a si ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa in a minung pawl hnenah, “Lamzin ṭeek ah ding uhla khua cuan uh. Khuahlan lamzin le lamzin ṭha bik khuiah so a um, tiah sut uh! Cuih lamzin in feh uhla thlangam zetin nan um ding,” a ti. Sikhalsehla annih in, “Kan feh lo ding,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in ralrin peknak tawtawrawt ngaitu dingah kilvengtu a ret hai. Asinain annih cun, “Kan ngai duh lo ding,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa in, “Maw leilung miphun pawl, ngai hnik uh! Ka minung parih thil a thleng mi hi thei hnik uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Maw leilung, ngai hnik! Ka thu an ngai lo ih ka thuzirhmi an hnon ruangah le hi bangtuk thil an tumtah ruangah an parah siatsuahnak ka thlengter ding ih ka hrem hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sheba ram ihsin thawinak hrang rimhmui an kenmi le lamhlatpi ihsin zihmui rimthaw an rak kenmi pawl cu zianghman ah ka siar lo. Thil an pekmi khal ka co hlang lo ding ih thawinak an pekmi par khalah ka lung a awi cuang lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Curuangah himi pawl hi ka bahter ding ih ka rilhter hai ding. Pa le fa tla hmunkhatah an thi ding ih rualpi le innhnen pawl tla an thi ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Saklam ram ihsin mi an rung. Lamhlapi ih miphun cakzet pawl raldo dingah tim an tuah rero.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An conkiang le an ralnam pawl an keng ṭheh zo. Zaangfahnak le zawnruahnak zianghman nei lo mi an si. An rang an to ih an thawmvang cu tifinriat ih tilet awn thawm an bang. Jerusalem do dingah an tim an tuah ṭheh zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jerusalem mi pawl cun, “Cuih thawmvang cu kan thei zo ih kan kut tha khal a zawng thluh. Nunau nau nei bangin donharnak le helhkamnak in kan khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hramlakah kan suak ngam lo; lamzin khalah kan feh ngamlo, ziangahtile kan ral pawl hriamnam kengin kan kimvelah tuksumza in an khat,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in a minung hnenah, “Buri hnipuan hruk uhla vutcam lakah riahsia in lawng rero uh. Nan fapa neihsun a thih ih nan ṭah ding bangin mitthli tla in ṭap rero uh, ziangahtile nanmah do dingih a rami nan ral in rinlopi ah a lo nam ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Maw Jeremiah, thir na hniksak ding bangin ka minung pawl hi hniksak awla ziangvek an si zohhnik!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An zatein ral tho duh, mi thinlung ruh an si ih, an thinlung cu thir le daar bangtuk ih a hak remremmi an si! Nawhthuh ei pawl, hmunkip ah mi siatnak a thupte ih a rel pawl an si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Somei cu a vaam nasa naón thir-eek cu a ti thei nawn lo, a zup thei fawn lo. Ka minung pawl thiangfai hai seh tiih hniksak rero le seep rero cu a lak a si, a man lo; ziangahtile misualral pawl cu hlonhlo an si cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Annih cu thirsia-eek vek an si thlang, ziangahtile keimah Bawipa in ka hnong zo hai a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Judah mi pawl ih Pathian an biaknak Biakinn ih kotka ah i thlah. Cutawkah ding tahratin Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in a thu than dingah i fial. An hnenah, “Nan nuncan thleng uhla nan thil tidaan khal ṭhin uh. Cuticun hi hmun ahhin reipi ka lo umter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />‘Kan him ko ding. Hihi cu Bawipa ih Biakinn a si, hihi cu Bawipa ih Biakinn a si, Bawipa ih Biakinn a si,’ tiih an lo bumnak ṭongkam cu ngai nawn hlah uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Nan nuncan thleng uhla thil nan tidaan khal ṭhin uh. Pakhat le pakhat dingthluk lairelnak thawn pawl aw uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ramdang mi, farah ngakṭah le nuhmei pawl kha hmuhsuam hlah uh. Hi ram sungah hin mawh nei lo pawl ih thisen cu suakter nawn hlah uh! Khawzing dang biak khal cawl thlang uh. Ziangahtile cu pawl cu a lo siatsuahtu an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nan nun nan ṭhin asile nan pu le nan pa hnenih kumkhua hrangih ka pek ciami hi ram sungah hin reipi ka lo umter hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ruat hnik uh! Bumnak ṭongkam ah nan zumnak nan ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ruk nan ru, mi nan that, nupa sualnak nan tuah, siatcam in thuphan nan per, Baal khawzing hnenah thawinak nan pek ih nan theih dah lomi khawzing pawl nan biak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi bangtuk thil ka huatmi pawl hi nan tuah ih cuih hnuah ka umnak hmun, ka Biakinn sungah ra tahrat in, ‘Kannih cu kan him sokhaw,’ nan ra ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka Biakinn hi rukru pawl relhnak hmun ah mawsi nan ruat? Nan thil tuahmi ka hmu ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keimah in biaknak dingih ka hril hmaisa bikmi Shiloh ah va feh uhla ka minung Israel an sual ruangah cuih khua cu ziangvekin ka tuah ti va zohhnik uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sualnak siar cawk lo nan tuah zo ih atu le atu thu ka lo sim rero naón nan ngai duh hrimhrim lo. Ka lo kawh tikah a sawn hman in sawn duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Curuangah Shiloh parih ka tuah vekin nan rinsan zetmi hi ka Biakinn par ah ka tuah ve ding. Nan pupa pawl le nanmah hnenih ka pek ciami hi hmun ahhin Shiloh ih ka tuah vek cekci in ka tuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nan sungkhat Israel mi pawl ka dawihlo bangtuk in nannih khal ka mithmuh lonak hmunah ka lo dawi ve ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Maw Jeremiah, hi mi pawl hrang ahcun thlacam duh hlah; ka hnenah au duh hlah, zianghman i dil hlah; ka lo let cuang lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah ram khawsung le Jerusalem lamzin pawl ih an tuahmi na hmu lo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nauhak pawl in zanthing an khawm, upa mipa pawl in meisa an muah ih nunau pawl in Vancung Siangpahrang nu ti an kawhmi an khuavang hrang sangreu tuah dingah maida an nawng. Khuavang dangdang hrangah sabit zu an thlet ih ka thin natternak ah an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An natter ngaingai mi hi Keimah maw ka si? Asilo, anmah an natter aw sawn ih anmah le anmah ningzahnak an pe aw sawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Curuangah Cungnungbik Keimah Bawipa in ka thinhengnak cu hi Biakinn parah ka burh ding. Minung par le ṭilva parah siseh, thingkung le lo rawl par khalah siseh ka burh ding. Ka thinhengnak cu zohman ih mih thei lomi meisa bangtuk a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Maw ka minung pawl, thawinak hrekkhat cu biakṭheng parah cem ko in nan ur; a hrek cu nan hrangah ei theih a si. Asinain keimah Bawipa ih ka simmi cu a zatein nan ei thei ding ka ti a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Izipt ram ihsin nan pu le nan pa pawl ka hruaisuak laiah mei-ur thawinak le thawinak dangdang tuah ding zianghman thu ka pe lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sikhalsehla thukham pakhat ka pek: Ka thu ngai uh tiah thu ka pek a si. Ka thu nan ngai ahcun keimah hi nan Pathian ka si ding ih nannih cu ka minung nan si ding. Cuih tlunah ka thu pekmi vekin nung uhla nan hrangah ziang hmuahhmuah a tluang ding tiah feltein ka sim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Asinain ka thu nan thlun lo ih zianghman ah nan siar lo. Nan thinlung siava le thinlung ruh ih duhnak vekin ziangzongza nan tuah sawn ih ṭhat lam pan lo in siat lam nan pan vivo sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Izipt ram ihsin nan pupa pawl an suah ni thokin tuihsun tiang catbaang loin nan hnenah keimah riantu profet pawl ka thlah ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Asinain zohman in an thu nan ngai lo ih zianghman ah nan siar lo. Nan pupa pawl hnakin mi thinlung ruh le mi dodaltu nan sisawn riangri.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Curuangah Jeremiah, hi thu hmuahhmuah hi ka minung pawl hnen ah na sim ding naón zohman in an lo ngai lo ding. Na kawh khalle an lo sawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bawipa an Pathian thu a ngai lotu miphun an si hi sim hai aw. Nunsim hremnak khal an hrangah zianghman a si lo. Rintlak sinak cu an lakah a nung nawn lo. A cuih thuhla cu a rel khal an rel nawn lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Maw Jerusalem mi pawl, Mithi ngai in ṭap uh; Nan sam met uhla hlon uh. Mithi phumnak hla tlangpar ah sa uh; Ziangahtile keimah nan Bawipa ka thin a heng ih ka minung pawl ka hnong zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Judah mi pawl in thilsual an tuah zo. Ka mitkemmi milem pawl ka Biakinn sungah an ret ih ka Biakinn an borhhlawhter zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />An fanu le an fapa pawl meisa sungah paih tahratin thawinak ih an pek theinak dingah Tofet timi biakṭheng cu Hinnom phairawn ah an dawl. Himi tuah dingah ka thu pekmi a si lo; ka thinlung hmanin ka ruah dah mi a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Curuangah tikcu a rung thleng ding ih Tofet a si lole Hinnom phairawn ti nawn loin Mithahnak Phairawn ti a si leh ding. Cutawkah mithi an phum ding, ziangahtile hmun dangah mithi phumnak a um lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Miruak cu vate le ramsa hrangah an rawl a si ding ih vate le ramsa a dawitu zohman an um lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hi ram cu nelrawnah a cang ding. Judah ram ih khawsungah le Jerusalem lamzin ah lungawi aipuannak thawmvang le mocan puai ih lungawi hlasaknak awn-au thawmvang cu ka cemter ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuih caanah cun siangpahrang pawl le Judah ram bawi pawl le puithiam le profet pawl le, Jerusalem ih a ummi misenpi pawl ih ruh hmuahhmuah cu an thlaan sung ihsin phorh ṭheh an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hmunkhat ah ṭhatein khawm tahratih phum si loin an ruh pawl cu leilung parah eekdawm bangin ṭhekdarh an si ding. Himi pawl in an sunsakmi le an rianmi, thu an ronmi le an biakmi ni le thlapi le arsi hmaiah pho le darh ṭheh an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi miphun sualral sungin a nungsun mi malte pawl, ka ṭhekdarhnak hmunih khua a saktu pawl cun nun hnakin thih an duh sawn ding. Cungnungbik Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa in a minung pawl hnenah hiti in thusim i fial. “Mi pakhatkhat a bah pang tikah a tho saal lo maw? Mi pakhat in zinpeng a zawh tikah a kir saal lo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cubangtuk asile, maw ka minung pawl, ziangah so ka hnen ihsin nan tlan hnuah nan kir saal nawn lo? Nan milem lawnglawng nan thihcih ih ka hnenah nan kir duh nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Felzet in ka ngai ih zohman thudik simtu nan um lo. Nan sualnak ruangah hin pakhat hman riahsia le ninghang in nan um lo. Zohman in, ‘Ziangvek thilsual so ka tuah?’ a ti-awtu nan um lo. Raldonak rang in raldonak hmunah hmai a nor ciamco bangin nan zatein nanmah ih duhnak lamzin ciarah nan feh vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Van ih vaca hman in kir tikcu a thei ih thuro, peeleeng le ngathur khal in an rak umnak hmun ih kir saal caan an thei. Sikhalsehla ka minung pawl nannih cun ka thupekmi sungih kir saal nan thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kan fim ih na daan pawl kan thei a si, tiah ziangtinso nan ti thei? Zohhnik uh, ka daan pawl cu cangantu mi depde pawl in an thleng ṭheh zo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nan mifim pawl ningzakin an um; an mang a bang ih an bei a dong zo. Ka thu an hnong ih atu-ah ziang fimnak so an neih nawn?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Curuangah an lo pawl cu mi dang ka pek ding ih an nupi pawl cu midang ṭaang ka thlenter ding. An zatein a tum a seen in a dik loin tangka miatnak an hawl. Profet le puithiam pawl hman in misenpi an bum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka minung pawl ih hmapi cu a vun hiik men ah an ruat. ‘A ṭha ṭheh ko, a ṭha ṭheh ko,’ an ti; zianghman a ṭha ṭheh ngai fawn lo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maw ka minung pawl, hi bangtuk ningsinza thil nan tuah ruangah hin nan ning teh a zak maw? A zak lo! Ningzak hna khal nan thiam lo; nan mithmai hman a sen lo! Curuangah midang an tluk bangin nannih khal nan tlu ding. Ka lo hrem tikah cun nan cem ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka ṭong zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Lo rawl an khawm vekin ka minung pawl ka khawm duh. Sikhalsehla annih cu rah nei lo sabit hri vek an si; rah nei lo theipi kung vek an si; an hnah hman a vuai ṭheh zo. Curuangah hi ram cu miphun dangih co dingah thu ka pek zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian ih minung pawl cun, “Ziangah so kan to ringring lai? Tho uh, ralhruang ih kulhmi khawsungah kan tlan pei ih cunah kan thi pei. Bawipa kan Pathian in thi dingah in hlon zo; Bawipa in thihsii in dingah in pek zo. Ziangahtile a parah thilsual kan tuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hnangamnak kan ruahsan ih damnak tikcu kan beisei naón zianghman a ṭhahnem lo; ṭihphannak sawn kan hnenah a thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kan ral pawl Dan khua ah an lut zo. An rang hnarphiit thawm kan thei. An rangcang pawl an ai tikah kan ram pumpi in a hnin ṭheh a si. Kan ral pawl cu kan ram, kan minung, kan khua le a sung um thil hmuahhmuah siatsuah dingah an ra zo a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Ralringte in zoh uh! Nan lakah rul ka thlah ding; ziangvek rul ai nei hman in an ngamter thei lo dingmi tur neimi ka thlah ding ih a lo cuk ding a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka lungawinak a cem, riahsiatnak in ka khat; Ka thinlung mu a na.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngaihnik uh! Hi ram khuazakip ah, ka minung pawl ih ṭah-ainak ka thei; “Zion ah Bawipa a um nawn lo maw si? Cutawkah Zion siangpahrang a um nawn lo maw si?” tiah an ai. Bawipa an Siangpahrang cun, “Ziangah so milem nan biaknak le, Santlai lo ramdang khawzing pawl hmaiah nan lu nan kuun ih ka thin in hengter?” tiin a let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cutikah mipi in, “ṭhal a liam ih rawl lak tikcu a reh zo; Sikhalsehla rundam kan si hrih lo,” tiah an au.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka minung pawl an thin a nat ruangah kei khal ka thin a na. Mithi ngai in ka ṭap; Ruahsannak zianghman ka nei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gilead ah damnak sii a um lo maw? Cutawkah sibawi an um lo maw? Ziangah so ka minung pawl in damnak an ngah lo?
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ka lu hi ticawm sisehla, Ka mit hi mitthli cirhtiput sisehla ka va duh so! Cuticun a sun zan in ka ṭap ding, An thah ciami ka minung pawl hrangah ka ṭap ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nelrawn ah riahbuk nei ningla ka va duh so! Ka minung pawl tlansan in ka va um ding nan! An zate in ṭaangṭawm sualtu an si; Miphiar hmang hlir an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An lei cu thuphan per dingah tiarcia in a um ringring; Thudik si loin thuphan sawn in an ram a uk. Bawipa in, “Ka minung pawl in, thilsual pakhat hnu pakhat an tuah. An Pathian ah in ruat lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zokhal in a rualpi hman ralring zetin a pawl a ṭul. An unau hman rin theih an si lo. Ziangahtile unau kip in Jakob bangin mibum hmang an si; Zokhal in an rualpi an relsiat thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An zate in an rualpi an hruaisual ciar ih, Zohman in thudik an rel lo. An lei kha thuphan per an zirh ih, An thilsual tuah an bang dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thil poimawh pakhat hnu pakhat an tuah ih, Mi an bumnak cu a reh dah lo. Bawipa in, “Ka minung pawl in in hnong zo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Curuangah Cungnungbik Bawipa in, “Ka minung pawl hi thir bangin ka eer ding; Cutin ka hniksak hai ding. Ka minung pawl in thil ṭha lo an tuah zo, Ziangtin so ka ti cuang hai ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An lei cu thihnak thal a bang, Thuphan hlir an per. An innhnen ah ṭongkam ṭha an ṭong nan, A ngaingai ahcun thang an kam a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi vek an tuah ruangah ka hrem lo ding maw? Hi bangtuk miphun parah phu ka hlam lo ding maw? Keimah Bawipa in ka ṭong zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei in, “Fing le tlang hrangah, mithi ngai bangin ka ṭap ding; Leenkolh hrangah ka ai ding, Ziangahtile an caar ṭheh zo; Zohman cun ah an feh nawn lo. Caw pawt thawmvang khal a thang nawn lo, Vate le ramsa pawl khal an zaam ih, an tlanhlo ṭheh zo,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Jerusalem cu khawrop ah ka tuah ding, cinghnia umnak hmunah; Judah khua pawl cu nelrawn ah an cang ding, Zohman um duh lonak hmunah,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutikah, “ Bawipa , ziangah so hi ram hi zohman pal duh lomi ah a can ih siatsuah ṭheh mi le nelrawn vek ramcaar ih a can? Mifim zotal hibangtuk thu theithiam dingah an um maw? Midang an sim theinak dingah zohnen talah na simfiang dah maw?” tiah ka sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in, “Ka minung pawl in ka pek cia ka thuzirhmi pawl an tlansan ruangah hi vekih a cannak a si. Ka thu an ngai lo ih ka simmi khal an thlun lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An thinlung a ruh ngaingai ih an pupa ih an zirh bangtuk in Baal lemzuk sawn an biak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Curuangah Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian keimah in ka tuah ding mi hi ngai hnik: Ka minung pawl ei dingah a khaa mi hanghnah hangrah ka pe ding ih an in dingah thih sii ka pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Anmah in siseh, an pupa pawl in siseh, an theih dah lomi miphun lakah ka ṭhekdarh ṭheh ding ih siatsuah ṭheh an si hlan lo anmah dotu dingah ralkap ka thlah ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in, “Thil a cangmi hi ngaihtuah hnik uh! Mithi ngaitu pawl ko hnik uh! Mithi phumnak hla a saktu nunau pawl ko hnik uh!” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Misenpi in, “Sim uh, zamrang in ra hai sehla, Kan hrangah mithi phumnak hla sa hai seh. Kan mitthli a rualrual in a tlak ih, Kan ṭahnak ih kan mit a cur ṭheh hlan lo,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zion ih ṭahnak thawm hi ngaihnik uh, “Kan cem ṭheh zo e, Ningzak zetin kan um zo. Kan ram hi kan tlansan ding, Kan inn pawl bal ṭheh an si zo,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kei in, “Maw nunau pawl, Bawipa ih ṭong hi ngaihnik uh! A simmi hi ṭhatein ngai uh! Nan fanu pawl mithi ngai daan zirh uh; Nan rualpi pawl mithi phumnak hla sak daan sim uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thihnak hi kan sangkate ihsin a lut ih, Kan siangpahrang inn pawl tiangin a thleng zo; Khawsung lamzin ah nauhak pawl that dingah le, Tonkhawmnak hmun ah tlangval pawl tiral dingah a thleng zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Miruak pawl cu khuazakip ah ṭhekdarh an si, Lo lakih ṭhekdarh mi eekdawm bangin; Rawl latu pawl in fang an at ih an taanta mi, Zohman ih khawm duh loin an darh phengpheng mi fang bangin. Hitión sim dingah Bawipa in i fial a si,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Mifim in a fimnak uar hlah seh, Micak in a cahnak hngalpi hlah seh; Milian in a lennak in tluangkhawng hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zokhal in uar a duh asile Keimah i theihnak le i theihthiamnak in uar aw sawnseh. Ziangahtile ka duhdawtnak cu cem ti a nei lo ih, A dingmi le a dikmi ka tuah ringring a si. Hi pawl hi ka lungawitertu an si. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Izipt mi, Judah mi, Edom mi, Ammon mi, Moab mi le sam tawite ih a tantu nelrawn mi pawl ka hremnak tikcu a ra thleng ding. Himi pawl cu an serh an tan naón serhtannak ih a khihhmuhmi ka thukham cu an thlun lo. Himi pawl in siseh, Israel mi pawl in siseh, zohman in ka thukham an thlun lo a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Israel mi pawl, nan hrangih Bawipa a simmi thu hi ngaihnik uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Miphun dang pawl ih thil tuah daan thlun hlah uh; Van ah thil mangbangza nan hmuh khalah nan thinphang hlah uh. Miphun dang pawl in an ṭih ih an khur hmanah ṭih hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Himi pawl ih biaknak cu zianghman an si lo; Tupi sungah thingkung pakhat an hau ih, Zungthiam pawl in an hriamhrei in an ser ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sui le ngun thawn an mawiter. A tluk lonak dingah thir in an khen cih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cubangtuk milem cu fanghma hmuan sungih ritṭih thlai vek a si; An ṭong thei fawn lo. Cawicop an ṭul, an feh thei lo ruangah. Cu pawl cu ṭih hlah uh, zianghman an lo ti thei lo; Nan ṭhatnak an tuah thei lo ih, nan siatnak khal an tuah thei fawn lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , nangmah bangtuk zohman an um lo; Nang cu na cungnungbik, Na hmin cu a maksak ih huham a nei fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang, miphun hmuahhmuah ih Siangpahrang cu zoso upat loin a lo um thei ding? Upat le ṭihzah tlak na si. Miphun tampi ih mifim pawl lakah le, An siangpahrang pawl lak khalah, Nangmah bangtuk zohman a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Annih cu an zate in mi aa le mi hmuk an si! Thing ih tuahmi milem hnen cun, Ziang so zirmi an neih tho ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An milem pawl cu Spain ram ngun in le, Ufaz ram sui in an tuam ih, Zungthiam pawl ih sermi an si. Sendup le mepian hnipuan in an thuam hai; Thiamtah pawl ih tahmi hnipuan in an thuam hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Bawipa , nang cu a dikmi Pathian na si; Pathian nung na si ih kumkhua siangpahrang khal na si. Na thin a heng tikah leilung pumpi hi a hnin ṭheh; Na thinhengnak cu miphun pawl in an tuar thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nanmah pawl in, “Lei le van a tuah thei lotu khawzing cu siatsuah ṭheh an si ding!” tiah sim uh. Leilung tlun khuitawk hmanah an um nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa in leilung hi a cahnak in a tuah; Leilung pumpi hi a fimnak in a seemsuah ih, A thiamnak in van khal a pharh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amah ih thupek in van tlunih tidai an awn; Vanhram deng ihsin khawdur a rak keng; Ruah lakah nimthla a kauter zohzo. A thilri retnak hmun ihsin thli a suahter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hi thil kan zoh tikah milai hi, mi aa le ruahnak nei lo kan si. Milem tuahtu pawl khal mi bumtu an si; Ziangahtile an sermi milem pawl cu, Mi bumnak men an si ih nunnak khal an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuphan an si ih hnihsuakza an si. Bawipa a rat tikah cun an cem thluh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jakob ih Pathian cu cuvek a si lo. Anih cu ziang hmuahhmuah tuahtu a si. Amah ih minung taktak si dingah Israel mi a hril; Amah ih hmin cu Cungnungbik Bawipa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jerusalem mi pawl, ral ih kulhṭhehmi nan si. Nan thilri pawl khawm ṭheh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipa in hi ram ihsin a lo hlonhlo ding. Mi pakhat hman taang lo tiangin a lo ciil ding a si. Bawipa in a sim zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem mi pawl hiti in an au, “Besiazet ih tuahmawh mi kan si, Kan hma a dam thei lo. Asinain kan tonmi thil a si ih, kan tuar ve a ṭul, tiah kan ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kan puanthlam pawl an siat ṭheh, Kan ṭemnak hri pawl an cat ṭheh zo. Kan faate in in tlansan ṭheh; Kan puanthlam din saaltu hman an um nawn lo; Puanzar thlaitu zohman an um nawn lo,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule kei in, “In hotu pawl an aa a si, Bawipa hnenah thuronnak hna an thiam lo. Curuangah hlawhtlinnak zianghman an nei lo; Kan minung pawl ṭhekdarh ṭheh an si zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngaihnik uh, thuthang a ra thleng! Saklam ram ah buainak nasazet a um; An ralkap in Judah ram ih khawpi pawl hi, Nelrawn ah an tuah ding, Cinghnia pawl umnak ah,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , milai in mah ih nunnak uk theitu an um lo; Mah ih nunnak lamzin parah thuneitu zohman an um lo, ti ka thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na minung pawl hi nunsim aw; Asinain harsa tuk cun in tuah hlah aw; Na thinheng in in ti hram hlah aw; Culo ahcun kan cemral thluh ngaingai ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na thinhengnak cu a lo bia lotu miphun le, A lo hnongtu ram parah thlengter sawn aw. Annih cu na minung thattu an si; In siatsuah ṭheh ih kan ram hi hnawmpen ih a cangtertu an si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in ka hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Hi thukamnak sungih thu hi ruat ṭha aw. Judah le Jerusalem mi hnenah sim awla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />hi thukamnak thu vekih a thlun lotu parah cun Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian keimah in siatcamnak ka thlengter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi thukamnak cu an pu le an pa pawl thawn ka tuah. An hrangah thirsernak somei vek a si mi Izipt ram ihsin ka hruaisuak lai ih ka tuahmi thukamnak a si. Ka thu ngai dingah le ka thupekmi hmuahhmuah thlun dingah ka rak sim. Ka thu an ngai ahcun ka minung an si ding ih an Pathian ka si ding tiah ka rak sim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cuticun an pupa pawl hnenih ka tuahmi thukamnak cu ka kimter ding ih atu ih nan umnak, cawhnawi le khuaitizu a luannak ram hi ka lo pe ding tiah ka rak ti,” tiah a ti. Kei in, “Asi, Bawipa ,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in ka hnenah, “Judah ram ih khawpi pawl ah le Jerusalem khawsung lamzin ah va feh aw. Cutawkah ka thu va than awla ka thukammi an theih ih an thlun theinak dingah misenpi hnenah va sim aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An pupa pawl Izipt ram ihsin ka hruaisuak laiah ka thu ngai dingah feltein ralrinnak ka pek ih tuihsun tiang ka pek ringring lai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sikhalsehla a ngai khal an ngai lo, a thlun khal an thlun duh lo. Tuih hlan vekin an thinlung a ruh thotho ih sualnak tuah cu an baang cuanglo. Ka thukamnak thlunsuak dingah thu ka pek, asinain an thlun duh lo. Curuangah hi thukamnak sungih telhcih a si vekin hremnak an parah ka thlengter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Judah mi le Jerusalem mi pawl in in dodal ih in phiar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka simmi a eltu an pu le an pa pawl ih sualnak ah an kir sal ih khawzing dangdang an biak. An pu le an pa pawl thawn ka tuahmi ka thukamnak cu Israel le Judah in an balsiat ṭheh zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Curuangah atu-ah keimah Bawipa in an parah siatsuahnak ka thlengter ding ih zohman an luat lo ding tiah ralrinnak ka pek a si. Ka hnenah bomnak dil in an au rero hmanah ka ngai lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule thawinak an pekmi khawzing pawl hnenah Judah mi le Jerusalem mi pawl cu an feh ding ih bomnak dil in an au ding. Siatsuahnak a thlen ngaingai tikah cun hi khawzing pawl cun an hum thei hai lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Judah mi pawl cu an khawpi zat in khawzing an nei; Jerusalem mi pawl in ningsinza a si mi Baal khawzing hnenih thawinak peknak dingah an lamzin zat in biakṭheng an dawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Maw Jeremiah, hi minung pawl hrangah ka hnenah thlacam nawn hlah, a dil khal i dil nawn hlah. Harsatnak an ton ih bomnak duh ih in kawh khalle ka theihsak lo ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Ka duhdawtmi ka minung pawl in thilsual an tuah. Ka Biakinn sungih luh theinak ziangso an neih nawn? Thukam tampi an tuahnak in le thawinak ṭilva an peknak in siatralnak an kham thei dingah an ruat maw si? Cumi cun an lung a awiter ding maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A hlan ahcun olif thinghring, rah mawi zetzet rahtu tiah ka rak ko ṭheu. Asinain atu ahcun khawri thawm bangin meisa in a hnak ka ur ding ih a hnge pawl khal ka khiak ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Israel le Judah cu keimah Cungnungbik Bawipa ih phunhngetmi an si. Asinain atu ahcun an parah siatralnak thlenter ka tum. Hi siatralnak hi anmahte an parih an thlentermi a si. Ziangahtile Baal khawzing hnenah thawinak an pek ih thilsual an tuah ruangah ka thin in hengter a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka ral pawl in in phiar ih a thah in tumnak kha Bawipa in i sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thah dingih an fehpimi, mi a rinsan zettu tuu faate vek ka si. Thilsual an ngaihtuah rero mi hi keimah siatsuahnak ah a si, ti ka rak thei lo. Annih in, “Thingkung cu a sanṭhat laitakah hau uhsi; hipa hi kan that pei ih zohman in ciing nawn hlah hai seh,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cule hiti in thla ka cam, “Maw Cungnungbik Bawipa , nang cu dingthluk lairelnak thawn thu a relcattu na si. Mi ih ruahnak le thinlung na hniksak ṭheu. Na kut sungah ka thu cu ka lo pek; himi pawl parah phu na lak, ti i hmuter hram aw,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thah i duhtu pawl cu Anathoth khua mi an si ih Bawipa ih thu na tlang-aupi ringring a si ahcun kan lo that ding a si tiah in sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Curuangah Cungnungbik Bawipa in, “Annih pawl cu ka hrem ding. An tlangval pawl cu raldonak ah an thi ding ih an nauhak pawl khal rawl loin an thi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anathoth khua mi parih siatralnak a thlennak ding tikcu cu ka khiak zo. Cuih tikcu a thlen tikah cun zohman an luat lo ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“ Bawipa , nang cu a dingmi na si; Ka thuhla na hnen ka thlenter khalle na dik thotho ding. Asinain ka lo sut duhmi thu a um: Ziangah so mi ṭha lo pawl an ṭhangso vivo? Ziangah so mi depde pawl an hlawhtlin?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangmah in na phunhnget ih hram an nei; An ṭhang ih rah an rah. An ṭongkam cun an lo porh zet, Asinain an thinlung cun zianghman ah an lo siar lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Bawipa nang cun i thei; Ka thil tuahmi na hmu ih ka lo duhzia khal na thei. Hi mi ṭha lo pawl hi thah dingmi tuu bangin hnuk aw; An thih ni a kim hlanlo tlanhlo lo dingin kil aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ziangtik tiangso kan ram hi a caar ding? Ziangtik tiangso kan ram pumpi ih hrampi hi a vuai ding? Ramsa le vate khal an thi rero. ‘Pathian in kan tuahmi a hmu lem lo!’ a titu minung pawl ih sualnak ruangah a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Maw Jeremiah, Minung hman tlan na zuam thei lo a si ahcun, Ziangtin so rang cu tlan na zuam thei ding? Leenkolh hmanih na din thei lo a si ahcun, Ziangtin so Jordan tiva kap hramrul lakah na din thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na unau pawl, na innsang sungih sungtel pawl hman in, An lo phiar ih a lo dotu ah an tel a si. Annih cu zum hlah, an ṭongkam a ṭhat hmanah,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Israel ka dungtun zo, Ka hril ciami miphun cu ka hnong zo a si. Ka duh zetmi ka minung pawl cu, an ral pawl ih kut sungah ka san zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hrilcia minung pawl in in dodal, Tupi sung kiosa bangin ka parah an huuk an raak; Curuangah ka hua hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka hrilcia ka minung pawl cu, kakip ihsin khaupi ih dawimi vate vek an si. An sa einak puai ah ramsa pawl khal ko uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ramdang uktu pawl in ka sabit hmuan an siatsuah ṭheh; Ka loram an palbeek ṭheh ih, duhnungza a si mi ka ram cu nelrawn ah an canter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tlansanmi ramah an canter ih, Ka mithmuh ah hramlak ramṭhingah a cang; Aram pumpi in nelrawnah a cang ih zohman in an poisa lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nelrawn ramṭhing tlangsaang par khuazakip ah, Mi long ding le ram ding ah siatsuahtu an ra; Ram pumpi khatlam deng ihsin khatlam deng tiang siatsuahtu cu Bawipa ih ralnam a si. Zohman hnangamnak thawn an um thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka minung pawl in sangvut an ciing; asinain hling le so lawng an khawm; Harsazet in hna an ṭuan, a sinan zianghman an ngah lo. Ka thin a hengtuk ruangah, an thlaikho rah an nei lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Ka minung Israel mi pawl ih ram a siatsuahtu, Israel ram kiangih a ummi ram pawl hnenah sim ding ka nei. Cuih mi ṭha lo pawl cu phawi mi thingkung bangin an ram ihsin ka phawisuak ding ih an hnen ihsin Judah mi pawl cu ka hum suak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asinain cutiih ka phawisuak hnu ahcun an parah zaangfahnak ka nei sal ding ih an khua le an ram ciarah ka hruai kir sal ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Baal khawzing hmin in ka minung pawl siatserhnak an rak zirh naón atu ah ka hmin in siatserhnak an zir ih, ‘ Bawipa a nun bangin,’ an ti ih an thinlung ngai in ka minung pawl ih biaknak an pom a si ahcun ka miphun ah an cang ve ding ih an ṭhangso ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sikhalsehla miphun pakhatkhat in a thlun duh lo ahcun cuih miphun cu ka phawisuak ding ih ka siatsuah ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Feh awla pat in tahmi bawngbi tawite pawl lei awla hruk aw; asinain tidai na daiter lo pei,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Curuangah bawngbi tawite cu ka lei ih Bawipa ih fial vek cun ka hruk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule Bawipa cu ka hnenah a ṭong sal ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Feh awla Eufrates Tivapi na thlen tikah lungto kua sungah cuih bawngbi cu thup hai aw,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I ti vek cun ka feh ih Eufrates Tiva kiangah cun ka va thuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tikcu a rei hnuah Bawipa in Eufrates Tiva ih feh dingah le bawngbi tawite pawl va la sal dingah i fial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka va feh ih ka thuhnak hmun ka thlen tikah ka vun lai; cule ka hun zoh tikah an rop ṭheh ih hman tlak lo an si kha ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule Bawipa ih ṭong cu ka hnenah a ra thleng sal ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Hi bawngbi bangtuk hin Judah ih hngalnak le Jerusalem ih puarthaunak nasazet cu ka siatter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi mi sualral pawl in ka thu an ngai duh hrimhrim lo. Tuihhlan vek thotho in an thinlung a ruh ih an sualral thotho; khawzing dangdang an rian ih an biak a si. Curuangah hi bawngbi tawite pawl vekin an siat ding ih hman tlak lo ah an cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi taai ah bawngbi tawite cu hngetzet ih a rek awk vekin Israel mi le Judah mi pawl cu ka hnenah hngetzet ih a ben-awmi si dingah ka duh a si. Cuticun annih cu ka minung an si ding ih ka hmin thannak le sunlawinak a suahtertu an sinak dingah ka duh. Asinain ka thu an thlun duh lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa Pathian in, ka hnenah, “Jeremiah, sabitti beel hmuahhmuah sabitti in khahter thluh dingah Israel mi pawl sim aw. ‘Sabitti beel hmuahhmuah sabitti in khahter thluh ding cu kan thei ṭheh a si,’ tiah an lo let ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule keimah Bawipa in hi ram sungih a um hmuahhmuah David tesinfa siangpahrang a cangmi pawl siseh, puithiam le profet pawl siseh, Jerusalem ih a ummi pawl tiangin sabitti in ka khatter ṭheh ding ih sabitti an ri ṭheh ding. Cumi cu sim hai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cule upa nauhak tilo in pakhat le pakhat sabitti beel bangin ka vuakkuai ṭheh hai ding. Zawnruahnak, lainatnak le zaangfah thinpemnak um loin ka that hai ding. Zianghman in i kham thei lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Maw Israel mi pawl, Bawipa in a sim zo; Nan thinlung nemter uhla a thu ngai uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa nan Pathian cu upat uh. Thimnak a thlenter ih, tlangpar ih nan bah nan rilh hlanah le, Nan beisei mi tleunak cu khawthim sahzet ih a canter hlanah hin amah cu ṭihzah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cuih thu nan ngai duh lo ahcun, nan hngalnak ruangah a thupte in ka ṭap ding. Ka ṭap ding ih ka mitthli nasazet in a luang ding; Ziangahtile Bawipa ih minung pawl cu sal ih kaihmi ah an cang ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipa in ka hnenah, “Siangpahrang le a nu kha sim aw; siangpahrang tokham ihsin ṭum hai seh, ziangahtile an siangpahrang lukhuh mawizet cu an lu ihsin a tla zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judah ram thlanglam ih khawpi pawl cu ral in an kulh ṭheh zo; a kulhpit ṭheh ih pah thei a si nawn lo. Judah mipawl cu saltaannak ah hruai ṭheh an si zo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Maw Jerusalem, zoh hnik! Na ral pawl saklam ihsin an rung. Nangmah kilkhawi dingih an lo pekmi milai pawl cu khuiah so an si? Na uarzet mi milai pawl cu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na rualpi ih na ruah mi pawl in an lo neh ih an lo uk tikah ziangso na ṭong leh ding? Nunau nau nei bangin a na na tuar ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ziangah so hivek thil hi ka parah a thlen? Ziangah so ka hnipuan in thleksak ṭheh ih in sualpi? na ti asile na sual tuk ruangah a si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Midum phun Ethiopia mi pakhat in a vun dum a thleng thei pei maw? Tlavang in a ṭial a thleng thei pei maw? An thleng thei a si ahcun thil ṭha zianghman tuah loin sualnak lawnglawng a tuahtu nannih khal in thil ṭha tuah nan zir ve thei ding!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nelrawn thlipi in fangkuang ro a seemhlo vekin Bawipa in a lo ṭhekdarh ṭheh ve hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hi vek thil nan tong ding tiah a lo simcia zo. Himi cu khawlairel ciami a si. Ziangahtile amah nan hngilh ih zianghman si lomi khawzing dang nan ring sawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bawipa amah rori in nan hnipuan a hlit ṭheh ding ih nan lawngfangkheh in ningzakin a lo ret ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A huatmi thil nan tuahmi a hmu zo. Phuul lakah siseh, tlangpar ah siseh, khawzing dang nan hawl; mipa sualral in midang nupi a ngai, a hiar ih rangcang hur in rangpi a thlun vivo vekin khawzing dang nan dawi vivo a hmu zo. Maw Jerusalem mi pawl, nan lamzin a va pit so! Ziangtikah so thianghlim in nan um leh ding?
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in ruah sur lonak thu-ah hiti in i sim,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Judah cu riahsia in a um. A khua pawl an caar cuahco; A minung pawl riahsia in leilung ah an bok, Jerusalem khal bomnak duh ah a au.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Milian pawl in tidai khai dingah an sal pawl an thlah; Tikhur ah an feh, a sinan tidai a um lo; An tibeel lawngpi thawn an kir sal. Thinnau le mangbang in an hmai an hup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ruah a sur lo ih leilung a car ṭheh ruangah lothlo pawl cu an bei a dong. Riahsia in an hmai an khuh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hramlakah zukneng in a fa note a tlansan, hrampi a um lo ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hramlak laak cu tlangzim parah a ding; Cinghnia bangin a thawthawt ding hawl in a hekhek; An mit khua a hmu thei lo, rawl an ngah lo ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka minung pawl ka hnenah an au, ‘Kan sualnak cun in mawhthluk hman sehla, Na thukam bangin, Maw Bawipa, in bawm hram aw. Na hnen ihsin voi tampi kan tlan zo, na parah kan sual tuk zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangmah lawng hi Israel ih ruahsannak na si. Nangmah lawng siatralnak ihsin in humtu na si. Ziangah so kan ram sungah hin ramdangmi vekin le, Zankhat lawng a riakmi mikhual vekih na um?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ziangah so thinphannak a neitu bangtuk na si? Ziangah so zohman a bawm thei lotu ralkap vek na si? Maw Bawipa , nang cu kan hnenah na um ih, Kannih cu na minung kan si; In tlansan hram hlah aw,’ in ti,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in hi pawl thu a rel ih, “Hi pawl cu ka hnen ihsin tlan an hiar ngaingai. Anmah le anmah an uk aw thei lo. Curuangah an parah ka lung a awi lo. Thil ṭha lo an tuah mi cu ka ciing ding ih an sualnak ruangah ka hrem hai ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa in ka hnenah, “Hi minung pawl bawm dingah cun i dil nawn hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rawl ul tahratin bomnak an dil hmanah ka theihsak hai lo ding. Mei-ur thawinak in pek ih thlairawl thawinak khal in pek hmanah an parah ka lung a awi cuang lo ding. Raldonak, paamnak le natnak in ka siatsuah thotho hai ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah kei in, “Maw Cungnungbik Bawipa , hi ram ah do awknak le paamnak cu a um nawn lo ding, ziangahtile Bawipa in daihnak lawng a um thlang ding tiah thu in kam zo, tiah profet pawl in misenpi hnenih an ṭongmi na thei ko,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Bawipa in, “Profet pawl ka hmin in thuphan an per a si. Ka thlahmi an si lo, thu ka pekmi khal an um lo; an hnenah ṭong kam khat ṭong dingih ka fialmi khal an um lo. An rel celcelmi langnak an hmuhmi pawl cu ka hnen ihsin a rami an si lo; hmailam thu an simcia mipawl cu thulolak, anmah ih thinlung ruahmi men a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keimah Bawipa in cuih ka thlah lomi profet pawl, ka hmin saal tahratin hi ram ah raldonak le paamnak a thleng lo ding a titu pawl parah ziang ka tuah ding ti cu ka lo sim ding: raldonak le paamnak in ka siatsuah ṭheh hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An thu a rak ngaitu pawl khal cuvek thotho in siatsuah an si ding. An ruak cu Jerusalem khawpi lamzin ah hlon an si ding ih zohman in an phum lo ding. Anmah lawng si loin an nupi pawl, an fanu le an fapa pawl khal cuvek thotho in tuah an si ding. An sual man nasa zetin an kuan ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa in ka riahsiatnak hi misenpi hnenih phuang dingin thu i pek ih hiti in ka sim, “A sun a zan in ka mitthli luang ringring seh, Ka mitthli hul ni um hlah seh; Ziangahtile ka minung nasa zetin, tuahmawhnak an tuar ih, an hma a besia ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hramlak ih ka feh tikah, ral ih thah mi ruak ka hmu. Khawpi sungih ka feh tikah, rawl loih a thi mi ka hmu. Profet le puithiam pawl in an hna an ṭuan, Asinain ziang kan tuah ti an thei lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , Judah cu na hnongthla rori maw si? Zion mi pawl na hua ngaingai maw si? Ziangah so hiti lawmmam in in tuahmawh? Kan hma a dam thei nawn lo. Daihnak kan hngak naón ṭhatnak zianghman a ra lo. Damnak kan ruahsan naón ṭihphannak sawn a thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na parah kan sual ngaingai zo. Na hmaiah kan sualnak le, kan pupa pawl ih sualnak tla kan phuang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na hmin ih zaar ah in nautat hram hlah aw; Na sunlawinak tokham Jerusalem parah cun, Mualphonak thlenter hram hlah aw; Kanmah thawn na tuahmi thukamnak cu bal hram hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ramdangmi pawl ih tuahmi milem cun ruah a surter thei lo. Van in amahte ruah hmaikhat hman a tlakter thiam lo. Maw Bawipa kan Pathian, kan ruahsannak cu na hnenah kan ret zo. Hi thil hmuahhmuah a tuahtu cu Nangmah lawng na si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in ka hnenah, “Moses le Samuel hman hitawk ah ding in i dil rero khal hai sehla, hi minung pawl parah cun zaangfahnak ka nei lo ding. Tlan hai seh; ka mithmuh ah um hlah hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khuiah so kan feh ding ti ih an lo sut a si ahcun keimah ih ka ṭongmi vekin sim aw: Mi hrek cu natnak in an thi ding; Cunah feh hai seh. Midang cu raldonak ih thi ding an si; Cunah feh hai seh. Mi hrek cu rawl lo ih thi ding an si; Cunah feh hai seh. Mihrek cu salkaihmi an si ding; Cunah feh hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keimah Bawipa in an parih a thleng dingmi thil pali ka ruat cat zo. Raldonak ah thah an si ding; an ruak cu uico in an thiar ding; vate in an ei ding ih an hlahmi cu ramsa in an ei ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jerusalem ah Hezekiah fapa Manasseh in Judah siangpahrang a ṭuan laiih thilsual a tuahmi ruangah hi bangtuk in ka tuah ding ih cumi cu leilung mi hmuahhmuah in an hmuh tikah ṭihnung le mangbang in an um ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Maw Jerusalem mi pawl, Zoso a lo zaangfah ding? Zoso a lo riahsiatpi ding? Cawl tahratin ‘Ziangtin nan um?’ a lo titu zotal an um pei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nannih sawn in in hnong ih in dungtun zo a si. Curuangah ka kut ka hawi ih ka lo tisiat hai a si. Ka thin suup in nanmah dimdoih rero hi ka paih nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ramsung khawkip ah fangkung ro bangin, thli lakah ka lo hlon hai. Ka minung pawl keimah in ka lo siatsuah a si. Nan faate pawl tiangin ka that, thilsual tuah nan baang cuang lo ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nan ram sungih nuhmei cu tifinriat kap vunnel hnakin an tam sawn. Nan tlangval pawl an no laiah ka that ih an nule pawl an tuar ngaingai; Rinlopi in donharnak le thinphannak an hnenah ka thlenter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A fapa pasarih in an thihsan mi nunau cu a lung mit in a ril, a thawthawt ding a hawl. Sun laitakah a hrangah cun khua a thim, Mualpho in a um ih thinnatnak in a khat. A nungsun nannih khal thah dingah, nan ral kut ah ka lo pe hai ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Leilung parah ka nu in i hrin hi mi vanduai ka va si so! Ramsung mi hmuahhmuah in in hua ih in heek. Paisa ka cawih dah lo, midang paisa khal ka cawi dah lo; a sinan zozo khal in in camriam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , nangmah ṭhatein ka lo rian lo ih ka ral pawl harsatnak le mangbangnak an ton tikah an hrangah na hnenih ka ngensak lo a si ahcun siat in serhnak hi kim hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zokhal in thir an khiak thei lo, saklam ram ihsin a rami thir hrimhrim cu, ziangahtile daar thawn rawimi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa in ka hnenah, “Hi ram sungih ka minung pawl sualnak an tuah ruangih cawhkuan peknak ah an thilri le an sumsaw longtu dingah ral ka thlah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An thei dah lomi ram, an ral pawl ih ram ah an ral pawl riantu ah ka tuah hai ding. Ka thinhengnak cu meisa vek a si ih kumkhua in a alh ding a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cutikah kei in, “Maw Bawipa nang cun i thei. I thei ringring awla, i bawm aw. I hremtu pawl parah phulaknak um hram seh. An parah na thin sau nawn hlah aw, in thatsuak ngaingai pang ding. Nangmah ruangih hmuhsuam ka si hi ciing ringring hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka hnenah na ṭong ih na ṭongkam kam khat khal ka thei ṭheh a si. Maw Cungnungbik Bawipa Pathian, na hmin ih kawhmi ka si; na minung ka si ih na ṭongkam in ka thinlung cu lungawinak le thinnomnak in a khahter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Midang thawn capohnak le hnihsuaksainak ah ka tikcu ka hmang dah lo. Na thupekmi ngai in keimah te in ka um ih thinhengnak in ka khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ziangah so ka tuarnak hi a reh dah lo? Ziangah so ka hma hi an dam dah lo? An dam thei nawn lo ding maw si? ṭhal can ih tiva kang bangin ka ruahnak na cemter ding maw si?” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in, “Na ra kirsal a si ahcun ka lo la sal ding ih i riantu na si sal ding. Thulolak men ṭong loin thungai le thudik na phuang a si ahcun ka profet na si sal ding. Mipi hnenah na feh a ṭul lo ding, anmah sawn na hnenah an ra ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An lo do hmanah an lo neh lo ding. Daar ih tuahmi phar vekah ka lo tuah ding ih an lo ti thei lo ding. Na hnenah ka um ding, ka lo hum ding ih ka lo run ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Misual le mi ṭha lo pawl kut sung ihsin ka lo run suak ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa ih ṭongkam cu ka hnenah a thleng ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nupi na ṭhi lo pei ih hivek khua le ram ahcun fanu fapa khal na nei lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi ram ih faate an hrinmi pawl parah ziangvek thil a thleng ding ti ka lo sim ding. A hringtu an nu le an pa par khalah ziang a thleng ding ti ka lo sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Natnak a phungphun in an thi ding ih a ṭahtu khal an um lo ding; a phumtu khal an um lo ding. An ruak cu leilung parah eekdawm bangin darh an si ding. Raldonak ah an thi ding, rawl lo in an thi ding; an ruak cu vate le ramsa pawl ih rawl an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Mithi an ngainak inn ahcun na lut lo pei. Zohrang hmanah na riahsia hlah. Ka minung pawl cu daihnak thawn ka thlawsuah nawn lo ding. An parah duhdawtnak le zaangfahnak tla ka nei nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi ram ah hin milian siseh, mifarah siseh an thi tlang ding ih phumtu zohman an nei lo ding. Ṭahtu khal an nei lo ding. An riahsiatnak langternak ah zohman in namte in an zai aw lo ding ih an lu khal an met lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An duhdawtmi an thih tikah hnemnak ah tiah zohman in ti le rawl an in pi, an ei pi lo ding. An nu le an pa an thih hmanah zohman in an topi lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Rawl ei puai an tuahnak innsung ah na lut lo pei. Ei ding le in dingah an hnenah na to lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel Pathian Keimah ih ka ṭong mi hi ngai aw: Nangmah nunsung ah le na mithmuh rori ah, lungawinak le aipuannak thawmvang le mocannak puai ih awn-aunak thawmvang pawl cu hi ram sungah hin ka rehter thluh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Cutiih na sim ṭheh tikah, ‘Ziangah so cutluk lawmmam ih hrem dingah Bawipa in thu a ruah? Ziangvek mawhnak so kan neih ih ziangbangtuk sualnak so Bawipa kan Pathian parah kan tuah?’ tiah an lo sut ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutikah keimah Bawipa ih simmi cu sim hai aw: ‘Nan pu le nan pa pawl in in tlansan ih khawzing dang an rian ih an biak. In dungtun ih ka thu zirhmi an thlun lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cuih tlunah nannih cu nan pu le nan pa hnakin nan luar sinsin. Nan zatein milungruh le misualral nan si ih ka thu nan ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Curuangah hi ram ihsin ka lo hlon ding ih nanmah in siseh, nan pupa pawl in siseh, nan theih dah lomi ram ah ka lo kuat ding. Cutawkah a sun a zan in khawzing dang nan rian ding ih nan parah zaangfahnak zianghman ka nei lo ding,’ tiah sim hai aw,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Tikcu a ra thleng ding ih mi in Izipt ram ihsin Israel mi pawl a hruaisuaktu Pathian ih nunnak saal tahrat in siat an ser in thu an kam nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Saklam ram ihsin le ka ṭhekdarh hainak ram pawl ihsin Israel mi a hruaisuaktu Pathian nunnak ko in thukamnak an tuah sawn ding. Anmah ih ram, an pu le an pa pawl hnenih ka pekmi ram ah ka kirter hai ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Ngakaitu tampi ka ko ding ih hi minung pawl hi ka kaihter ding. Cule tlangsaang le tlangniam ah siseh, lungkua le lungpuk sungah siseh, anmah hawltu le dawitu dingah sakap thiam tampi ka sawm ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An tuah mi hmuahhmuah ka hmu thluh. Ka hmaiah an thuh theimi zianghman a um lo; an sualnak ka hmuh lomi zianghman a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An sualnak le an ṭhatlonak cu lethnih in ka kuanter hai ding. Ziangahtile ruak bangtuk a si mi nunnak nei lo milem in ka ram cu an borhhlawhter ih zianghman a si lomi khuavang in an khahter zo a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , nangmah in i hum ih cahnak i pek. Harsatnak tikcu ah i bawm. Vanhram deng ihsin miphun tampi an ra ding ih na hnenah, “Kan pu le kan pa pawl cun thuphan khuavang siar lo zianghman an nei lo; an neihmi cu zianghman ṭhahnem lo milem lawng an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi in anmahte pathian an tuah thei pei maw? Tuah thei hlah; an tuah thei hmanah pathian ngaingai an si lo ding,” an ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in, “Cuti a si ahcun kumkhua daih in ka huham le ka cahnak cu miphun pawl ka theihter hai ding; Bawipa ka sihi an thei ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Maw Judah mipawl, nan sualnak hi thirzum in ngan an si; nan thinlung parah lungvar hriam in ngan an si ih nan biakṭheng kil ah khen an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nan minung pawl in khawzingnu Asherah hrangih an tuah mi hramlak tlangsaang parah le tlangniam par khalah, thinghring hmuahhmuah hnuai khalah biakṭheng an dawlmi le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ṭhuam thianghlim an phunnak kipah khuavang an biak. Nan ram sungih sualnak nan tuahmi ruangah nan thilri le nan sumsaw longtu dingah nan ral pawl ka thlah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka lo pekmi nan ram cu nan suahsan ding ih midang kut ah nan ap a ṭul ding. Nan theih dah lomi ram sungah nan ral pawl nan rian ding; ziangahtile ka thinhengnak cu meisa bangtuk a si ih kumkhua in a alh ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Ka hnen ihsin a tlan ih milai a rinsantu, milai cahnak men a rinsantu cu, Keimah in ka hnong ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amah cu nelrawn ih a khomi hrambur vek a si; Ramcaar le ramṭhing, leilung alnak ram, Zianghman a khoh thei lonak ih hrambur vek a si. A hnenah thil ṭha zianghman a thleng dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Sikhalsehla keimah i rinsantu cu, Bawipa ah rinsannak a neitu cu, thlawsuah ka pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tiva kiangih a khomi thingkung, a hram tidai a thlengmi thingkung bangtuk a si. Ṭhal caan nisa khal a ṭih lo, A hnah a hring ringring. Ruah a sur lo khalah a phang lo, Rah a rah ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Milai ih thinlung cu zoso a theithiam ding? Ziangdang hnakin mibum hmang bik a si; Damter dingah a harzet, a natnak a besia tuk!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keimah Bawipa in milai ih thinlung cu ka hmu ih an sunglam thil ka hniksak. Mikip an nuncan daan in ka zoh ih, An tuahmi vekin ka tuah rul ve,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A dik loin tangka a khawl vivotu minung cu, Mah ih ti lo ti a optu vate vek a si. A sanṭhatlaitak ah a lennak a sung ding. A netnak ahcun zianghman a si lo mi aa ah a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan Biakinnpi hi siangpahrang tokham sunglawi vek a si; A hramthok ihsin tlangsaang parah a ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , nangmah cu Israel ruahsannak na si. Nangmah a lo hnongtu cu mual an pho ding. Vunnel parih hmin nganmi vekin an hlo ding; Nunnak tidai Bawipa nangmah an lo hnon ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , i damter awla, ka dam ngaingai ding; i run awla ka him taktak ding. Ka thangṭhatmi cu nangmah lawng na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Misenpi in ka hnenah, “ Bawipa in in hro le in ṭhihṭhaihnak ṭongkam cu khuiah so a si? Kimter ngaingai hnikseh,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Asinain maw Bawipa , an parih harsatnak thlenter dingah ka lo forhfial dah lo. Harsatnak an ton cu ka saduhthah a si lo. Maw Bawipa , cumi cu na theihmi a si, ka ṭongmi khal na thei ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka hrangah ṭihnungza si hram hlah aw; harsatnak a thlen tikah nang cu ka himnak na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I hremtu pawl parah ningzahnak thlenter aw; a sinan Bawipa kei cu i luatter hram aw. Annih cu thlaphannak in khahter aw; a sinan kei cu i ṭihter hram hlah. An parah vansiat malmaknak thlenter awla annih cu deengkuai ṭheh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bawipa in ka hnenah, “Jeremiah, Misenpi Kotka timi Judah siangpahrang pawl khawsung ih an luh an suahnak ah va feh awla ka thu va phuang aw; cuih hnu ah Jerusalem kotka dang tla ah va feh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Siangpahrang pawl le Judah mi hmuahhmuah le Jerusalem khawsung mi hi kotka ihsin a suak a lutmi pawl cu hi ka thusimmi ngai dingah va sim aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An nunnak an ui a si ahcun Sabbath ni ah thil phur hlah hai seh; Jerusalem kotka ihsin ziangthil hman luhpi hlah hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An inn ihsin Sabbath ni ah zianghman suahpi hlah hai seh. Sabbath ni ah hna an ṭuan lo pei. An pupa pawl hnenih thu ka pek vekin Sabbath ni cu nizarh a si ih an ul pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An pupa pawl cun ka thu an ngai lo ih an poisa fawn lo. An lung a ruh ih ka thu an thlun lo, an zir duh fawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka thupekmi thlun hrimhrim dingin misenpi pawl sim aw. Hi khawsung ah ziang thil hman phur in Sabbath ni ah an luhpi lo pei. Sabbath ni cu nizarh a si ruangah an ul pei ih ziang hna hman an ṭuan lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cutin an tuah asile an siangpahrang le an bawi pawl cu Jerusalem kotka ah an lut ding ih siangpahrang David bangin huham an nei ve ding. Judah mi le Jerusalem mi pawl thawn hmunkhatah an rang le rangleng parah an to ding ih Jerusalem khawpi sungah minung an khat ringring ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Judah khua pawl in le Jerusalem khua kiangkap khawte pawl ihsin mi tampi an ra ding; Benjamin ram, tlanghram pawl ram, tlangpar ram le Judah ram thlanglam ihsin tla an ra ding. Ka Biakinn sungah mei-ur thawinak le thawinak dangdang, sangphut thawinak le rimhmui pawl, lungawinak hrangih pekmi khal an rak keng ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sikhalsehla ka thu an thlun ih Sabbath ni cu nizarh a si ruangah an ulh a ṭul a si. Hi ni ah Jerusalem kotka sungin ziangvek thil hman an phur lo pei; an phurh asile Jerusalem kotka cu meisa in ka ur ding. Jerusalem siangpahrang inn pawl khal meisa in a kang ding ih a hmit theitu zohman an um lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Jeremiah hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Beel tuahtu inn ah vung feh awla cunah thu ka lo sim ding,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Curuangah ka vung feh ih beel tuahtu pa cu a beel tuahnak lengkual thawn hna a ṭuan rero lai ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Beel a tuah tikah tlak a hlum ih a tuahmi a ṭhat lo ahcun beel dang a duhmi ah a tuah sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in ka hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Beel tuahtu in tlak in a duhduh a tuah vekin Israel mi nan parah tuah theinak ka nei ve lo maw si? Tlak cu beel tuahtu kut sungih a um vekin nannih khal ka kut sungah nan um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Voikhat khatah miphun pakhat a si lo le uknak pakhat ka phawisuak ding, ka khuai ṭheh ding ih ka siatsuah ding ka ti hnu ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />cuih miphun cu a thilsual tuahnak ihsin a kirsal a si ahcun ka tuah ding ka timi cu ka tuah suak lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sikhalsehla voikhat khatah miphun pakhat a si lo le uknak pakhat ka dinter dingih ka ṭhansoter ding ka ti hnuah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />cuih miphun in ka thu a thlun lo ih sualnak a tuah a si ahcun ka tuah ding ka timi cu ka tuah suak lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Atu-ah Judah mi le Jerusalem mi pawl kha sim aw: an hrangih a ṭha lomi tuah dingah tumtahnak ka nei ih anmah hrem dingah tim ka tuah rero lai a si. An nunnak sualral hi baang thlang hai seh; an nunzia le an thil tuah mi pawl hi ṭhin hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Annih cun, ‘Ziangah so kan ṭhin ding? Kan duh vekin mi lungruh le mi ṭha lo kan si ko pei cu,’ an ti ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Hi bangtuk hi, khui ram talah a cang dah maw? Miphun hmuahhmuah sut hnik uh. Israel mi pawl in thil poimawh an tuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lebanon ram lungto tlangsaangpipi parah vur tla loin a um dah maw? A daizetmi tlangsaang ihsin tiva luangmi ziangtik talah an kang dah maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sikhalsehla ka minung pawl cun in hngilh, Milem hnenah rimhmui an ur a si. An fehnak ding lamzin ah an feh ih an bah, Lamzin hlun an thlun nawn lo; Sial lomi lamzin sawn an zawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hi ram cu tuksumza ah an canter, Kumkhua ih hmuhsuam dingah. A kiangih a fehtu le a hmutu pawl, an mang a bang ding. An khawruah har in an lu an thing ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka minung pawl cu an ral hmaiah, ka ṭhekdarh ṭheh ding; Nisuahnak lam thlipi ih vunnel a sem hlo bangin. Ka dung ka tun hai ding; Vansiat malmaknak a thlen tikah ka bawm hai lo ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cule misenpi pawl in, “Jeremiah hi ziangtital in kan phiar pei. In zirhtu dingah puithiam pawl le thuron dingah mifim pawl le Pathian thu phuangtu dingah profet pawl an um ringring ko ding. Asinain a parah thu kan tuah pei ih a thusimmi kan ngai nawn lo pei,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Curuangah hiti in thla ka cam, “Maw Bawipa , ka ṭong mi hi ngai hram awla ka ral pawl ih an simmi hi run thei hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ṭhatnak cu ṭhatlonak ih rulh ding maw a si? Asinain ka tlaknak dingah khur an lai zo. Na hnenah ra in na thinheng ih na tuahsiat hai lonak dingah ka lo dilnak ka ṭong na thei ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Asinain maw Bawipa , an faate pawl cu rawl loin thi hai seh, ral kut in thi ko hai seh. Nunau pawl khal an pasal le an faate pawl in thihsan ṭheh hai seh. An pasal pawl cu nat in thi hai sehla an tlangval pawl tla raldonak ah thi ṭheh hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Rinlopi in an inn ram dingah miburpi thlah awla thinphang in au ciamco hai seh. Keimah tlaknak ah khur an lai ih keimah awk dingah thang an kam zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sikhalsehla maw Bawipa , in phiarnak le thah in tumnak cu na thei ṭheh ko. An ṭhatlonak cu ngaidam hlah aw; an sualnak khal thlahsak hlah aw. Na mithmuh ah sawnter hai awla na thinheng lai ah siatsuah ṭheh hai aw,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in tlak beel va lei dingah i fial. Upa hrekkhat pawl le puithiam upa deuh pawlkhat hruai aw i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hlamphei Kotka ihsin Hinnom Phairawn ih va feh dingah Bawipa in i sim. Cutawkah i simmi thu va phuang ding ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa in hiti in sim aw a ti: “Judah siangpahrang pawl le Jerusalem mi pawl, Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian Keimah ka sim mi hi ngaihnik uh. Hi hmun ahhin vansiat malmaknak nasa zetin ka thlenter ding ih a theitu hmuahhmuah mangbang in an um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi bangtuk thil cu ka thlenter ding, ziangahtile misenpi in in dungtun ih khuavang hnenah thawinak pek tahratin hi ram hi an baalter zo a si. Cuih khuavang pawl cu anmah le an pupa pawl in siseh, Judah siangpahrang in siseh, an theih dah lomi a si. Hi ram cu mawh nei lomi ih thisen in an khahter ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />an faate pawl cu thawinak meisa ih ur dingah Baal khuavang hrangah biakṭheng an dawl a si. Hi bangtuk tuah dingah thu ka pek dah lo; a ruah hman ka ruat dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah tikcu a ra thleng ding ih hi hmun cu Tofeth a si lole Hinnom Phairawn tiah an ti nawn lo ding. Cumi ai ah Mithahnak Phairawn ti a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hi hmun ahhin Judah mi le Jerusalem mi pawl ih tumtahnak cu ka phelhsolh ṭheh ding. An ral pawl cu nehtu ka siter ding ih an ral pawl in an that hai ding. An ruak cu vanih vate le leilungih ramsa ei dingah ka pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi khawpi parah a nasa zetmi siatsuahnak ka thlenter ding ih a kiangih a feh suksotu hmuahhmuah an mang a bang ngaingai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ral pawl in khawpi cu an kulh ding ih minung pawl cu thah an tum ding. Khawpi an kulh cu a nasa tuk ding ih khawsung um mipawl pakhat le pakhat an sa an ei-aw ding ih an fanu le an fapa pawl ih sa tiangin an ei ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in keimah thawn a feh tlangtu upa pawl ih mithmuh ah tlak beel cu khuai aw i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun an hnenah Cungnungbik Bawipa in, “Hi minung pawl le hi khawpi cu kom theih a si nawn lomi hi beel kuai bangtuk in ka khuai ṭheh ding. Mi pawl in an ruak cu Tofeth hmun ah an phum ding. Ziangah tile hmundang khui hmanah anmah phumnak a um lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hi khawpi le khawsung mi pawl cu Tofeth vekah ka tuah ding, tiah ka lo tiam cia a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jerusalem inn pawl, Judah siangpahrang ih inn pawl le inn dangdang, a tlunah arsi hnenah rimhmui an urnak le khawzing dang hnenih thawinak sabit an thletnak inn pawl hmuahhmuah cu Tofeth vekin a thiang lomi ah an cang ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa in a thusim dingih i thlahnak hmun Tofeth ihsin ka feh sal. Biakinn sungah ka ding ih misenpi hnenah a thu cu ka phuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in an hnenah, “Ka thlenter ding ka timi hremnak hmuahhmuah cu hi khawpi le a kiangkap khawte pawl parah ka thlenter ding; ziangahtile mi lungruh an si ih ka simmi an ngai duh lo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuih thu pawl ka phuanmi cu Biakinn uktu Immer fapa puithiam Pashhur in a theih tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />i vuak ih thir cikcin in i khih hnuah Biakinn sung tlunlam Benjamin Kotka kiangah i ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thaizing ah ka thir cikcin cu a phawih ih i thlah tikah a hnenah, “ Bawipa in Pashhur tiah hmin a lo sak lo. Hmin a lo pekmi ngaingai cu, ‘Khawzakip ah ṭihphannak,’ a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa amah rori in ‘Nang cu nangmah le na rualpi hrangah ṭihphannak ah ka lo tuah ding ih an ral pawl in nam thawn na rualpi an thah ṭheh kha na hmu ding. Judah mi hmuahhmuah cu Babilon siangpahrang kut thuaiah ka thlenter ṭheh ding. Anih in a hrekkhat cu a ram ah salah a hruai ding ih a hrekkhat cu a that ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi khawpi lennak hmuahhmuah, an sumsaw le an hlawnthil pawl, Judah siangpahrang ih thilri le hlawnthil tiangin an ral pawl in an long ding ih Babilon ah an fehpi ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule nang Pashhur, nangmah le na sungkhat pawl tla an lo kai ding ih Babilon ah an lo hruai ding. Cutawkah na thi ding ih voi tampi na bum rero ṭheumi na rualpi pawl thawn an lo phum ding,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa , nangmah in i bum ih, bummi ka rak si! Nang cu kei hnakin na cak ih i neh a si. Zokhal in hnihsuaksainak ah in hmang ih sun nihlawh in hnihsan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka ṭongtinte in au phah in, “Mivuaknak, Siatsuahnak,” tiah napi in ka au. Bawipa , mi in in sulhseek ih cat loin in nautat, Nangmah ih thu ka phuan ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sikhalsehla “ Bawipa cu ka hngilh thlang ding; A hmin in thu ka sim nawn lo ding,” ka ti tikah, Na thu cu meisa bangtuk in ka sungah a alh ciamco; Ka ruh sungah a ceeng a si; Daite ih um ka tum mengmang naón, ka umpi thei hrimhrim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi hmuahhmuah in a thupte in in rel, “Khawzakip ah ṭihphannak a um; Bawi upa hnenah hi pa ih thu hi ka sim ding,” an ti ka thei. Ka ngam zetmi ka rualpi pawl hman in ka tluk ding cu an hngakhlap a si. “Kan bum thei ko hmang ding, Kan kaih thei ahcun phu kan la ding,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asinain Bawipa , nang ka lamah na ṭang, Mi cak le mi maksak na si. Keimah i hremtu pawl cu an sung ding; Kumkhua mualpho in an um ding; Ziangtik hmanah an hlawhtling thei lo ding, An ningzahnak cu hngilh a si nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa , nang cun diktein mi na hniksak. Mi ruahnak le thinlung sungah, ziang a um ti na thei. Curuangah ka ral pawl parih phu na lak cu i hmuter hram aw. Ziangahtile ka thuhla cu na kut sungah ka lo pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa hnenah hlasak uh! Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh! Miṭha lo pawl kut sung ihsin, namnuaimi pawl a runsuak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka suah ni kha siatserh siseh! Ka nu ih i hrin ni cu hngilh hlo siseh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka pa a lungawitertu, Thuthang a rak keng ih, “Mipa a si! Fapa na nei!” a ra titu cu siatcamnak tong seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa in zaangfahnak nei loin, a siatsuahmi khawpi bangtuk siseh! Zinglam ah nat tuar aihramnak a theitu, Sun ah raldonak mumeek aw a theitu siseh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka suah thlak hlan ih i rak thah lo ruangah, Ka nu ih pum sung cu ka thlaan a rak si lo a sihi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ziangah so ka nu ih pum sung ihsin ka rak suah? Harsatnak le riahsiatnak tuar ih, Ningzak in ka nunnak ni liam dingah hin maw?
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah siangpahrang Zedekiah in Malkhiah fapa Pashhur le Maaseiah fapa puithiam Zefaniah cu ka hnenah a rak thlah ih hiti in in dil,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Kan ai ah Bawipa hnenah in ṭongsak aw. Ziangahtile Babilon siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar in a ralkap pawl thawn kan khawpi an kulh ṭheh a si. Bawipa in a hlanih a rak tuah ṭheu vekin mangbangza thil pakhatkhat tuah tahratin Nebuchadnezzar cu dungah a kirter tla a si thei men,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule Bawipa ih ṭong cu ka hnenah a thleng ih Zedekiah ih mi a rak thlah mi hnenah cun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa , Israel Pathian ih ṭong cu Zedekiah va sim dingin ka phuan. Bawipa in, “Zedekiah, Babilon siangpahrang le a ralkap pawl a dotu na ralkap pawl cu keimah in ka do ding ih ka neh ding. Na ralkap ih hriamnam pawl cu khawpi laifang ah ka peng ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangmah cu ka ban thacahnak hmuahhmuah le ka thinhengnak le ka ai-thoknak hmuahhmuah thawn ka lo do ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi khawpi sungih a ummi hmuahhmuah ka that ṭheh ding. Milai siseh, ramsa siseh, natsia in an thi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Asinain nangmah le na kut thuai bawi pawl cu, raldonak, paamnak le natnak ihsin a luattu mipi pawl thawn nangmah thah a lo duhtu siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar le na ral pawl ka lo kaiter ding ih Nebuchadnezzar in a lo that ding. Zohman a lo zuah lo ding. Zaangfahnak le zawnruahnak zianghman nan parah a nei lo ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule mipi hnenih sim dingah Bawipa in i fial, “Ngai uh, keimah Bawipa in hril dingmi pahnih ka lo pek: Nunnak lamzin le thihnak lamzin an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi khawpi sungah a ummi cu raldonak ah an thi ding. Asilole rawl loin le natnak in an thi ding. Asinain hi khawpi a do rerotu Babilon mi hnenah feh tahratin kan sung tiih a va pe-awtu cu an lo that lo ding; a nunnak tal cu a luat ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi khawpi cu zuah lo dingah ka ruatcat zo; ka siatsuah ding a si. Babilon siangpahrang hnenah pek a si ding ih ciamko in a ur ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa in David tesinfa Judah siangpahrang ih innsang ah va sim dingin hiti in i sim: “Keimah Bawipa ih ka sim mi hi ngaihnik uh! Nitinte thudik in thu rel uh. An bum ih an namnuai rero mipa cu a namnuaitu kut ihsin hum uh. Cutiih nan tuah lo a si ahcun thilsual nan tuahmi hin ka thinhengnak cu meisa bangin a alhter ding ih zohman in an hmit thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jerusalem, nang cu phairawn tlun hmun saang ah na to, hmunrawn lakih a saangmi lungto bangin. Asinain nangmah ka lo do ding. ‘Zohman in in do thei lo ding ih ṭanṭhat ka khuarnak hmun ahcun zohman an lut thei lo ding,’ na ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sikhalsehla na thil tuahmi ruangah ka lo hrem ding. Na inn ṭhaṭha cu meisa ih ka ur ding ih a kiangkap ziang hmuahhmuah a kaang ṭheh ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in David tesinfa Judah siangpahrang ih inn ah va feh in siangpahrang le a kut thuai bawl pawl le Jerusalem mipawl hnenah a thu simmi ngai dingin va sim aw, i ti. Bawipa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keimah Bawipa in thu ka lo pek a si: thil nan tuahmi hi dingthluk lairelnak le diknak thawn tuah uh. An bum reromi cu a bumtu kut ihsin hum uh. Ramdang mi siseh, farah ngakṭah le nuhmei pawl tisiat hlah uh. Hi hmun thianghlim ahhin mawh nei lo milai that hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka thupekmi vekih nan tuah ngaingai a si ahcun David tesinfa pawl sangpahrang an si ringring ko ding. Annih cu an kut thuai bawi pawl le an minung pawl thawn hi siangpahrang inn ih kotta sungin rang le rangleng thawn an suak an lut ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Asinan ka thupekmi nan thlun lo a si ahcun, siatserh in ka lo kam, hi siangpahrang inn cu innrop ah a cang ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka hrangah Judah siangpahrang ih inn cu Gilead ram le Lebanon Tlang bangin a mawi a si. Sikhalsehla zohman um duh lonak hmunṭhing ah ka tuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A siatsuahtu dingah mi ka thlah. An hreitlung an keng ih a mawi zetmi sidar ṭhuam pawl cu an hau ding ih meisa sungah an paih ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Neh hnuah ramdangmi tampi hilam an rat tikah ziangahso Bawipa in hi a nasa zetmi khawpi parah hivek in a tuah? tiah an sut ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah an Pathian thawn an tuahmi thukamnak an dungtun ih khawzing dangdang an rian ruangah a si, tiah an ti ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judah mipawl, siangpahrang Josiah cu ṭah hlah uh. A thih ruangah nan riahsia hlah uh. Asinan a fapa Joahaz hrangah napi in ṭap uh. Amah cu an hruaihlo dingih a kir nawn lo ding. A suahnak ram a hmu nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa in Judah siangpahrang a cangtu, a pa Josiah ai a awhtu Joahaz thu ah hitin a sim, “Anih cu hitawk ihsin a feh zo ih a ra kir sal nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An hruainak ram ah a thi ding ih hi ram cu a hmu nawn lo ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dinlonak in a inn a saktu le, Nawhthuh ei-nakin a inn a kauh sintu, Zianghman pek loin a ram minung hna a ṭuantertu le Hlawhman zianghman a pe lotu cu a lamzin a pit a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Inn ṭhazet ka sak ding ih, Tlunta khan ah khan tum zetzet ka tuah ding,” a titu cu an lamzin a pit a si. Cutiin sangkate a tuah ih a sung thuah cu sidar thing in a tuah. Cuih hnuah sisen a hnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Siangpahrang ṭhadeuh na si cuang maw? Sidar thing in inn na sa ih, midang inn hnakin a ṭhatdeuh hmanah. Na pa cu mi sanṭha zet a si. Miding le midik a si. A tuahmi hmuahhmuah ah a hlawhtling.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi farah ih thu khal diktein a rel sak. A lamzin a tluang a si. Bawipa theih ti cu cumicu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Asinan nang cun nangmah ih hlawknak lawng na hmu. Mawh nei lo milai na that ih, na minung pawl nasazetin na hrem a si. Bawipa in a sim zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa in Judah siangpahrang Josiah ih fapa Jehoiakim thu cu hitin a ṭong, “A thih ah zohman an ṭap lo ding; ‘Maw ka u, maw ka nau,’ tiah zohman an ṭap lo ding. ‘Maw ka Bawipa , ka siangpahrang,’ tiah zohman mitthli tla in an ṭap lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Laak a thih ih an phum tluk fang a si ding. A ruak cu an hnuk ding ih, Jerusalem kotka lengah an va hlon ding,” a ti. Jerusalem Thuhla Jeremiah Simmi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Maw Jerusalem mipawl, Lebanon ram ah feh uhla au uh; Bashan ram ah feh uhla ai uh, Moab ram tlangpar ihsin ko uh; ziangahtile a lo ṭanpitu le a lo duhtu ram hmuahhmuah, ral an sung ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi neinung nan si laiah, Bawipa in thu a lo sim; Asinan nan rak ngai duh lo. Nan nunsung cuti ringring nan si. Bawipa ih thu cu nan thlun duh dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nan hotu pawl cu thlipi in a sem hlo ding. A lo ṭanpitu pawl cu ral kaihmi an si ṭheh ding. Nan khawpi ningzak le mualpho in a um ding; nan thil sual tuahmi ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lebanon ihsin a rami sidar thing lakah thlangam zetin na cawl. Asinan nunau nau nei nat tuar bangin na hrangah a nazet ding, zaangfakza na si ding, Natnak ih a lo tlak tikah cun! Jehoiakhin Parih Pathian Thuṭhennak
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bawipa in Judah siangpahrang Jehoiakim ih fapa siangpahrang Jehoiakhin hnenah, “A nungmi Pathian ka si vek hin, ka vorhlam ih hminkhennak zunghruk na si hmanah ka lo phuak ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />nangmah thah a lo duhtu, na ṭih zetmi pawl hnenah ka lo pe ding. Babilon siangpahrang Nebukhadnezzer le a ralkap pawl hnenah ka lo pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Saltaannak ram ah nangmah cu na nu thawn ka lo dawi hlo ding. Nan suahnak ram a si lomi ah nan nufa in nan feh ding ih cutawkah nan pahnih in nan thi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hi ram hi na ngaizet ding, asinan na kir nawn lo ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kei in, “Siangpahrang Jehoiakhin cu a kuaimi beel, zohman ih an duh nawn lomi beel vekah maw a cang zo? Curuangah maw amah le a faate pawl an theih dah lomi saltannak ram ah hruaihlo an si?” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Maw leilung, leilung, leilung, Bawipa ih ṭongmi hi ngaihnik!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Hipa cu a faate pawl hloral dingih ruahcia mi a si. Ziangtik hmanah hlawhtling lo dingmi a si. A tesinfa pawl sungin David ai-awhtu le, Judah ram a uktu ah zohman an um lo ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa ih thuṭhennak cu a minung pawl a siatsuahtu le a ṭhekdarhtu tuukhal pawl parah ziangtluk ṭihnungza so a si ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A minung ṭhateih a kilkhawitu dingih retmi tuukhal pawl hnenah Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in hiti in a ti, “Ka minung pawl ṭhatein nan kilkhawi lo; nan ṭhekdarh ih nan dawihlo ṭheh hai a si. Hi thilsual nan tuah ruangah ka lo hrem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A taangsun ka minung pawl cu ka ṭhekdarhnak ram ihsin ka ko khawm ding ih an khua le an ram ah ka kirter ding. Faate tampi an nei ding ih an karhzai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuih tlunah anmah kilkhawitu dingah tuukhal pawl ka ret ding. Ka minung pawl cu anmah in an khal ding ih ṭihphang le awloksong in an um nawn lo ding ih ka hrem nawn hai lo ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun Bawipa in, “David tesinfa sungin a felmi pakhat siangpahrang ih ka hril tikcu a ra thleng ding. Cuih siangpahrang in fimnak thawn hi ram hi a uk ding ih a dingmi le a dikmi lawnglawng a tuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Siangpahrang a can tikah Judah mipawl cu himte in an um ding ih Israel mipawl cu hnangam zetin daihnak thawn an um ding. Amah cu ‘ Bawipa kan Rundamnak ’ tiin kawh a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tikcu a ra thleng ding ih ‘Izipt ram ihsin Israel a hruaisuaktu a nungmi Pathian ih hmin in,’ tiah siat an ser nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />‘Cu-ai ah saklam ram le a minung a ṭhekdarhnak ram pawl ihsin Israel mi a hruai kirtu a nungmi Pathian ih hmin in,’ tiah siat an ser sawn ding. Cuticun anmah ih ram sungah an um ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka thinlung a kuai ṭheh, Tha nei loin ka ṭhia rero; Bawipa ruangah, a thu thianghlim ruangah a si. Zuri vek ka si, sabit tam tuk a in mi vek ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi ram cu rintlak lo minung in an khat; Bawipa ih hmaiah hlawhhlang hlir an si. An nuncan a ṭha lo ih an thuneih nak an hmang sual. Bawipa in siat a serh ruangah hi ram cu mithi ngai in a um; Hram hring hmuahhmuah khal an caar ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Profet le puithiam pawl cu Pathian an thei lo. Biakinnpi sung rori ah thilsual an tuah ka kai zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An thlunmi lamzin cu a naal ding ih a thim ding; Ka bahter ding ih ka tlukter ding. An parah siatralnak ka thlengter ding. Anmah hrem tikcu a ra ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Samaria ih profet pawl an sual zia ka hmu zo; Baal khawzing hmin in an ṭong ih, ka minung pawl an hruaisual zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Jerusalem ih profet pawl cu cu hnakin an sual a luar. Ṭaangṭawm sualnak an tuah ih thuphan an per; Sual tuah dingah midang an bawm. Curuangah thil ṭha lo tuah cu, zohman in thlah an tum lo. Ka mithmuh ah an zatein Sodom bangtuk an si; Khawsung mi pawl cu Gomorrah mi bangtuk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Curuangah Jerusalem profet pawl thu ah Cungnungbik Bawipa in hiti in a sim, An ei dingah a khaami hanghnah ka pe ding ih, an in dingah thihsii ka pe ding. Ziangahtile Pathian theih duh lonak thinlung hi ram pumpi ah an khahter zo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in Jerusalem mi pawl hnenah, “Profet pawl ih thusimmi cu ngai hlah uh; thuphan hlir an sim ih a dik lomi ruahsannak an lo pek. Ka hmurka suak ṭongkam si loin anmah ih ruahnak meen an lo sim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka thu sim a ngai duh lomi pawl hnenah ziang hmuahhmuah a ṭha ṭheh ko ding tiah an sim ringring. Mi lungruh pawl hnen khalah siatralnak a thleng dah lo ding an ti,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kei in, “Hi profet pawl lakah zohman in Bawipa ih ruahnak thup cu an thei lo. Anmah lakah zohman in Bawipa ih thusimmi pawl an hna khal in an thei lo, an thinlung khal in an thei thiam lo; a simmi khal an ngai lo ih an poisa fawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A thinhengnak cu thlisia le thlipi vek a si ih miṭha lo pawl ih lu parah a huuk ciamco ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cule tuah a tummi hmuahhmuah a tuah ṭheh hlan lo cu a reh dah lo ding. Hmailam tikcu ah hi thu cu a minung pawl in an thei fiang leh ding,” tiah ka sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Hi profet pawl hi ka thlahmi an si lo naón an feh. Thusim ding ka pe lo naón ka hmin in thu an sim thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka thuthup ruahmi pawl rak thei hai sehla ka minung pawl hnenah ka thu pawl an sim ding ih an nuncan ṭha lo le an thilsual tuahmi pawl hi an tlansan zo ding nan!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Keimah cu hmun khat lawngih a ummi si loin khuazakip ih a ummi Pathian ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka hmuh thei lonak tiangih a relh theitu zohman an um lo. Lei le van khuazakip ih ka um hi nan thei lo maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka mang ah Pathian thusimmi ka thei tiah ka hmin in thuphan a pertu profet pawl ih ṭong pawl ka thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Anmah ih phuahcopmi thuphan in ka minung pawl cu ziangtik tiang so an hruai sual hrih ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An pu le an pa pawl in in hngilh ih Baal khawzing hnenih an tlan vekin an mang thu an relnak in ka minung pawl cun keimah in hngilh dingah an ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mang a neitu profet in a mang cu simsehla, ka thusimmi a theitu profet khal cun ka thu cu felzetin an hnen ah simseh. Fanghii cu fangfai thawn tahṭhim tlak a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka thu cu meisa bangtuk a si ih lungto a khuai ṭhehtu sobul bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pakhat le pakhat ih ṭongkam ruk tahrat in Bawipa ih ṭongkam a si tiah thu a simtu profet pawl cu ka dodal a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Anmah pumpak ṭong khal Bawipa ih ṭong a si ti tahrat in thu a simtu profet khal ka dodal a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Keimah Bawipa ih ka ṭongmi hi ngai uh! Thuphan hlir in mang thu a reltu profet pawl cu ka do a si. An mang an sim ih an thuphan le an puarthaunak in ka minung pawl an hruaisual a si. Ka thlahmi an si lo, feh dingah thu ka pekmi khal an si lo. Mipi hrangah ṭhathnemnak zianghman an nei lo. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Bawipa in ka hnenah, “Jeremiah, ka minung lakah pakhatkhat in siseh, profet a si lole puithiam pakhatkhat in siseh, thu a lo sut ih ‘ Bawipa ih thu cu ziangso a si?’ a lo ti ahcun an hnenah ‘Nanmah hi Bawipa hrangah thilrit nan si ih a lo hlonhlo ding,’ tiah ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka minung lakah pakhatkhat in siseh, profet a si lole puithiam pakhatkhat in siseh, ‘ Bawipa ih thilrit,’ timi ṭongfang a hman ahcun amah le a innsang zate in ka hrem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cutiih si loin zokhal in a rualpi pawl le a sungkhat pawl hnen ah, ‘ Bawipa in ziangtinso a lo let? Bawipa in ziangso a ṭong?’ tiah sut sawn seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cuticun ziangtik hman ah, ‘ Bawipa ih thilrit,’ ti ṭongkam an hmang nawn lo pei. An hman a si ahcun an hrangah ka thu cu an thilrit taktak ah ka tuah ding. Hi minung pawl in a nungmi Pathian, Cungnungbik Bawipa , an Pathian ih ṭongkam cu phun dang in an mer ih a pingpeng ah an pialter thluh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jeremiah, profet pawl cu ‘ Bawipa in ziangtinso a lo let? Bawipa in ziangso a ṭong?’ tiah sut awla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />ka thupekmi an thlun duh lo ih ‘ Bawipa ih thilrit,’ ti ṭongkam an hman thotho a si ahcun fiangtein sim hai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Annih cu ka coihsuak ding ih an pupa pawl le anmah hnenih ka pekmi an khawpi siseh, anmah khal siseh, ka hnen ihsin lamhlapi ah ka hlonhlo hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />An parah ziangtik hman ih hngilh a si dah lo dingmi ningzahnak le mualphonak ka thlenter ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Biakinn hmai ih retmi theipi rah bawm hnih i hmuh. Cumi cu Babilon siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar in Jehoiakim ih fapa Judah siangpahrang Jehoiakhin kha Jerusalem ihsin Babilon ah Judah ram hotu pawl, soser thiam le zungthiam pawl thawn hmunkhat ah salkaihmi ah a hruaisuak hnuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawm pakhatnak sungah rah tir bangtuk a hminmi thei ṭha an um; a dang bawm sungah cun thei ṭha lo, ei tlak lo theipi rah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa in ka hnenah, “Jeremiah, ziangso na hmuh?” tiah i sut. “Theipi rah ka hmu. A ṭhami cu an ṭha zet; a siami cu an sia ngaingai, ei tlak hman an si lo,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Keimah Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in Babilon ih an hruaihlo mipawl cu hi theipi rah ṭha vekih ka ruahmi an si; Curuangah an parah zaangfahnak ka nei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ṭhatein ka zoh ding ih hi ram ah ka kirpi sal ding. Ka balmi si loin ka sakmi an si ding. Ka phawimi si loin ka phunmi an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa ka si hi an theih duhnak ding thinlung ka pe ding. Cuticun ka minung an si ding ih kei cu an Pathian ka si ding. Ziangahtile an thinlung zate thawn ka hnenah an kir ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Sikhalsehla Judah siangpahrang Zedekiah le a kut thuai bawi upa pawl le Jerusalem mipawl cu, hi ram sungih a ummi siseh, Izipt ram ih a tlanmi siseh, keimah Bawipa in hi theipi rah ṭha lo, a sia tuk ih ei tlak lo a si mi theipi vek hin ka tuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An parah siatralnak nasa zetin ka thlenter ding ih leilung tlun miphun hmuahhmuah an thin a phang ṭheh ding. Mi in capohnak ah le hnihsuahsainak ah an hmang ding. An nautat ding ih an hmin cu ka ṭhekdarhnak hmunkip ah siatserh awknak ah an hmang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An pupa pawl le anmah hnenih ka pekmi ram sungah hin pakhat hman taang nawn lo tiangin an cemfai hlan lo an parah raldonak, paamnak le natnak ka thlenter ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah fapa Jehoiakim cu Judah siangpahrang a sinak kum linak ah Judah mipawl hmuahhmuah hrangah Bawipa ih ṭong cu ka hnenah a ra thleng. Himi cu Nebuchadnezzar in Babilon siangpahrang a ṭuan kum khatnak ah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cule Judah mi le Jerusalem mipawl hmuahhmuah hnenah hiti in ka sim:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Amon fapa Josiah cu Judah siangpahrang a ṭuan kum hleithumnak in tuihsun tiang, kum kul hluan thum sung, Bawipa ih thu cu ka hnenah a ra ih a simmi pawl nan hnenah sim sal loin ka um dah lo. Asinain zianghman ah nan siar lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa in a siahhlawh profet pawl a run thlah ringring hmanah an thu nan ngai cuang lo ih zianghman ah nan siar cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa in nan pupa pawl le nanmah hnenah hi ram cu kumkhua nan ta si dingin a lo pek. Hi ram ih nan um thei ringringnak dingah nan nuncan ṭha lo le thilsual nan tuahmi pawl hi tlansan dingah hi profet pawl in an lo sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khuavang biak lo le rian lo dingah siseh, nan tuahcopmi milem biaknak in Bawipa thinhengter lo dingah siseh, an lo sim a si. Bawipa ih thu rak thlun uh cila a lo hrem hrimhrim lo ding nan!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Atu ahcun Bawipa amah rori in a thu nan thlun duh lonak cu a sim a si. Cucingin milem pawl nan tuahnak in a thin nan hengter ih a lo hremnak cu nan parah nanmahte nan thlenter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Cuih a thu nan ngai duh lo ruangah Cungnungbik Bawipa in hiti in a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />‘Saklam ram ih mi hmuahhmuah le ka siahhlawh Babilon siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar ka ko ding. Cule Judah le a ramsung um mi hmuahhmuah le an kiangkap ram pawl ka doter ding. Hi ram le a kiangkap ram pawl ka siatsuahter ding ih kumkhua in hnawmpen ah kan canter ding. Zoh mawi lo le ṭihnungza ah an cang ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lungawi ih an au an khuannak thawmvang le mo neih puai ih an thawmvang cu ka dai reprepter ding. An mei inn hrangah zinan an nei lo ding ih rawl khal a um nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hi ram pumpi cu zoh tlak loin a siat ṭheh ding ih mi an mang a bang ding. A kiangkap ram pawl in Babilon siangpahrang cu kum sawmsarih sung an rian ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Babilon le a siangpahrang cu an sual man ah ka hrem ding. Khi ram cu ka siatsuah ding ih kumkhua hnawmpen ah ka cangter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jeremiah hnen ih ka sim ciami, miphun tampi parah ka thlengter ding ka timi hremnak, hi cauk sungih khummi vansiat malmaknak hmuahhmuah pawl thawn Babilon cu ka hrem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An thilsual tuahmi man ah Babilon mi parah phu ka la ding ih miphun tampi le siangpahrang maksak zetzet pawl in salah an zuat ding,’ a ti,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in ka hnenah, “hittawk ah ka thinhengnak in a khatmi sabitti khuat khat a um. Ka lo thlahnak miphun hmuahhmuah hnenah feh awla inter hai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An in tikah an sawn ding ih mi aa ah an cang ding; raldonak an hnenih ka thlenter ding ruangah,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Curuangah cuih khuat cu Bawipa ih kut ihsin ka lak ih i thlahnak miphun hnenah ka feh ih ka inter hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jerusalem le Judah ram khua pawl, an siangpahrang le an hotu pawl thawn ka inter. Cuticun nelrawn ram ṭhing, tuksumza le zoh tlak lo ram ah an cang ding ih, mi in tuihsan tiang in an hmin cu siatserhnak ah an hmang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cuih khuat ihsin a intu ding ram pawl cu a thuailam pawl hi an si: Izipt siangpahrang, a kut thuai bawi pawl le hotu pawl; Izipt mi pawl le Izipt ram ih a um mi ramdang mi pawl; Uz ramih siangpahrang hmuahhmuah; Filistin ramih khua pawl Ashkelon, Gaza, Ekron le a rung taangmi Ashdod khua ih siangpahrang pawl, Edom, Moab le Ammon ram mi hmuahhmuah; ṭai-ar le Sidon siangpahrang hmuahhmuah; Mediterranean tikulh ih siangpahrang hmuahhmuah; Dedan, Tema le Buz khua pawl; An sam tawizet ih a meet thluhtu pawl; Arabia ram siangpahrang hmuahhmuah; Nelrawn ram miphun ih siangpahrang pawl; Zimri, Elam le Media siangpahrang pawl; Saklam ram siangpahrang pawl; A hla a nai ti um loin pakhat hnu pakhat an in ciar ding. Leilung tlun miphun hmuahhmuah in an in ding. Netabik ah Babilon siangpahrang in a in ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in ka hnenah, “Miseenpi hnenah sim aw; Keimah Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in, an rit ih an luak lai hlan lo, an sawn ih tho thei loih an um lai hlan lo, an in ding in thu ka pek a si. Ziangahtile an hnenah raldonak ka thlengter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cuih khuat cu na kut ihsin la duh loin an um ih an in duh lo a si le Cungnungbik Bawipa in, nan in tengteng a ṭul a ti tiah sim aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Siatsuahnak cu keimah ih khawpi ihsin ka thok ding. Hremnak tong lo ih luat dingah an ruat-aw maw si? An luat lo ding, hrem an si ṭheh ding. Leilung mi hmuahhmuah hnenah raldonak ka thlengter ding. Keimah Cungnungbik Bawipa in ka sim zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Jeremiah, hi ka simmi hmuahhmuah hi nangmah in na phuang ṭheh ding. Himi pawl cu hiti in na sim ding, ‘ Bawipa cu van ihsin a hruum ding, Vansang bik ihsin khawri bangin a hruum durdo ding. A minung pawl parah nasa zetin a hruum ding; Sabit sawrtu pa bangin a au ding. Leilung tlun mi hmuahhmuah in an thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A thawm cu vanhramdeng tiang a khawk ding. Bawipa cun miphun hmuahhmuah parah an mawhnak thurel ding a nei. Zozo khal an thu a rel ding. Misual pawl cu a that hai ding. Bawipa in a sim zo,’ ti aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in “Ram khat hnu ram khat ah siatralnak a thleng ding; vanhramdeng ah thlipi a tho ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Bawipa ih a thah mi pawl ih ruak cu khat lam vanhramdeng ihsin khatlam vanhramdeng tiang an darh-aw thluh ding. Zohman in an ṭah lo ding; ruak tuamtu nei lo le phumtu nei lo an si ding. Leilung parah eekdawm bangin an ril teptep ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Maw nannih hotu pawl, ka minung a khaaltu pawl, ṭap uhla napi in ai uh. Mithi ngai in ṭap uhla leivut lakah lawng rero uh. Nan thihnak tikcu a ra thleng zo ih tuu bangin thah nan si ding. Bungbeel bangin nan tlakuai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nan luat theinak lamzin a um lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ṭap uhla vansaanglam in au uh, ziangahtile Bawipa cun a thinheng in nan miphun a siatsuah zo ih a daizet le a himzetmi nan ram cu hnawmpen ah a cangter zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kiosa in a kua a tlansan vekin Bawipa in a minung pawl a tlansan zo a si. Tuksumza raldonak le Bawipa ih thinhengnak in hi ram cu thlaler ramṭhingah a tuah zo a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah fapa Jehoiakim Judah siangpahrang a can hnu reilote ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa ih ṭong cu ka hnenah a ra thleng ih, “Biakinn sungah ding awla, Judah ram khawpi pawl ihsin cutawkah Pathian biak dingih a rami hnenah phuang dingih ka lo timi hmuahhmuah cu phuang aw. Hrelh mi um loin sim ṭheh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na simmi an ngai ih an nuncan ṭha lomi an ṭhin tla a si thei men. An ṭhin ngaingai a si ahcun an thilsual tuahmi ruangah an parih siatsuahnak thlenter ding ka tummi cu tum loin ka um sal ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule misenpi hnenih sim dingah Bawipa ih ṭong cu ka hnenah a ra ih, “Keimah Bawipa in ka lo sim zo: Ka thu in ngai a si ahcun ka lo zirhmi pawl thlun uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />nan hnenih ka thlah ringring ṭheumi profet pawl ih ṭong kha ngai uh. An thu hi nan ngai dah lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An thu nan ngai duh lo thotho a si le Shiloh parih ka tuah vekin hi Biakinnpi parah ka tuah ding ih leilung tlun miphun hmuahhmuah in hi khawpi hmun cu siatserhnak ah an hmang ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Biakinnpi sungih cuti ka simmi cu puithiam pawl, profet pawl le a ra mi hmuahhmuah in an thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa in sim dingih thu i pekmi hmuahhmuah ka sim ṭheh vete in annih in in kai ih a thah in tum, “Hi vekih na sim ruangah thah tlak na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi Biakinnpi hi Shiloh vekah a cang ding, hi khawpi hi siatsuah ṭheh a si ding, a sungah zohman an um lo ding, tiah ziangah so na ti?” tiah in ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cuih thu cu Judah hotu pawl in an theih tikah siangpahrang inn ihsin Biakinn ah an ra tlan ih Kotka Thar ah an ra to.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Puithiam le profet pawl in hotu pawl le misenpi hnenah cun, “Hi pa cu thah tlak a si. Ziangahtile kan khawpi a simsiat a si. Nan hna in nan theihmi a si ko,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule kei in, “Hi Biakinnpi le hi khawpi ka relsiatnak hmuahhmuah cu, Bawipa in sim dingah i fial ih ka simmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nan nundaan nan thleng ding le nan thil tuahzia nan ṭhin ding cu a ṭul hrimhrim a si. Bawipa nan Pathian thu nan ngai pei. Cutiih nan tuah asile nan parih siatsuahnak thlenter a tummi cu a ṭulsal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei sawh cu nan kut sungah ka um a si. A dik a ṭha nan ti vekin ka parah tuah ko uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sikhalsehla thil pakhat cu thei cia uh. In that ngaingai a si ahcun nanmah le hi khawpi sung mipawl cu mawh nei lo nan thah ruangah mi mawh nan si ding. Ziangahtile hi ralrinnak lo petu dingah i thlah tu cu Bawipa a si,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cutikah hotu pawl le mipi pawl in puithiam le profet pawl hnenah cun, “Hi pa hi thah ding a si lo; Pathian kan Bawipa hmin in kan hnenah a ṭong a si,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cuih hnuah upa hrekkhat pawl an ding ih mipi hnenah cun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Moresheth khua mi profet Mikah in Hezekiah, Judah siangpahrang a si laiah mipi hnenah Cungnungbik Bawipa ih ṭong mi hiti in a sim: ‘Zion cu lo vekin thlawh a si ding. Jerusalem cu khawrop ah a cang ding ih Biakinn dinnak tlang cu tupi ah a cang ding,’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Siangpahrang Hezekiah le Judah mipawl in cutiih a sim ruangah Mikah cu an that lo. Hezekiah in Bawipa cu a upat ih zaangfah a dil sawn a si lo maw? Cule Bawipa in a thin a suup ih thlenter a tummi siatralnak cu a ṭulsal a si. Kannih cu atu-ah ṭihnungza siatralnak kan parah kan thlenter zik a si hi!” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cule mi pakhat a hminah Uriah an timi, Kiriath Jearim khua Shemaiah ih fapa cu Bawipa hmin in hi miphun le hi khawpi Jeremiah bangin a relsiattu a um ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Uriah ṭong cu siangpahrang Jehoiakim le a ralkap pawl le bawi upa pawl in an theih tikah siangpahrang in thah a tum. Asinain Uriah in a theih tikah a ṭih ih Izipt ram ah a tlan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sikhalsehla siangpahrang Jehoiakim in Akbor fapa Elnathan le midang pawl Uriah vung kai dingah Izipt ram ah a thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An kai ih siangpahrang Jehoiakim hnenah an hruai. Siangpahrang cun a that ih a ruak cu misenpi phumnak thlaanmual ah a hlon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Asinain kei cu Shafan fapa Ahikam ih ṭanpi mi ka si ruangah thah dingah misenpi kut sungah i pe lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah ih fapa Zedekiah cu Judah siangpahrang a can vete in Bawipa ih ṭong ka hnenah a thleng ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />saphaw le thinghrolh in caw-kawn tuah tahratin ka hngawng ih bat dingah i fial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa in Jerusalem ah siangpahrang Zedekiah tong dingin a rami palai pawl Edom ram, Moab ram, Ammon ram, ṭai-ar le Sidon ram ihsin rampalai a rami pawl hnen ihsin an ram siangpahrang hnen ciarih thucah dingah i sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An siangpahrang ciar va sim dingah Cungnungbik Bawipa Israel ih Pathian in hiti in thu i pek a si:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“A makzetmi ka huham le ka cahnak in leilung pumpi le minung le leilung ih a nungmi ramsa hmuahhmuah hi ka seemsuah a si; cu pawl cu ka pek duhmi hnenah ka pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka siahhlawh Babilon siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar kut tangih miphun hmuahhmuah a retu cu keimah ka si; hramlak ramsa hman amah riantu ah ka pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Miphun hmuahhmuah in amah cu an rian ding ih a fapa le a fasuan pawl tiangin, a miphun a ṭumsuk caan a kim hlan tiang, an rian ringring ding. Cuih hnuah a miphun in miphun dang pawl le a cakmi siangpahrang pawl an rian leh ve ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Sikhalsehla ram ramkhat khat siseh, uknak pakhatkhat siseh, a uknak thuai ih um an duh lo a si ahcun cuih miphun cu raldonak le paamnak le natnak in ka hrem ding ih a netnak ah a siat thluhtertu dingah Nebuchadnezzar cu thu ka pek ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nan profet pawl siseh, zovek khal siseh, hmailam thil a cang dingmi ka sim thei a titu cu zum hlah uh. Mang in siseh, mithi thlarau ko tahratin siseh, kut ṭial zohnak in siseh, ka thei a titu cu va zum hlah uh. An zatein Babilon siangpahrang kut sungih pe-aw lo ding in an lo sim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An lo bum a si; nan ram ihsin lam hlapi ih hruaisuak nan sinak dingah a ṭangtu cu anmah an si ding. Ka lo dawihlo ding ih siatsuah ṭheh nan si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sikhalsehla miphun pakhatkhat in Babilon siangpahrang kut sung ah a pe-aw ih a rian a si ahcun amah ih ram sungah ka umter ding; amah ih ram ah a um ding ih amah ih ram cu a thlo ding a si. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cuvek ṭhiamṭhiam in Judah siangpahrang Zedekiah hnen khal ah ka sim: “Babilon siangpahrang kut thuaiah um aw. Amah le a minung pawl rian awla na nung ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ziangah so nangmah le na minung pawl cu raldonak le rawl loin le natnak in nan thih ding? Babilon siangpahrang kut thuai ih a um lo mi pawl raldonak le paamnak le natnak in an thi ding, tiah Bawipa in a sim zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Babilon siangpahrang kut thuai um lo dingih a lo simtu profet pawl ih thu cu zum hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi profet pawl cu, ka thlahmi an si lo ih ka hmin in mi bumtu lawng an si, tiah amah Bawipa rori in a ti zo. Curuangah a lo dawihlo ding ih nangmah siseh, hi thuphan pertu profet pawl siseh, thahnak nan tuar ding a si,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cule puithiam pawl le misenpi hnenah Bawipa ih ṭong cu hiti in ka sim: “Babilon ihsin Biakinn thilri bungbeel pawl a ra thleng cing ding a lo titu profet pawl cu zum hlah uh. An lo bum a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An thu ngai hlah uh. Babilon siangpahrang kut thuaiah um uhla nan nung ding. Hi khawpi cu ziangah so khawrop ah nan canter duh rero?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Profet ngaingai an si ih Cungnungbik Bawipa keimah ih thu an hnen ih a um taktak asile Biakinn sungih a um laimi thilri le siangpahrang inn ih a ummi sumsaw pawl cu Babilon ih thiarhlo lo dingah ka hnenah i dil hai seh,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar in Babilon ah Judah siangpahrang, Jehoiakim ih fapa Jehoiakhin le Judah ram upa le Jerusalem khawsung upa pawl a hruaihlo tikah Biakinn ṭhuam pawl, daar tikuang le a tonak leng pawl, le Biakinn thilri hrekkhat pawl cu a taanta a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian keimah in Biakinn sung le Jerusalem siangpahrang inn ih a taang hrihmi thilri thu ka sim mi hi ngai uh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Babilon ah an thiar ṭheh ding ih keimah in tawk ka ti hlan lo cuih Babilon khua-ah cun a um ding. Cuih hnuah keimah in ka kirpi ding ih hi hmun ah ka ret sal ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuih kum, Zedekiah ih siangpahrang a ṭuannak kum linak, thla nga thla ah Gibeon khua mi Azzur ih fapa profet Hananiah in Biakinnpi sungah thu i sim. Puithiam pawl le misenpi theihhngan ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel Pathian ih ṭong cu hiti in i sim: “Babilon siangpahrang ih cahnak huham cu ka khiak ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kum hnih sungah siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar in Babilon ih a thiarhlo ṭhehmi Biakinn thilri bungbeel pawl cu ka kirpi ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Babilon ah salih kaihmi Judah siangpahrang, Jehoiakim ih fapa Jehoiakhin cu Judah mipawl thawn hmunkhat ah ka hruai kir ding. Asi, Babilon siangpahrang ih cahnak cu ka khiak ṭheh ding a si. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah puithiam pawl le Biakinn sungih a dingmi misenpi theihhngan ahcun Hananiah hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“A si ngai; Bawipa in cuticun tuah hram seh! Sal ih kaihmi mi hmuahhmuah pawl le an thiarhlo mi Biakinn thilri pawl cu na sim vekin va kim ngaingai sehla hi ram ah kirpi ṭheh si hai sehla ka va duh so!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sikhalsehla na hnenah le misenpi hnenih ka ṭongmi hi ngaihnik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hmaisa profet pawl, nang le kei hlan ih thu a rak simtu profet pawl cun miphun tampi parah le a makzetmi siangpahrang uknak parah raldonak, paamnak le natnak a thleng ding a si, tiah an rak sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Asinain daihnak le remnak a um ding, tiih a simtu profet cu a thusimmi a kim ngaingai lawngah Bawipa ih thlahmi profet a si, tiah an ti ding,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cule Hananiah in ka hngawng ih bah-mi cawkawn cu a lak ih a khiak ṭheh hnuah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />mipi theihhngan ahcun, “Siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar in miphun tampi hngawng parih a bah-mi cu hi bangtuk in ka khiak ding a si, tiah Bawipa in a ti. Kum hnih sungah a tuahsuak ding a si,” a ti. Cule ka fehsanta!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Bawipa in ka hnen ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hananiah hnenah feh ih hiti ih va sim dingah i fial: “ Bawipa in thing ih tuahmi cawkawn cu na khiak thei ngai men ding; a sinan cu-aiah thirkawn ka tuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian cun hi miphun pawl parah thirkawn ka thlaih ding ih Babilon siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar an rian ding. Keimah Bawipa in hramlak ramsa tiang in Nebuchadnezzar riantu ah ka tuah ding, a ti,” tiah ka sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cuticun Hananiah ka sim ih hiti in ka beet fawn, “Ngaihnik, Hananiah! Nang cu Bawipa ih thlahmi na si lo. Himi pawl in thuphan zum dingah na forh rero hai a si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa in nangmah hi tisiat dingin Bawipa amah rori in a sim zo. Bawipa dodal dingah misenpi hnenih na ṭong ruangah tuih kum a cem hlanah na thi ding,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hananiah cu cuih kum thla sarih thla ah a thi ngaingai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem ihsin Babilon ah Nebuchadnezzar in sal ih a hruaimi lakih hotu pawl, puithiam pawl, profet pawl le midang dang pawl hnenah Jeremiah ih ca nganmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hi ca cu siangpahrang Jehoiakhin le a nu, siangpahrang inn ih bawi le upa pawl, Judah ram hotu le Jerusalem khawsung upa pawl, zungthiam le sodeng pawl saltaannak hmun ah hruaihlo an si hnu ih a nganmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi ca cu Babilon siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar hnenah Judah siangpahrang Zedekiah ih a thlahmi Shafan fapa Elasah le Hilkiah fapa Gemariah kut in a kuatmi a si. A ca sungah cun:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in Jerusalem ihsin Babilon ah Nebuchadnezzar a hruaitermi misenpi pawl hnenah hiti in a sim:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘Hmun luah uhla inn tla ṭhatein sak uhla um uh. Hmuan tuah uhla nan cinmi ei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nupi ṭhi uhla faate tla nei uh. Nan faate pawl tla nupi ṭhi hai sehla faate nei ve hai seh. Ṭumsuk loin nan ṭhangso sawn pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thawngtla in ka lo fehternak khawpi ih ṭhatnak hrangah hnaṭuan uh. Ka hnenah an hrangah thlacam sak uh. Ziangahtile an ṭhangso ih mi neinung an si ahcun nannih khal mi neinung nan si ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keimah Bawipa Israel ih Pathian in ralrinnak ka lo pek a si. Nan lakih a ummi profet pawl in siseh, hmailam thu ka thei a titu midang dang khal in siseh, lo bum hlah hai seh. Mang an man mi tla zianghman ah va siar hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Annih cu ka hmin ih thuphan pertu an si. Ka thlahmi an si lo. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“ Bawipa in, ‘Babilon ram ih nan umnak kum sawmsarih a kim tikah nan parah seherhnak ka nei ding ih nan khua le nan ram ah kirter sal dingih ka lo tiammi vekin ka kimter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nan hrangih tumtahnak ka neihmi cu keimah lawngin ka thei. Tumtahnak ka neihmi cu siatralnak si loin mi neinung nan sinak dingah a si; cuih tumtahnak cu nan ruahsannak le nan hmailam hrang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutikah keimah in ko ding. Ka hnenah ra in thla nan cam tikah ka lo theihsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In hawl ding ih in hmu ding. Nan thinlung takte ih in hawl tikah cun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Asi, in hmu ding ih nan khua le nan ram ah ka lo kirter ding, tiah ka lo sim a si. Khuakip le ramkip ih ka lo ṭhekdarhnak ihsin ka lo finkhawm hai ding ih sal nan taan hlanih nan rak umnak ram ahcun ka lo hruaikir ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“ Bawipa in Babilon ah profet pawl in pek, tiah nan ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />David in a rak ukmi ram a uktu siangpahrang le hi khawpi sungih a ummi, nanmah vekin sal ih hruaihlo a si lomi nan sungkhat pawl ih thu ah Bawipa ih ṭongkam hi ngai hnik uh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in ‘Raldonak le paamnak le natnak an parah ka thlenter ding ih ei ṭha loih a ṭawtmi theipi bangin ka tuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Raldonak, paamnak le natnak thawn ka thlun ding ih cumicu leilung tlun miphun tampi in an hmuh tikah an tuk a sumzet ding. Ka ṭhekdarhnak ram kipih mipawl in an parih a thlengmi thil an hmuh tikah mangbang le ṭihphang in an um ding. Mi in hnihsuahsainak ah an hmang ding ih an hmin cu mi siatcamnak ah an hmang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An hnenah cat loin keimah riantu profet pawl hnen ihsin ka thu cu ka thlenter ringring naón an ngai duh lo ruangah hi bangtuk ih an tuarnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Babilon ih ka lo kuatmi nan zatein keimah Bawipa ih ka sim mi hi ngaihnik uh,’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in, nan hnenah amah hmin ih thuphan a rel rerotu Kolaiah ih fapa Ahab le Maaseiah ih fapa Zedekiah thu ah simmi a nei zo. Annih cu Babilon siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar kut ah ka pe ding ih nan mithmuh rori ah a that ding, a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jerusalem ihsin Babilon ih hruaimi sal kaihmi pawl in mi pakhatkhat an cam duh tikah, ‘Babilon siangpahrang in an nungcung in a kiomi Zedekiah le Ahab vekin Bawipa in lo tuahseh,’ an ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cubangtuk in an tuar ding, ziangahtile thilsual an tuah. Mi nupi le mi pasal parah an sual ih Bawipa ih hmin in thuphan an per ruangah a si. Cumi cu Bawipa ih duh lomi an si. An tuahmi hmuahhmuah a thei ṭheh ih amah cu an sualnak ah thu theitu a si. Bawipa in a sim zo,” tiah a ngan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in Nehelam mi Shemaiah hnen ih thu sim dingah i fial. Shemaiah in Jerusalem mi le Maaseiah ih fapa puithiam Zefaniah le puithiam dangdang hnenah amah ih hmin in ca a kuat. A cakuat sungah cun Shemaiah in Zefaniah hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“ Bawipa in Jehoiada ai ah puithiam ah a lo tuah zo ih atu-ah Biakinn sungih bawi tum bikah na cang zo. Curuangah mi aa asinain profet a ṭuanter awmi hmuahhmuah thir cikcin in an hngawng khit ṭheh aw; cumi cu na ṭuanvo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ziangah so mipi hnenah profet ṭong ih a ṭong rerotu Anathoth khuami Jeremiah kha cuvekin na tuah lo?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Reipi awhter nawn ding a si lo. Ziangahtile Babilon ih minung pawl cu cutawkah reipi sal ah nan taang ding. Inn nan sak pei, nan um pei. Hmuan nan tuah pei ih nan cinmi rawl nan ei pei, a titu cu amah a si,” tiah ca a kuat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cuih ca cu Zefaniah in ka hnenah a siar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in ka hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Shemaiah thu thawn peh aw in Babilon ih sal taangmi hmuahhmuah hnenah hiti ih thucah dingin i sim, “Keimah Bawipa in Shemaiah le a tesinfa hmuahhmuah cu ka hrem ding. Amah cu ka thlah mi a si lo naón nan hnenah profet ngai vekin a ṭong ih a lo bum a si. Nanmah lakah tesinfa pakhat hman a nei lo ding. Ka minung pawl hrangih thil ṭha ka tuah ding mi cu a hmu man nawn lo ding. Ziangahtile keimah dodal dingah ka minung pawl a forh a si. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in ka hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka lo simmi hmuahhmuah hi cabu sungah ngan ṭheh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ziangahtile ka minung Israel le Judah mipawl ka kirter salnak tikcu a ra thleng ding. An pupa pawl hnenih ka rak pekmi ram ah ka kirter sal ding ih anmah ih ta a si sal ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa in Israel le Judah mi hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“ṭihphannak aw thawm ka thei, daihnak a si lo; Thinphang ih aunak aw thawm a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cawlta uhla ruathnik uh! Mipa in faate a hring thei pei maw? Ziangah so nunau nau neizik bangin, mipa pawl in an pum an dom awk rero? Ziangah so an hmai tla a raam thluh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ṭihnung le tuksumza ni a ra thleng ding. Cuvek ni cu a um dah keel lo; Ka minung hrangah awloksongnak ni a si. Asinain an tuar thei suak ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in, “Cuih ni a thlen tikah an hngawng ih caw-kawn cu ka khiak ṭheh ding ih an thir cikcin cu ka hlon ṭheh ding. Ramdangmi salah an cang nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keimah Bawipa an Pathian hi in rian ding ih siangpahrang ih ka tuah dingmi David tesinfa kha an rian sawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Ka minung pawl, ṭih hlah uh; Israel mi pawl phang hlah uh. Ram hlapi ihsin ka lo run ding, sal nan taannak ram ihsin. Nan ram ah nan kirsal ding ih, thlangamte in nan um sal ding. Himzetin nan um ding ih nan thla a ṭeem lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nan hnenah ka ra ding ih ka lo hum ding. Ka lo ṭhekdarhnak ram cu ka siatsuah ding. Asinain nannih cu ka lo tisiat lo ding. Lo hrem loin ka um lo ding; Asinain ka lo hrem tikah dingthluk lairelnak thawn ka tuah ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa in a minung pawl hnenah, “Nan hma hi a dam thei lo ding; Nan hriamhma hi a besia ngaingai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A lo tuamhlawmtu zohman an um lo, Nan hma hnih dingah sii a um fawn lo. Nan damnak dingah beiseinak a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A lo ngaitu pawl in an lo hngilh ṭheh zo. An lo poisa nawn lo. Ral vekin ka lo tuah; Hremnak nan tuarmi hi a nazet. Ziangahtile nan sualnak a tam ih, nan ṭhatlonak hi a nasa ngaingai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nan hriamhma ruangah phunzai nawn hlah uh; Nan damnak ding a um lo. Hiti vekin ka lo hrem, ziangahtile nan sualnak a tam ih, nan ṭhatlonak hi a nasat tuk ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sikhalsehla tu cun a rak lo dolhtu pawl kha, dolh ṭheh an si ve thung ding. Nan ral pawl kha ral kaihmi ah an cang ding. A rak lo hmuhsuamtu pawl kha, hmuhsuam an si ve ding. A rak lo ramtu pawl kha ram an si ve thlang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka lo harhdamter sal ding, Nan hma pawl cu ka damter ding; Nan ral pawl in, ‘Zion cu hnonmi le khaak mi a si; Zohman in ziangah an siar lo,’ an ti hmanah, Keimah Bawipa in ka ṭong zo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Ka minung pawl cu, An ramah ka kirter ding ih, An innsang kipah zaangfahnak ka nei ding. Jerusalem cu saksaal a si ding ih, A siangpahrang inn cu dinter sal a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cutawkih a ummi pawl cun, thangṭhatnak hla an sa ding; lungawi in an au ding. Thlawsuah ka pek ding ih an zai ciamco ding. Ka malsawmnak ruangah upatnak an ngah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khuahlan ih an rak neihmi nauhak bangin an nei sal ding. An khua le ram cu hngetzet in ka dinter sal ding. Anmah a hmuhsuamtu cu ka hrem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anmah uktu cu anmah ih miphun sungin a suak ding. An siangpahrang fapa cu anmah ih miphun a si ding. Cupa cun ka kawh tikah i naih ding. Zoso kawh locun a ra ngam ding? Annih cu ka minung an si ding ih, Kei hi an Pathian ka si ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bawipa ih thinhengnak cu thlipi vek a si. A huuk reromi thlipi vek a si ih misual pawl ih lu tlun ah a huuk ding. Tuah a tummi a tuah thluh hlan lo a reh lo ding. Hi thu cu a ra dingmi tikcu ah a minung pawl in fiangtein an thei ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in hiti in a sim, “Israel miphun hmuahhmuah ih Pathian ka si can a ra thleng ding ih annih cu ka minung an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nelrawn ah thihnak ihsin a luatmi pawl hnenah zaangfahnak ka langter. Israel mipawl in colhnak an duh tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />lam hlapi ihsin an hnenah ka lang. Maw Israel mipawl, ka duhdawt ciami nan si ih nan parah duhdawtnak cu cat loin ka nei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thar in ka lo dinter ding. Nan khuangte nan lak ding ih lungawi in nan lam sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Samaria tlang ah sabit hmuan nan tuah sal ding ih hmuan sungih a suakmi cu a phuntu nanmah in nan ei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asi, ralvengtu pawl in Efraim tlangpar ihsin ‘Zion ah feh uhsi; Bawipa kan Pathian hnenah cun,’ tiih an au-nak tikcu a ra thleng ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Israel hrangah lungawinak thawn au uh; Miphun lakih miphun tumbik hrangah cun! ‘ Bawipa in a minung a run zo. A taangsun mipawl a hum zo a si,’ tiah thangṭhatnak hla sa uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Saklam ihsin ka run hruai hai ding. Vanhram deng ihsin ka finkhawm ding. Mitcaw le ke-awl pawl thawn an ra ding. Nunau favun le fahring zik pawl thawn. An ra kirsal tikah cun miphun tumpi an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka minung pawl cu ṭap phah in an kir ding. Ka hruaikir ding, thlacam phah in; Tidai luannak hmunah ka khor hai ding; An bah lonak ding lamzin tluang ihsin. Israel hrangah cun pa ka si; Efraim cu ka fapa upa bik a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Maw miphun pawl, i ngai uhla, ka thu cu tipikap hlatzet ah phuang uh. Ka minung pawl ka ṭhekdarh hai, a sinan ka finkhawm sal ding. Ka khor hai ding, tuukhal in a tuu a khor vekin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu ka luatter zo; A cak zetmi miphun kut sungin ka run zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An ra ding ih Zion tlang ah, lungawi in hla an sa ding. Ka ṭhatnak ruangah an ai a puang ding; Rawl le sabit le olif hriak ruangah, Tuu le caw pawl ka laksawng ruangah cun! Khop zetih tidai toihmi hmuan an bang ding. An ṭulmi hmuahhmuah an nei ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Fala pawl an lung a awi ding ih an laam ding; Mipa pawl khal, mino mitar ti loin, an lung a nuam ding. Ka hneem hai ding ih an mithi ngainak cu lungawinak ah ka thleng ding. An riahsiatnak cu an aipuannak ah ka tuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Puithiam pawl ih pum cu, rawl ṭha bik in ka puarter ding. Ka minung pawl ih duhmi cu ka kimter ṭheh ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Ramah khawsung in aw a thang; ṭahnak le aihramnak aw a si; Rachel in a faate pawl a ṭah, An thih ṭheh ruangah a ṭap ih Leem khal a theih nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ṭap nawn loin suup awla, na mitthli cu hnul thlang aw. Na faate pawl hrangih na tuahmi pawl hi ṭuanman laksawng ngah loin na um lo ding. Ral ram ihsin an ra kir ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na hmailam hrangah ruahsannak a um; Na faate pawl an ra kir ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Israel mi pawl riahsia in an ṭong ka thei: ‘ Bawipa , hrem hrih lomi ṭilva kan bang; Asinain nang in na thu thlun daan in zirh. In kirter sal hram aw; Na hnenah kan kir sal ko ding; Kan Bawipa le kan Pathian!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Na hnen ihsin hmun dangah kan pial, a sinan kir sal kan duh. In hrem hnu ahcun riahsia in kan lu kan kun; Ningzak le mualpho in kan um; Kan no laiih kan rak sual ruangah a si,’ an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Maw Israel, nang cu ka fapa duh na si; Ka duh bikmi fa na si. Na hmin ka sim tinin duhdawtnak thawn ka lo ruat. Ka thinlung hi nangmah lo cun a um thei lo; Zaangfahnak na hnenah ka nei ringring ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lamzin parah hminsinnak le khihhmuhnak tuah awla, Na fehnak lamzin hlun kha hun hawl kir sal aw. Maw Israel mipawl, ra kir sal uh, Nan fehsanmi khua pawl ah ra tlung sal uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Maw rintlak lo minung pawl, Ziangtik tiangso ṭhukṭhun in nan um hrih ding? Thil thar le thil phundang ka seemsuah zo; Thil thar le thil phundang a si zia cu, Nunau in mipa a humhim ding, ti tlukin a dang a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in, “An saltaannak ihsin an ram ih ka hruai kir tikah Judah ram le a khua pawl ahcun, ‘ Bawipa in Jerusalem tlang thiang cu thluasuahnak pe hram seh, Amah a umnak hmun thianghlim hi,’ tiah an ti sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Judah ram le a khua pawl ah mi an um ding; lothlo pawl tla an um ding ih tuukhal pawl khal an tuurual thawn an um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tha bang mipawl an tha ka tlunter ding ih rawl loih a ṭamsawl mipawl rawl ka khopter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cuticun mi pawl in, ‘Ka itthat ih tha-tlung zetin ka ṭhang,’ an ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Keimah Bawipa in ka sim a si: can a ra thleng ding ih Israel ram le Judah ram cu minung le ṭilva in ka khahter sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka mithmuh ah keimah in ka phawisuak, ka balṭheh, ka hlonhlo, ka siatsuah ih vansiat malmaknak ka thlenter vekin atu khalah ka mithmuh ah ka phun sal ding ih ka din sal hai ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cuih tikcu a thlen tikah cun mi pawl in, ‘An nu le an pa in sabit thur an ei, Asinain an faate pawl ih ha a ṭim,’ an ti nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zokhal sisehla sabit thur a eitu cu amah ih ha a ṭim ding. Zokhal sisehla amah ih sual ruangah thihnak a tong ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Israel mi le Judah mipawl thawn thukamnak thar ka tuahnak tikcu a ra thleng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />An pu le an pa pawl Izipt ram ihsin an kut in ka hruaisuak lai ih anmah thawn thukamnak ka tuahmi thukam hlun bangtuk cu a si lo ding. An pasal bangtuk ka si naón annih in cuih thukamnak cu an thlun lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Israel mi thawn ka tuah dingmi thukamnak cu hi bangtuk in a si ding: Ka daan cu an sungmuril ah ka ret ding ih an thinlung parah ka ngan ding. Kei hi an Pathian ka si ding ih annih cu ka minung an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Zohman pakhat le pakhat - an innhnen siseh, an unau siseh - Bawipa thei dingih an zirh awk le an sim awk a ṭul nawn lo ding. Ziangahtile a tum a seen in, an zate in an thei ṭheh ding a si. An sualnak ka ngaidam ding ih an mawhnak ka ciing nawn lo ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Bawipa in sun vangtertu ah ni a tuah, Zan engtertu ah thlapi le arsi a tuah. Tifinriat a thoter ih a huuk ciamco, A hmin cu Cungnungbik Bawipa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Lei le van, ni le thla a um sung ahcun, Israel miphun khal a um ve ding, tiah Bawipa in thu a kam zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Nikhat khat ah tlunlam van khi, A sum tah theih va sisehla, Leilung ih hram khi zawt theih va sisehla, Culawngah Israel miphun hi a hnong ding, An thil tuah sualmi pawl ruangah. Bawipa in a sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Jerusalem cu a pumpi in ka khawpi ah dinsal a sinak tikcu a ra thleng ding. Hananel Inndonsang ihsin kulhnak nitlak lam Kotka Kel tiang remsal ṭheh a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Khawpi ramri cu cutawk ihsin nitlaknak lamah Gareb tlang tiang, cule a kimvel in Goab tiang a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Mithi phumnak le hnawm an hlonnak phairawn a pumpi in le Kidron Tiva kuam tlun ih ram hmuahhmuah, nisuahnak lam ah Rang Kotka tiang, a zatein ka hrangah hmun thianghlim a si ding. Khawpi cu ziangtik hmanah bal le siatsuah a si nawn lo ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in, Zedekiah ih Judah siangpahrang a ṭuan kum hranak ah ka hnenah thu a sim. Cuih kum cu Nebuchadnezzar Babilon siangpahrang a sinak kum hleiriatnak kum a si ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cuih kum ah Babilon siangpahrang ralkap pawl in Jerusalem an do ih kei cu siangpahrang inn kiltu pawl khaan pakhat sungah in kharh khum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Siangpahrang Zedekiah in cutawkah thawng ah i thlak ih i thlaknak thu cu ‘ Bawipa ih ṭongmi na phuan ruangah,’ i ti. Bawipa cun hiti in a sim, “Babilon siangpahrang hi khawpi hi ka lakter ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />siangpahrang Zedekiah khal a luat lo ding. Babilon siangpahrang kut sungah pek a si ding. Hmaiton in an hmu aw ding ih pumpak in an bia aw ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zedekiah cu Babilon ah hruaihlo a si ding ih a thu ka rel hlan lo cutawkah a um ding. Babilon mipawl a do khalle a hlawhtling lo ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa in thu i sim ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ka paseu Shallum ih fapa Hanamel cu ka hnenah a ra ding ih Benjamin ram sung Anathoth khua ih a lo cu keimah lei dingah i ra tong ding; ziangahtile a sungte lakah a nai bik ka si ih keimah ih hrangah a lei theitu ding ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule Bawipa ih i sim ṭheh vete in Hanamel cu ka umnak khaan sungah a ra ih lo lei dingah i ra fial. Curuangah Bawipa in ka hnenih a ṭongmi hi a dik a si, ti ka thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hanamel hnen ihsin lo cu ka lei ih tangka cu a cuai kan thlai. A man cu ngun tangka in hleisarih man a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lungkimnak cakhen kan tuah ih ka hmin ka ngan. Thu theihpitu kan ko ih tangka cu cuai in kan thlai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lo leinak cakhen cu pahnih in kan tuah. Pakhat cu tacik khenmi a si ih a dang pakhat cu tacik khen lomi a si. Keimah ih hrangah a pahnih in ka lak ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maiseiah ih fa sin Neriah fapa Baruk hnenah ka pek. Hanamel mithmuh ah le lo leinak hmin ngantu le thutheitu pawl le cuih khaan sungih a tomi pawl mithmuh ah Baruk hnenah cun ka pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An zate hmaiah Baruk hnenah cun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in hi lo leinak cakhen hi kum reipi tiang hlolote ih a umnak dingah tacik khenmi siseh, khen lomi khal siseh, kum reipi siat lo dingin tlak beel sungah ṭhateih ret dingah thu a lo pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in inn le lo le sabit hmuan pawl tla hi ram sungah lei sal a si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lo leinak cakhen cu Baruk hnenih ka pek hnuah thla ka cam:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“A lian bik Bawipa , lei le van hi na cahnak le na huham in na tuah. Na hrangah a har tukmi zianghman a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Minung siar cawk lo parah a hmunmi na duhdawtnak na langter zo, a sinan an nu le an pa sualnak ruangah mi na hrem fawn. Nang cu a maksakmi le a nasa zetmi Pathian na si; nang cu Cungnungbik Bawipa na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang cu thil ruat thiamtu, mangbang za thil tuahtu na si. Minung tuah mi hmuahhmuah na hmu ṭheh ih an hnaṭuan vekin laksawng na pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kum reipi laiah Izipt ram ah thil khawruahhar le thil mangbangza na tuah ih tuihsun tiangin Israel mi lakah siseh, mi phundang dang lakah siseh, na tuah ringring lai. Curuangah khuazakip ah na hmin a thang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thil khawruah har le thil mangbangza na tuahmi in kan ral pawl a ṭihter ih na huham le na cahnak hmang in Israel mipawl cu Izipt ram ihsin na suah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hi ram cawhnawi le khuaitizu a luannak ram hi an pupa pawl hnenih na kam cia vekin an hnenah na pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sikhalsehla hi ram sung an thlen ih an luah tikah na thukham an thlun lo; na thuzirhmi vekin an nung fawn lo. An tuah dingih na thupekmi hmuahhmuah zianghman an tuah lo. Curuangah hi bangtuk siatsuahnak cu an parah na thlenter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Babilon mipawl in an khawpi la dingah a lenglam ihsin leilung an khahsilh ih an do ciamco. Raldonak le paamnak le natnak in hi khawpi cu an kut sungah a thlenter ding. Na ṭong mi hmuahhmuah a kim thluh a si ti cu na hmu ṭheh ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Asinain, Maw Cungnungbik Bawipa , Babilon mipawl in hi khawpi an lak zik thlang naón thu theihpitu pawl hmuhhngan ah lo lei dingah thu i pek fawn,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in ka hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Keimah cu Bawipa ka si, mi hmuahhmuah ih Pathian ka si. Ka hrangah zianghman a harmi a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hi khawpi cu Babilon siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar le a ralkap pawl kut ah ka pe ding; an lak ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />meisa in an ur ding. Himi pawl in an inn parah Baal khawzing hnenah rimhmui an ur ih khuavang dangdang hnenah sabitti an pek ih an toih ruangah ka thin in hengter. Hi mi pawl cu an inn pawl thawn ciam ko in an ur ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />An thuanthu hramthok pek ihsin Israel mi le Judah mi pawl in ka thin in tok ih an thil tuahmi hmuahhmuah in ka thin in hengter zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hi khawpi sung mi pawl in hi khawpi an din thok ni ihsin ka thin in hengter. Siatsuah dingah ka ruat cat zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ziangahtile Judah mi le Jerusalem mipawl in an siangpahrang le an hotu pawl, an puithiam le an profet pawl thawn thil sualral an tuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />An dung in tun ih ka zirh rero hai naón zianghman an ngai lo, a zir khal an zir duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Fihnungza a si mi an milem pawl hman cu keimah biaknak hrangih sakmi Biakinn sungah an ret ih an balter zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />An fanu le an fapa pawl Molek khawzing hnenih raithawinak ih pe dingah Baal khawzing hnenah Hinnom phairawn ah biakṭheng an dawl. Cuvek ih tuah dingah thu ka pek lo; cuvekin an tuah ding ih Judah mipawl an sualter ding ti cu a ruah hman ka ruah dah lomi a si,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Bawipa Israel ih Pathian in ka hnenah, “Jeremiah, raldonak le paamnak le natnak in hi khawpi cu Babilon siangpahrang kut ah a thlengter ding, tiah hi mipawl in an ti. Atuih ka ṭong ding mi hi ngai hrihhnik!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka thinhengnak le ka ai-thawhnak ruangih ram tampi ih ka ṭhekdarhnak ihsin anmah cu ka finkhawm hai ding; hi ram ahhin ka kirter sal ding ih hnangamte in an um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Annih cu ka minung an si ding ih kei hi an Pathian ka si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />An nunnak ah tumtahmi thil pakhat lawng ka pe ding: anmah ṭhatnak le an tesinfa pawl ṭhatnak hrangah kumkhua in keimah cu upatnak in pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Anmah thawn kumkhua hrang in thukamnak ka tuah ding. An hrangih thil ṭha tuah cu ka bang dah lo ding; an thinlung zate thawn keimah in ṭihzah dingah ka tuah ding ih cuticun ka hnen ihsin an pial nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />An hrangih thil ṭha tuah cu nuam ka ti ding ih hi ram ahhin kumkhua in ka hmunter hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“An parah thil poimawh ka thlenter zo bangin an hnenih thil ṭha ka kam ciami pawl cu ka thlenter vivo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Mi pawl in hi ram cu nelrawn bangtuk, minung le ramsa um lonak ram ah a cang ding ih Babilon mipawl ih kut ah pek a si ding tiah an sim. Sikhalsehla hi ram ah lo le leiram pawl lei sal ciamco an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Mi pawl in lo an lei ding, an lei awknak cakhen cu hmin an ngan ding, tacik an khen ding ih thu theihpitu khal an um ding. Hi bangtuk cu Benjamin ram sungah le Jerusalem kiangkap khawte pawl ah, Judah ram khawsung ah le tlangpar ram khua pawl ah, tlanghram ram ah le Judah ram thlanglam ram sung khalah an tuah ding. Mi pawl cu an ram sungah ka umter sal ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siangpahrang inn kiltu pawl khaan sungih thawng ka tlak lai ahcun Bawipa ih thu cu a voihnihnak ka hnenah a thleng sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leilung a siamtu, a tuahtu le a umnak hmun ih a dintu Bawipa in ka hnenah a sim. A hmin ah Bawipa a si mi cun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“I ko awla ka lo let ding. Na theih lomi thil khawruahhar le mangbangza ka lo sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa keimah, Israel ih Pathian in Jerusalem inn pawl le Judah ram siangpahrang inn cu ral in an kulh ih an do ciamco ruangah a cim ṭheh ding tiah ka sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mihrek cun Babilon mi pawl cu an do ve ding; a sinan annih in ka thinhengnak le ka ai-thawhnak in ka siatsuah tummi pawl ih ruak thawn inn pawl cu an khahter ding. Himi pawl in thilsual an tuah ruangah hi khawpi cu ka dungtun zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sikhalsehla hi khawpi le a minung pawl cu ka damter sal ding ih ka harh ververter ding. An hnenah hnangamnak le daihnak tlamtling in ka thlenter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Judah le Israel cu ka ṭhansoter ding ih a hlan vekin ka dinter sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An sualnak le ka parih an mawhnak pawl cu ka kholhfai ding ih an sualnak le ral an thawhnak cu ka ngaithiam ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jerusalem cu ka hrangah lungawinak, hmaihngalnak le uannak hrampi a si ding. Jerusalem mipawl hrangah thil ṭha ka tuahmi le hi khawpi hrangih ṭhansonak ka thlentermi cu leilungtlun miphun pawl in an theih tikah an ṭih ding ih an khur rero ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Mi in hi hmun cu nelrawn ram vek a si, milai siseh ramsa siseh an um lo tiah an ti. Asi, an dik a si. Judah khua pawl le Jerusalem khawsung lamzin pawl cu an ṭhing reprep ngai a si. Minung le ramsa zianghman an um lo. Sikhalsehla hi hmun pawl ahhin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />lungawi aipuannak thawng le mocan puai ih awn-au thawmvang nan thei sal ding. Mi pawl in ka Biakinn ah lungawi thawinak pe dingah hlasak phah ih an rat nan thei ding. Annih in, ‘Cungnungbik Bawipa hnenah lungawinak pe uh, Ziangahtile amah cu a ṭha; a duhdawtnak cu kumkhua in a hmun,’ an ti ding. Hi ram cu a hlan vekin ka ṭhansoter ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in, “Hi ram nelrawn a bangmi le minung le ramsa an um lonak ram hi ṭilva tlannak ram a cang sal ding ih cunah tuukhal pawl in an tuu an khal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tlangpar ram ih khua pawl, tlanghram ram le Judah ram thlanglam ah, Benjamin ram sung le Jerusalem kiangkap khawfate te ah le Judah ram khua pawl ah tuukhal pawl in an tuu an siar ciamco sal ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Israel le Judah mi hnenih ka thukammi ka kimternak tikcu a ra thleng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cutikah an siangpahrang ah David ih tesinfa mifel pakhat ka hril ding. Cuih siangpahrang in hi ram sungah hin thil dik le thil ding a tuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Judah mi le Jerusalem mipawl cu runsuak an si ding ih hnangam zetin an um ding. Hi khawpi cu, ‘ Bawipa kan Rundamnak,’ ti a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel siangpahrang cu David tesinfa a si ringring ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Keimah riantu le mei-ur thawinak petu le sangphut le thawinak dangdang petu dingah Levi phun sungin puithiam an ṭuan ringring ding, tiah keimah Bawipa in thu ka kam a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bawipa in ka hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Sun le zan cu anmah tikcute ih um ringring dingah anmah thawn thukamnak ka tuah zo. Cuih thukamnak cu bal theih a si nawnlo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cuvek thotho in a tesinfa pawl in siangpahrang ṭuan ringring ding in ka sal pa David thawn thukamnak ka tuah ih keimah riantu si ringring ding in Levi phun puithiam pawl thawn thukamnak ka tuah zo; hi thukamnak pawl cu bal theih a si nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka sal pa David ih tesinfa pawl le Levi phun puithiam pawl cu ka karhzaiter ciamco ding ih, van ih arsi le tifinriat kap vunnel siar cawk lo an si bangin siar cawk lo an sive ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bawipa in ka hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Hi mipawl in ka hril ciami innsang pahnih Israel le Judah hi a hnong zo a si, tiah an rel rero hi na thei zo maw? Cule ka minung Israel le Judah mipawl cu an nautat ih miphun hmanah an siar nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Asinain keimah Bawipa in sun le zan thawn thukamnak ka tuah ih lei le van an umzia uktu dingah daan khal ka tuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hi thil pawl a tuahtu ka si vekin Jakob ih tesinfa pawl le i riantu David thawn ka tuahmi thukamnak cu ka hmunter ding. Abraham, Isaak le Jakob ih tesinfa pawl uktu ah David ih tesinfa pakhatkhat ka hril ding. Ka minung pawl parah zaangfahnak ka nei ding ih mi neinungzet ka siter sal hai ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babilon siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar le a ralkap pawl le a kut thuai ih a ummi miphun hmuahhmuah pawl ih ralkap pawl in Jerusalem le a kiangkap khua pawl an do rero laiah Bawipa ih thu cu ka hnenah a rung thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in Judah siangpahrang Zedekiah hnenah feh tahratin hiti in va sim dingah i fial, “Keimah Bawipa in hi khua cu Babilon siangpahrang kutah ka pe ding ih a nih in ciam ko in a ur ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na luat lo ding; kaih na si ding ih Babilon siangpahrang kut ah pek na si ding. Hmaiton in amah cu na hmu ding ih nan bia aw ding; cule Babilon ah na feh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zedekiah, na hnenih ka ṭongmi hi ngaihnik! Raldonak ahcun na thi lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Daite in na thi ding; na hlan ih siangpahrang a cangmi na pu le na pa pawl an thih ih an phum tikah rimhmui an ur bangin na hrang khalah rimhmui an ur ve ding. An lo ṭah ding ih, ‘Kan siangpahrang a thi ee,’ an ti ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cuih thu cu Babilon siangpahrang ralkap pawl in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem khua an do rero laiah siangpahrang Zedekiah cu ka sim. Babilon ralkap pawl cun Lakhish le Azekah khua khal an do ciamco; hi khua pahnih cu a taangsun ralhruang kulhmi Judah khawpi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siangpahrang Zedekiah le Jerusalem mipawl in zohman in kanmah ih miphun Israel mi lala cu sal ah kan zua nawn lo pei;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hebru sal pawl cu nunau siseh, mipa siseh luatter ṭheh an si pei, tiah lungkimnak an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mipi pawl le an hotu pawl an zatein an lung a kim ih an sal pawl thlah thluh ih sal ih kaih sal nawn lo dingin an lung a kim ṭheh a si. An lungkimnak vekin an thlah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asinain an lung an thleng sal ih an kaih sal ih sal ah an tuah sal ṭheh lala.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel ih Pathian ṭong cu mipi hnenih sim dingah ka hnenah a thleng: “Izipt ram saltaannak ihsin nan pupa pawl ka runsuak ih ka luatter tikah anmah thawn thukamnak ka tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hebru sal kum ruk a lo riantu an um tikah a kum sarihnak ahcun nan luatter ding, tiah ka sim. Asinain nan pupa pawl cun ka thu in thlun lo, ka simmi khal an ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Naite ah nan thinlung nan thleng ih ka lung i awitertu thil nan tuah. Nan zatein nan phunpi Israel sal pawl cu thlah ṭheh dingah nan lung a kim ih, keimah in biaknak Biakinn sungah ka mithmuh ah thukamnak nan tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nan lung nan thleng lala ih ka thangsiatnak thil nan tuah lala. Nan zatein an duh vekih nan thlah ciami sal pawl cu nan kaih sal ih sal ah nan tuah lala.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Curuangah keimah Bawipa in ka thu nan thlun lo a si, tiah ka lo ti. Nan phunpi Israel mipawl cu nan luatter lo. A ṭha, nannih tla luatnak ka lo pe ding: Raldonak le paamnak le natnak in duhduh ih thih theinak ka lo pe ding. Nan parih ka tuahmi in leilung tlun miphun hmuahhmuah tuksum ko in a tuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Judah ram le Jerusalem khawsung bawi pawl, siangpahrang inn ih bawi pawl, puithiam pawl le hotu hmuahhmuah in cawcang pakhat an that ih a laifang in an seu ih cuih caw ruang ṭhen hnih karlak ih feh tahratin keimah thawn thukamnak an tuah. Sikhalsehla cuih thukamnak cu an bal ih thlun ding an timi khal an thlun lo. Curuangah cawcang parih an tuah vekin himi pawl parah ka tuah ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Anmah thah a hiar zettu an ral pawl hnenah ka pe ding ih an ruak pawl cu vate le ramsa in an ei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Judah siangpahrang Zedekiah le a kut thuai bawi pawl tla anmah thah a duhtu pawl hnenah ka pe ding. Nanmah do lo in a cawltu Babilon ralkap pawl ih kut ah ka pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cuih ralkap hnenah thu ka pe ding ih hi khawpi ah an ra kir sal ding. An do ding, an neh ding ih an ur ciam ding. Judah khua pawl cu zohman um lonak nelrawn vekah ka tuah ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah ih fapa Jehoiakim cu Judah siangpahrang a si laiah Bawipa in ka hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Rekhab miphun pawl ih innsang hmuahhmuah ah va feh awla thu va sim aw. Biakinn sungih a khaan pakhatkhat sungah rak hruai awla sabitti pe hai aw,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Curuangah Rekhab hrin pawl, Habazziniah ih fapa Jeremiah dang ih fapa Jaazaniah le a unau pawl le a fapa pawl cu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Biakinn ah ka hruai. Igdaliah ih fapa profet Hanan ih dungthlun tu pawl ih khaan ah ka umter hai. Hi khaan cu Biakinn ih thuneitu bawi a si mi Shallum ih fapa Maaseiah khaan tlunah a si ih bawi dangdang pawl ih khaan kiangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule khuat le pakan kuum khat in sabitti Rekhab mipawl hmai ahcun ka ret ih, “Sabitti in uh,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asinain annih in, “Sabitti kan in lo. Kan pu Rekhab ih fapa Jonadab in kanmah siseh kan tesinfa pawl siseh sabitti nan in hrimhrim lo pei in ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Inn sak khal in kham; lo thlawh le sabit hmuan tuah khal in siang lo; a lei khal nan lei lo pei, a ti. Hi ramsung mikhual vekih kan umnak ram ahhin kan um suah theinak dingah puanthlam sungih um ringring dingah thu in pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jonadab ih in simmi le a thupekmi hmuahhmuah cu kan thlun ṭheh. Kanmah in sabitti kan in dah lo; kan nupi pawl, kan fanu le kan fapa pawl khal in an in dah lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan umnak kan inn hrangah tiah inn kan sa dah lo; Puanthlam sungah kan um; sabit hmuan le lo le rawl tla kan nei lo. Kan pu Jonadab thupekmi hmuahhmuah in kimten kan thlun ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sikhalsehla siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar in hi ram a do tikah Babilon ralkap le Siria ralkap pawl ṭih ah kan tlan ih Jerusalem ah feh uhsi kan ti ih curuangah atu Jerusalem ah kan um a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutikah Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in Judah le Jerusalem mi hnenah feh dingah le hiti ih va sim dingah i fial, “Keimah Bawipa in, ziangah so ka thusimmi nan ngai duh lo ih ka thupekmi nan thlun duh lo? tiah ka lo sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Rekhab miphun cu an pu Jonadab ih thupekmi kha a tesinfa pawl in an thlun ih tuihsun tiangin zohman in sabitti an in lo. Asinain nannih cu ka lo sim rero naón ka thu nan thlun duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka sal profet pawl pakhat hnu pakhat nan hnenah ka thlah rero ih a dikmi tuah ih thilsual tuahnak nuncan tlansan dingah an lo sim rero. Nan pupa pawl le nanmah hnenih ka lo pekmi hi ram ahhin nan um thei ringringnak dingah Pathian dang pawl rian lo ding le bia lo dingah an lo sim, ralrinnak an lo pek. Asinain ka thusimmi cu nan ngai lo ih ziang hman ah nan siar lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jonadab ih tesinfa pawl cun an pu ih thupekmi an thlun naón nannih pawl cun ka thu nan thlun lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Curuangah nannih Judah mi le Jerusalem mipawl nan parah keimah Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in ka lo tiam ciami siatsuahnak hmuahhmuah ka thlenter ding a si. Hi bangtuk in nan parah ka thlenter ding, ziangahtile nan hnenih ka ṭong tikah nan ngai duh lo ih ka lo ko hai tikah in awi duh fawn lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cule Rekhab hrin pawl hnenah, “Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in ‘Nan pu Jonadab ih thupekmi cu nan thlun ṭheh zo; a thuzirhmi tla nan ngai ih a lo simmi daan hmuahhmuah nan tuah ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Curuangah keimah Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in thu ka lo kam. Rekhab fapa Jonadab in keimah riantu dingah tesinfa fapa cat loin a nei ringring ding,’ a ti,” tiah ka sim.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah ih fapa Jehoiakim Judah siangpahrang a cannak kum linak ah Bawipa in ka hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Cazual la awla Israel le Judah le miphun hmuahhmuah pawl thuhla ka simmi hi a zatein ngan thluh aw. Josiah siangpahrang a ṭuan laiah na hnenih hmaisabik ka ṭongmi ihsin tuihsun tiang ka lo simmi hmuahhmuah ngan thluh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah mipawl parih siatsuahnak thlenter ka tummi hi an theih ih an nuncan ṭhin thei pang hai sehla! Cuticun an sualnak le an ṭhat lonak pawl ka ngaidam ding naón!” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Curuangah Neriah ih fapa Baruk ka ko ih Bawipa in ka hnenih a ṭongmi hmuahhmuah cu ngan dingah ka auh. Baruk in cazual sungah a khum ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule kei in Baruk hnenah cun, “Kei cu Biakinn sungih feh theinak thu ka ngah nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah nangmah feh dingah ka lo duh: hmailam rawl an ulh sal tik caan ah feh aw. Hi cazual ihsin ringzet in siar awla cuti cun Bawipa in ka hnen ih a ṭong ih ka lo auh-mi hmuahhmuah hi mipi in an thei ṭheh ding. Mi hmuahhmuah le an khua ciar in a rami Judah mipawl tla ih an theih ṭheh theinak hmun ihsin siar aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa hnenah thla an cam ih an nuncan ṭha lomi an tlansannak tla ah a cang thei men ding. Ziangahtile hi minung pawl parah Bawipa in ṭihnungza a thinhengnak le a ai-thawhnak thlenter a tum a si,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Neriah ih fapa Baruk cun ka sim vek cekci in Biakinn sungah Bawipa ih ṭongkam cu a va siar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jehoiakim Judah siangpahrang a sinak kum nganak thla kua thla ah Bawipa ih mithmai ṭha co duh ah mipawl cu rawl an ul sal! Jerusalem khawsungah a ummi le Judah ramsung khawpi ihsin a rami hmuahhmuah in rawl an ul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cule mi hmuahhmuah in thu an ngai laifangah ka simmi cu cazual sung vekin a zatein Baruk in a siar ṭheh. Cutiin Biakinn sungah a siar ih cuih khaan ih sungṭuan Shafan ih fapa Gemariah ih khaan in a siar. A khaan cu tlunta khaan Biakinn ih Kotka Thar timi kiangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Baruk in Bawipa ih ṭong cazual ihsin a siarmi cu Shafan fasuan Gemariah ih fapa Mikaiah in a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule Mikaiah cu siangpahrang inn, sungṭuan ih khaan ah bawi pawl an tongkhawm laifangah a feh. Sungṭuan Elishama, Shemaiah ih fapa Delaiah, Akbor ih fapa Elnathan, Shafan ih fapa Gemariah, Hananiah ih fapa Zedekiah le bawi dangdang tla an rak um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Baruk in mipi hnenih a siarmi thu kha Mikaiah in a theih vekin an hnenah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah bawi pawl in Jehudi an thlah. Jehudi cu Nethaniah ih fapa a si; Nethaniah cu Shelemiah ih fapa a si; Shelemiah cu Kushi ih fapa a si. An thlah ih mipi hnenih a siarmi cazual rak keng dingah Baruk va sim dingin an fial. Baruk in cazual cu a rak keng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawi pawl cun, “To awla cazual cu siar aw,” an ti. An ti vekin Baruk cun a siar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A siar ṭheh tikah pakhat le pakhat thinphang in an zoh aw ih, “Siangpahrang kan sim a ṭul ding,” tiah Baruk cu an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cule Baruk cu, “In sim hnik! Ziangtin so hi hmuahhmuah hi na ngan thei? Jeremiah in a lo auh maw si?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Baruk in, “Jeremiah in ṭong fangkhat hman hrelh loin i auh ih hi cazual parah cati thawn ka ngan a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cutikah annih in, “Nang le Jeremiah cu nan relh a ṭul ding. Nan relhnak cu zohman sim hlah uh,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawi pawl in cazual cu sungṭuan Elishama khaan ah an retta ih siangpahrang khaan ah an feh ih siangpahrang hnenah cuih thu cu a zatein an va sim ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule siangpahrang in cazual la dingah Jehudi a thlah. Jehudi cun Elishama khaan ihsin a va lak ih siangpahrang le a kiangih a dingtu pawl hnenah cun cazual cu a siar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thla kua thla, thlatang lai a si ih siangpahrang bawipa cu a thlatang inn ah meisabeel ih an muahmi meisa ai in a to.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jehudi cun a hun siar ih cahmai hmai thum hmai li a hun siar tikah siangpahrang cun namte in a at thlek ih meisa sungah, meisabeel sungah cun a paih. Cazual zate ih a cem hlan lo meisa sungah a paih vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Asinain siangpahrang siseh, a kut thuai bawi pawl siseh, cazual sung thuhla cu an thei ṭheh naón ṭihnak an thiam lo, riahsiatnak khal an thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Elnathan, Delaiah le Gemariah in cazual ur lo dingah siangpahrang cu an leem rero naón zianghman ah a siar lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cule siangpahrang in keimah le ka cazi Baruk kai dingah thu a pek. A fialmi cu siangpahrang fapa Jerahmeel, Azriel ih fapa Seraiah le Abdeel ih fapa Shelemiah an si. Asinain Bawipa in in thup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Siangpahrang Jehoiakim in Baruk ka auh-mi cazual cu a ur ṭheh hnuah Bawipa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />cazual dang lak ih hmaisa cazual sungih a ummi hmuahhmuah ngan sal dingah i fial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bawipa in siangpahrang hnenah hiti ih va sim dingin i fial: “Cazual na ur zo; cule Jeremiah cu hi ram ah Babilon siangpahrang a ra ding ih hi ram le hi ramsung minung pawl le ṭilva pawl a siatsuah ṭheh ding tiah zianghrangah na ngan? tiah na sut zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Curuangah keimah Bawipa in atu-ah nang siangpahrang Jehoiakim ka lo sim: David ukmi ram hi na tesinfa zohman in an uk dah lo ding. Na ruak cu khawleng ah hlon a si ding ih sun ah nisa in a em ding ih zan ah dai in a tlak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nan zate ih nan tuahmi sualnak ruangah hin nangmah le na tesinfa pawl le na kut thuai bawi pawl ka lo hrem ding. Nangmah in siseh, Jerusalem mi le Judah mi pawl in siseh, ralrinnak ka lo pekmi zianghman ih nan siar lo ruangah ka thlenter ding, ti ih ka sim ciami siatralnak cu nan zate parah ka thlengter ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cule cazual dang pakhat ka lak ih ka cazi Baruk hnenah ka pek ih ka auh-mi hmuahhmuah a ngan ṭheh. A hmaisa cazual sungih a ummi hmuahhmuah le a bang-awmi thu dang ka auh-mi pawl cu a ngan ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babilon siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar in Jehoiakim ih fapa Jehoiakhin ai ah Josiah ih fapa Zedekiah cu Judah siangpahrang ah a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asinain Zedekiah in siseh, a kut thuai bawi pawl le misenpi pawl in siseh, Bawipa in ka hnenih a simmi thu cu an ngai duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan miphun ai-awh in Bawipa kan Pathian hnenih thlacam dingah siangpahrang Zedekiah in Shelemiah ih fapa Jehukal le Maaseiah ih fapa puithiam Zefaniah cu ka hnenah a rak thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Culai ahcun thawng ah in thlak hrih lo ih luat zetin misenpi lakah ka tlang thei lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Babilon ralkap pawl in Jerusalem an kulh ṭheh zo; sikhalsehla annih in Izipt siangpahrang Faro ralkap pawl cu Izipt ramri an rak lan zo ti an theih tikah Jerusalem ihsin an siip thluh sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zedekiah sim dingah hiti in i sim, “Izipt ralkap pawl cu nangmah bawm dingah an ra lai rero. Asinain an ram ah an kir sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Babilon ralkap pawl cu an ra sal ding ih Jerusalem khawpi hi an do ding, an lak ding ih ciam ko in an ur ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Babilon mipawl an ra nawn lo ding tiin ruat tahratin nangmah le nangmah bum aw rero hlah; Keimah Bawipa in ralrinnak ka lo pek: an ra tengteng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Babilon ralkap an zatein na neh ṭheh ih hmapu pawl lawnglawng an taang ih an buuk sungih hlum ṭhehmi an si hmanah cupawl cu an tho sal ding ih hi khawpi cu meisa thawn ciam ko in an ur thotho ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Izipt ralkap pawl an ra ti an theih tikah Babilon ralkap pawl cu Jerusalem ihsin an siip.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Curuangah kei khal sungkhat thilri co ding ka neih ve ruangah Benjamin ram ih feh dingah Jerusalem ihsin ka pok.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asinain Benjamin Kotka ka thlen tikah cutawkih kotka kiltu ralkap pawl hotu ralbawi, a hmin Irijah an timi, Shelemiah ih fapa, Hananiah ih fasuan cun i rak kham ih, “Babilon mi hnenah na tlan tum a si lo maw?” tiah i sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Sihlah, tlan ka tum lo,” tiah ka sawn. Asinain Irijah cun ka simmi cu a ngai lo. I kai ih bawi pawl hnenah i hruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />In hmuh tikah an thin a heng ih in vuak ih sungṭuan Jonathan inn ah, thawnginn ih an tuahmi inn sungah cun in ret ih tawh an hren.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Leilung thuai khaan sungah in ret ih cutawkah reipi ka um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cuih hnuah siangpahrang Zedekiah in i ko ih a inn sungah cun a thupte in, “ Bawipa hnen ihsin ziang thu a ra maw?” tiah i sut. “A ra a si. Babilon siangpahrang kut ah pek na si ding,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cule thusuh ding ka neih ruangah a hnenah cun, “Ziang sualnak so nangmah le na kut thuai bawi pawl parah siseh, misenpi parah siseh, ka neih ih thawng ah i thlak?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Babilon siangpahrang in nangmah le hi ram cu a lo do lo ding, tiah a lo simtu na profet pawl teh khui-ah so an si ṭheh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Atu-ah siangpahrang Bawipa , na hnen ah ka lo dilmi i tuahsak dingah zaangfah ka lo dil, i theih sak hram aw. Jonathan inn, thawnginn sungah cun i kuat sal hram hlah aw. I kuat sal a si ahcun cunah ka thi tengteng ding,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Curuangah siangpahrang Zedekiah in siangpahrang inn kiltu pawl umnak khaan sungah i khum. Cutawkah ka um ih khawpi sungih sang a cem hlan lo, sangtuahtu lamzin timi ihsin, nitinte sang zawl khat ka ngah ringring.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mattan ih fapa Shefatiah, Pashhur ih fapa Gedaliah, Shelemiah ih fapa Jehukal le Malkhiah ih fapa Pashhur pawl in misenpi hnenih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa ih ṭong ka simmi, “Hi khawpi sungih a taangmi cu ral kut in, a si lole rawl lo in, a si lole natnak in nan thi ding. Asinain Babilon mi hnenah a feh ih a pe awtu pawl cu thah an si lo ding; an nunnak tal cu zuah a si ding,” tiah ka timi cu an thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Culawng si loin Bawipa in a simmi, “Hi khawpi cu Babilon ralkap pawl kut ah ka pe ding ih an la ding,” a timi khal mipi hnenah ka sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuih bawi pawl cu siangpahrang hnenah an feh ih, “Hi pa hi thah ding a si. Hitiih a ṭong ruangah khawsung ralkap pawl an tha a nau ih khawsungmi hmuahhmuah hrang khalah thanaunak ah a cang ṭheh. Misenpi bom tum loin an hrangih harsatnak sawn a duh a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah siangpahrang Zedekiah in, “Cuti a si ahcun nan duh vekin tuah uh, ka lo kham thei lo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah in hruai ih siangpahrang inn kiltu pawl inn lakih a ummi siangpahrang ih fapa Malkhiah ih tikhur sungah hridai in in vun thlak. Tikhur sungah tidai a rak um lo; ciarbek lawng a um ih cuih ciarbek sungah cun ka vung pil cuahco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sikhalsehla siangpahrang inn ih hna a ṭuantu Sudan mi tilper pa Ebedmelek in tikhur sungih in thlak cu a thei. Culai ah siangpahrang cu Benjamin Kotka timi ah thu a rel laifang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutawkah Ebedmelek cu a va feh ih siangpahrang hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Maw siangpahrang Bawipa, na kut thuai bawi pawl ih an tuah mi hi thil sual a si. Jeremiah cu tikhur sungah an thlak ih cunah rawl lo in a thi tengteng ding; ziangahtile hi khawpi sungah rawl a um nawn lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siangpahrang in Ebedmelek hnenah, “Nangmah le midang pathum va feh uhla Jeremiah cu tikhur sung ihsin a thih hlanah va dirhsuak uh,” tiah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ebedmelek cu midang pathum thawn siangpahrang thilri retnak ah khaan ah an feh ih puansia le hnipuan hlun an lak ih hridai thawn in run thlak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hridai in ka baan i natter lo dingah ka baan thuai ka zak ah puansia dam dingin i sim. I sim vek cun ka tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule tikhur sung ihsi cun in dirhsuak. Cuihhnu cun inn kiltu pawl ih inn ah in ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Voikhat ah siangpahrang Zedekiah in Biakinn ih vung luhnak kotka pathumnak ihsin i ko ih ka hnenah, “Thu pakhat ka lo sut ding ih thudik i sim ding ka duh a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei in, “Thudik ka lo sim a si ahcun i that ding; ruahnak ka lo pek ahcun zianghman ah na siar cuang lo ding,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Curuangah siangpahrang Zedekiah in a thupte in siatcam in thu i kam ih, “A nungmi Pathian hmin saal in ka lo kam, nunnak in petu Pathian hmin in ka lo kam a si: Ka lo that hrimhrim lo ding; nangmah thah a lo duhtu pawl kut sung khal ah ka lo pe lo ding,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cule Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian ṭong cu Zedekiah hnenah hiti in ka sim: “Babilon siangpahrang kut thuai bawi pawl hnenih na pek awk a si ahcun na nunnak cu an lo zuah ding ih hi khawpi hi ciam ko in an ur lo ding. Nangmah le na innsang pawl cu nan him ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sikhalsehla na pek aw lo a si ahcun hi khawpi hi Babilon kut ah pek a si ding ih ciam ko an ur ding ih nang khal na luat lo ding,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asinain siangpahrang in, “Babilon mipawl hnenih a tlantu kan ramsung minung pawl ka ṭih a si. An kut sungih ka thlen a si ahcun ih hrem rori ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cutikah kei in, “An kut sungah pek na si lo ding. Bawipa ih ṭongkam sawn hi ṭhatein ngai aw tiah ka lo dil. Na ngai asile ziang hmuahhmuah a ṭha ding, na nunnak khal an lo zuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sikhalsehla an hnenih pek awk na duh lo a si ahcun ziang a cang ding ti kha Bawipa in langnak i hmuhter zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cuih langnak ahcun Judah siangpahrang inn ih a taangmi nunau hmuahhmuah hi Babilon siangpahrang kut thuai ih bawi pawl hnenah hruai ṭheh an si ding kha ka hmu. An feh phah ih an ṭong mi hi ngai hnik: ‘Siangpahrang cu a rualpi ṭha pawl in an hruai sual zo. A tlunah thu an nei tuk. Atu-ah a ke cu ciarbek sungah a pil zo. A rualpi pawl in an tlansan ṭheh,’ an ti,” tiah ka sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cuih tlun ah, “Na nupi pawl le na faate pawl hmuahhmuah hi Babilon mipawl hnenah hruai ṭheh an si ding ih nangmah khal an kut sung ihsin na luat lo ding. Babilon siangpahrang in thawng ah a lo thlak ding ih hi khawpi hi ciam ko in an ur ding,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cutikah Zedekiah in, “Hitiih thu kan ruah awknak hi zohman theihter hlah aw. Cuticun na nunnak khal ṭih ding a um lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nangmah thawn thu kan ruah awknak hi bawi pawl ih an theih a si ahcun na hnenah an ra ding ih thu kan rel mi hi an lo sut ding. Na sim ṭheh a si ahcun kan lo that lo ding, tiah an lo tiam ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thawng sungah i kuat sal in i thihter siang hram hlah aw, tiah ka va dil,’ ti men aw,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bawi pawl cu an ra ih thu in ra sut ngaingai. Asinain siangpahrang ih i tiam vek cekci in ka sim. Annih in zianghman tuah theimi dang an nei cuang lo. Ziangahtile siangpahrang thawn thu kan ruah awknak kha a theitu zohman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Siangpahrang inn kiltu pawl innah cun in ret ih Jerusalem an lak ni tiang cunah in ret a si
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zedekiah in Judah siangpahrang a ṭuannak kum kua kum, thla hra thla ah Babilon siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar cu a ralkap zate thawn a ra ih Jerusalem a do.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zedekiah in siangpahrang a ṭuannak kum hleikhat kum, thla li thla, ni kua ni ah khawkulhnak phar dawl cu an bal thei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jerusalem khawpi an lak tikah Babilon siangpahrang kut thuai ih bawi upa hmuahhmuah an ra ih Kotka Lai an timi ah an to. Cupawl cu Nergal Sarezer, Samgar Nebo, Sarsekhim le a dang Nergal Sarezar an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cumi cu siangpahrang Zedekiah le a ralkap pawl in an hmuh tikah khawpi sung ihsin zan ah tlanhlo an tum. Siangpahrang hmuan sung lamzin ihsin an suak ih khawpi kulhnak phar thuah hnih a pehtu kotka zin in an feh ih Jordan phairawn lamzin in an tlan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Babilon ralkap pawl in an dawi ih Zedekiah cu Jerikho khua kiang hmunrawn ah an kai. Cule siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar hnenah an fehpi. Nebuchadnezzar cu Hamath peng sung Riblah khua ah a rak um ih cutawkah cun Zedekiah ih thu cu a rel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Riblah khua ahcun Zedekiah ih fapa pawl cu an pa ih hmuhhngan ah Nebuchadnezzar in a thah; Judah ramsung bawi upa pawl khal a that ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Zedekiah ih mit a phorh ih Babilon ih fehpi dingah thir cikcin in a khih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutiih an tuah laiah Babilon ralkap dang pawl in siangpahrang inn le misenpi inn pawl an ur ih Jerusalem khawkulhnak phar dawl tla an bal ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Netabik ah an ralkap pawl hotu ralbawi Nebuzaradan in Jerusalem khawpi sungih a taang hrih mi pawl le amah hnenih a ra tlantu pawl kha salih taang dingah Babilon ah a hruai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judah ram ah mifarah bik pawl, thilri le loram zianghman a nei lo pawl a ṭan ih sabit hmuan le lo pawl a pekta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar in ralkap hotu ralbawi Nebuzaradan hnenah thu a pek ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Jeremiah hawl ah feh awla ṭhatein va kilkhawi aw. Zianghman harsatnak pe hlah aw. A duhmi hmuahhmuah tuahsak sawn aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Curuangah Nebuzaradan le bawi dang Nebushazban le Nergal Sarezer le a dang bawi upa dangdang pawl an ra ṭheh ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />siangpahrang inn kiltu pawl umnak inn ih in retnak ihsin in ra suah. Keimah humhim dingih ṭuanvo an pekmi Ahikam fapa le Shafan ih fasuan a si mi Gedaliah ih kut thuai ah in ret. Cuticun ka miphun pawl lak ahcun ka um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Siangpahrang inn kiltu pawl umnak inn ih in ret laiah Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Sudan mi Ebedmelek hnen ah sim aw: ‘Ka tuah ding ka ti bangtuk in hi khawpi hnenah hin ṭhansonak si loin siatsuahnak ka thlengter ding. Cumi tikcu a thlen tikah a hmutu na si ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Asinain keimah Bawipa in nang cu ka lo hum ding ih na ṭih mi pawl hnenah pek na si lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka lo humhim ding ih zohman in an lo that lo ding. Keimah i rinsan zo ruangah na nunnak cu a him ding ih na luat ding a si. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,’ va ti aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babilon ralkap pawl hotu ralbawi Nebuzaradan in Ramah khua ah i luatter hnuah Bawipa ih ṭong cu ka hnenah a thleng. Judah mi le Jerusalem mipawl cu salkaihmi an si ih Babilon ram lam ih an hruai laiah kei khal kaihmi ka si ve ruangah thir cikcin thawn Ramah khua ka thlen venak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ralbawipa cun hmundangte ah i hruai ih, “ Bawipa na Pathian in hi ram parah siatsuahnak ka thlenter ding, tiah a rak timi cu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />atu-ah a sim cia vekin a thleng ngaingai a si. Na minung pawl an sual ih Bawipa ih thu an ngai duh lo ruangah hi bangtuk in a cang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuihsun ihsin na kutngel ihsin thir cikcin hi ka phuak ding ih ka lo thlah ding. Keimah thawn Babilon ih na feh duh a si ahcun na feh thei; ṭhatein ka lo kilkhawi ding. Na feh duh lo a si ahcun na thu a si. Hi ram pumpi sungah na duhduh na hril pei ih nangmah in a rem a ṭha na tinak poh ah na feh pei,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule zianghman ṭong loih ka um tikah Nebuzaradan cun, “Judah ram uktu ah Babilon siangpahrang in a tuahmi Shafan ih fasuan, Ahikam ih fapa Gedaliah hnenah vung kir aw. Amah thawn misenpi lakah vung um aw; a si lole na feh duhnaknak ah feh aw la um aw,” i ti. Cule laksawng i ṭhen ih lamcaw i ken hnuah i thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutin Ahikam ih fapa Gedaliah hnenah ka feh ih Mizpah ah a hnenah ka um. Cuticun ram sungih a taangmi misenpi lakah ka um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Judah ralbawi hrekkhat le ralkap hrekkhat pawl cun remnak an tuah lo. Judah ram sungih taantami, ralkaihmi sungih a tel lomi mifarah bik pawl zohtu le hotu ah Babilon siangpahrang in Gedaliah a ret a si ti an theih tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nathaniah ih fapa Ishmael, Kareah ih fapa Johanan, Tanhumeth ih fapa Seraiah, Netofah ihsin Efai fapa pawl le Maakah ihsin Jezaniah pawl cu Gedaliah hnenah Mizpah ah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gedaliah in an hnenah, “Babilon ralbawi pawl hnenih remnak tuah cu nan hrangah zianghman phan ding a um lo, tiah feltein ka lo sim. Hi ram sungah um in Babilon siangpahrang rian uhla nan hrangah ziang hmuahhmuah a tluang ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keimah khal Mizpah ahhin ka um ding ih Babilon mi an rat tikah nan palai ka si ding. Sabit le thingrah le olif hriak pawl khawm uhla ṭhatein re uh; cule nan lakmi khua pawl sungah daitein um uh,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule Babilon siangpahrang in Israel mi hrekkhat pawl cu Judah ram sungah a umter ih anmah hotu ah Gedaliah a tuah, tikha Moab ram, Ammon ram, Edom ram le ram dangdangih a tlanmi Israel mi pawl in an thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Curuangah an tlannak ram ciar ihsin an tho ih Judah ram ah an kir. Gedaliah hnenah Mizpah ahcun an ra ih cutawkah sabit le thingrah tampi an khawm ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Johanan le remnak a tuah duh lotu ralkap hotu pawl Gedaliah hnenah Mizpah ah an ra ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hnenah, “Ammon siangpahrang Baalis in nangmah that dingah Ishmael a thlah, ti na thei lo maw?” tiah an ti. Asinain Gedaliah cun a zum lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cutikah Johanan in Gedaliah cu a thupte in, “Ishmael cu keimah in ka that pei ih a thattu zo a si ti zohman in an thei lo ding. Nangmah thah dingah ziangah so kan zohsawh men ding? A lo that ngaingai tla si bangsehla nangmah a ra lo pantu Judah mipawl hi hmunkip ah ṭhekdarh an si lala ding ih Judah ramih a taangmi mipi hrangah cun thil poimawh ngaingai a si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Gedaliah cun, “Zianghman ti hlah; Ishmael ih thuhla na simmi hi thudik a si lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuih kum thla sarih thla ah siangpahrang sungkhat a si mi, siangpahrang kut thuai ih bawi upa bik lakah pakhat a si mi, Elishama ih tesinfa Nethaniah ih fapa Ishmael cu minung pahra thawn Judah ram uktu Gedaliah tong dingah Mizpah ah a feh. An zatein hmunkhat ih rawl an hil tlang laiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ishmael le a minung pahra cun an ralnam an suah ih Gedaliah cu an that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gedaliah hnenih a ummi Israel mipawl le Babilon ralkap hrekkhat cutawkih a rak ummi pawl tla Ishmael in a thah ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thaisun ah, Gedaliah an thah kha zohman ih an theih hlanah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Shekhem, Shiloh le Samaria ihsin minung sawmriat an ra thleng. An khabe hmul meet in le an hnipuan thlek in anmah le anmah an sun an at-aw ih Biakinn ah sangphut le rimhmui pe dingah a rami an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ishmael cun ṭap phah in Mizpah ihsin a va hmuak hai. An hnen a thlen tikah, “Gedaliah tong dingah cun rung uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khawpi an rung luh tikah Ishmael le a minung pawl cun an rak that hai ih an ruak cu tikhur sungah an hlon ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asinain anmah lakah minung pahra in Ishmael hnenah cun, “In that hram hlah aw; sangvut le fangtlor le olif hriak le khuaitizu pawl hramlak ah thuhmi kan nei,” tiah an leem. Curuangah that loin a zuah hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ishmael in a thahmi pawl ih ruak an hlonnak tikhur cu a tumpi a si ih Israel siangpahrang Baasha in siangpahrang Asa a rak do laiah siangpahrang Asa in a rak laihmi tikhur a si. Ishmael in cuih tikhur cu miruak in a khatter ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cule Babilon ralkap pawl hotu ralbawi Nebuzaradan in Gedaliah kilkhawi dingih a retmi siangpahrang fanu pawl le Mizpah khua ih mipi pawl cu thawng ah a thlak ṭheh. Cupawl cu Ishmael in salah a kaih ih Ammon ram lam ah a tlanpi ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ishmael ih thilsual a tuahmi cu Johanan le amah thawn a ummi ralkap hotu ralbawi pawl in an theih tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ralkap thawn an dawi ih Gibeon ih tili tumpi kiangah an man.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ishmael ih sal kaihmi pawl in Johanan le amah thawn a rami ralbawi pawl cu an hmuh tikah an lung a awi ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An let kir ih an hnenah cun an ra tlan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asinain Ishmael le a minung pariat cu Johanan ih kaih ngah lo in an tlan suak ih Ammon ram ah an thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cule Ishmael in Gedaliah a thah hnuah Mizpah ihsin sal ih a kaihmi ralkap pawl siseh, nunau le nauhak pawl siseh, tilper mipawl tiangin Johanan le ralbawi pawl cun ṭhatein an zoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Asinain Babilon siangpahrang in Judah ram uktu ah a tuahmi Gedaliah kha Ishmael in a thah ruangah Babilon mi ṭihnak an thinlung sungah a khat. Curuangah Babilon mi ṭih ah Izipt ram ah an tlan. Lamzin ah Bethlehem khua kiangah Khimham ah an cawl.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun ralkap hotu pawl hmuahhmuah le Kareah ih fapa Johanan le Hoshaiah ih fapa Azariah le mipi pawl a tum a seen in ka hnenah an ra ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />annih in, “Kan lo dilmi hi in tuahsak hram aw. Bawipa kan Pathian hnenah kan hrangah thlacam hram aw. A nungmi kan zate hrangah hin thla in cam sak aw. Tuih hlanah cun minung kan tamzet, a sinan atu-ah cun in hmuh vekin mi malte lawng kan taang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan fehnak ding lamzin le kan tuah dingmi thil kan hmuh theinak dingah Bawipa kan Pathian hnenah thla in cam sak hram aw,” tiah in ra dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cutikah kei in, “A ṭha; nan dil vekin Bawipa kan Pathian hnenah cun thla ka cam ding. A simmi hmuahhmuah cu ka lo sim ṭheh ding; zianghman ka suup lo ding,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule annih in, “ Bawipa kan Pathian in kan hrangih thu a lo pekmi kan thlun duh lo a si ahcun Bawipa cu in dodaltu sisehla kan parah thu theitu dikzet le felzet si hram seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hnenah thlacam sak dingih kan lo dil ruangah kan duh ah siseh, duh lo ah siseh, Bawipa kan Pathian ih thu cu kan ngai ding. A thu kan ngai asile kan lamzin a tluang ding a si,” tiah in ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ni hra hnuah Bawipa ih ṭong cu ka hnenah a rung thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Curuangah Johanan le a hnen ih a ummi ralkap hotu pawl le misenpi pawl cu ka ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An hnenah, “A hnenah dil dingih in thlahmi Bawipa Israel ih Pathian in nan hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />‘Hi ram sungih um nan duh ahcun ka lo siatsuah lo ding, ka lo tungding sawn ding; ka lo phawi lo ding, ka lo phunhnget sawn ding a si. Nan parih ka thlentermi siatralnak hin ka thin in natter zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Curuangah Babilon siangpahrang cu ṭih nawn hlah uh. Nan hnenah ka um ih a cahnak huham sungin ka lo run ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zaangfah thinpemnak neitu ka si ruangah nan parah zaangfahnak ka neihter ding ih nan khua le nan ram ah a lo kirter ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Sikhalsehla nannih Judah ram ih a taangmi pawl in Bawipa nan Pathian thu cu nan el lo pei ih hi ram sungih um khal nan nuar lo pei. Nannih in ‘Asilo, Izipt ram ah kan feh ding ih kan vung um sawn ding. Izipt ram ahcun ral kan do nawn lo ding, raldo ding kawhnak aw tla kan thei lo ding ih kan ril tla a rawng lo ding,’ nan ti lo pei. Nan ti a si ahcun Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in, ‘Izipt ram ah feh in a um nan tumtah hrimhrim a si ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />nan ṭih zetmi ral in a lo man ding. Nan phan zetmi rilrawnnak cun a lo thlun ding ih Izipt ram ah nan thi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Izipt ram ah feh in um a tum hrimhrimtu pawl cu ral kut in maw, paamnak in maw, a si lole natnak in maw an thi ṭheh tengteng ding. Zohman an nung lo ding. An parih ka thlenter dingmi siatralnak in zohman an luat lo ding,’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“ Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in, ‘Ka thinhengnak le ka ai-thawhnak cu Jerusalem khuami parih burh a si vekin Izipt ram ih nan feh a si ahcun nan parah burh a si ve ding. Midang pawl mithmuh ah tuksumza nan si ding. Mi ih puahcokmi ah nan cang ding ih nan hmin cu midang siatcamnak ah an hmang ding. Cule hi ram hi nan hmu sal nawn lo ding,’ a ti,” tiah ka sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cuih hnuah hiti in ka sim beet sal, “ Bawipa in Judah ram ih a taangmi nannih pawl cu Izipt ram ih feh lo dingin a lo sim zo. Atu ah ralrinnak ka lo pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nan feh a si ahcun nan ti sualzet ding a si. Bawipa kan Pathian hnenah nan hrangih thlacam sak dingin in dil ih a thupek mi hmuahhmuah tuah dingah thu nan kam aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Atute ah ka lo sim ṭheh. Asinain Bawipa kan Pathian in i simtermi hmuahhmuah nan el thluh fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Curuangah ciing ṭha uh: Um nan duhnak ram ah feh tahrat in ral in maw, rawl loin maw, a si lole natnak in maw nan thi ding a si,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa an Pathian in an hnenah sim dingih i fialmi hmuahhmuah cu misenpi hnenah ka sim ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutikah Hoshaiah ih fapa Azariah le Kareah ih fapa Johanan le mi puarthau pawl in, “Na thuphan a si. Bawipa kan Pathian in Izipt ram feh lo dingah le um lo dingih sim dingah a lo thlah lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Babilon mi pawl in kan tlunah thu an neih ih in thah theinak dingah, a si lole Babilon ih in fehpi theinak dingah Neriah ih fapa Baruk in thusia a lo forh a si,” tiah in ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuticun Judah ram sungih um dingah Bawipa ih thupekmi cu Johanan in siseh, ralbawi pawl in siseh, misenpi pawl khal in siseh, zohman in an thlun duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule Johanan le ralbawi pawl in Judah ramih a taangmi pawl hmuahhmuah le ṭhekdarh ṭheh an sinak ram ihsin a ra kirtu pawl hmuahhmuah cu Izipt ram ah an fehpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mipa, nunau, nauhak le siangpahrang fanu pawl tla an fehpi ṭheh. Gedaliah ih kilkhawi dingah Babilon ralkap hotu ralbawi Nebuzaradan ih a retmi hmuahhmuah pawl le, Baruk le keimah tiangin in hruai ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa ih thupekmi cu ngai loin Izipt ram Tahpanhes khua tiang an vung feh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutawkah Bawipa in ka hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Lungto tum pipi la awla hi khawpi sung acozah inn luhnak hmai ih lamzin phah mi phahlei thuai ah phum aw; cuti na tuah cu Israel mi hrekkhat in lo hmu hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian keimah in i riantu Babilon siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar cu hi hmunah ka runter ding ih cuih na phummi lung tumpipi parah cun a siangpahrang tokham a hung ding ih an tlunah a siangpahrang puanthlam a zaar ding, ti thu sim aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar a ra ding ih Izipt cu a neh ding. Natnak in thi dingih ruahciami pawl cu natnak in an thi ngaingai ding; sal kaih dingih ruahciami pawl cu sal kaihmi an si ngaingai ding; ral kut in thi dingih ruahciami pawl cu ral kut in an thi ngaingai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Izipt ram khawzing pawl ih biakinn pawl cu meisa in ka ur ding. Babilon siangpahrang in an khawzing pawl cu meisa in a ur ding, a si lole a phurhlo ding. Tuukhal in a hnipuan par ih hrik a lak ṭheh ih a faiter vekin Babilon siangpahrang in Izipt ram cu a faiter ding ih nehtu a si hnuah Izipt ram ihsin a feh sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Izipt ram Heliopolis ih a zarhmi lungto phunmi pawl cu a balcim ṭheh ding ih an khawzing biakinn pawl cu a ur ṭheh ding a si,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Izipt ramsung Migdol khua, Tahpanhes khua, Memfis khua le Izipt ram thlanglam ih a um Israel mi hmuahhmuah thu ah Bawipa in ka hnenah, hiti in a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian cun, “Jerusalem khawpi parah le Judah ram khua hmuahhmuah parah siatsuahnak ka thlentermi cu nan mit rori in nan hmu zo. Atu khalah hnawmpen bangtuk an si hrih ih milai zohman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ziangah cutin a cang tile thilsual an tuah ih ka thin in hengter ruangah a si. Nanmah in siseh, nan pupa pawl in siseh, nan biak dah lomi khawzing nan rian ih khawzing dangdang hnenah raithawinak nan pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nan hnenah cat loin keimah riantu profet pawl ka thlah ih hi bangtuk thil ka huat zawng hi tuah lo dingah an lo sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Asinain an thu cu nan ngai lo ih zianghman ah nan siar lo. Thilsual nan tuahmi khawzing dangdang hnenih raithawinak pek cu nan bang cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah ka thinhengnak le ka ai-thawhnak cu Judah ram ih khua pawl parah le Jerusalem khawpi sung lamzin parah ka run burh ih meisa in ka ur. Khuarop ah an cang ih ṭihnungza hmun ah an cang. Tuihsun tiang cutin an um lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Curuangah Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian keimah in, ziangah so hibangtuk thilsual hi nan parah nan thlenter duh rero, tiah ka lo sut. Siatsuahnak hi mipa, nunau, nauhak le naute pawl par tiang minung pakhat hman taang nawn lo tiangin nan thlengter duh maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nan rung umnak hi Izipt ram sungah hin khuazing dangdang hnenah raithawinak pe tahratin le milem pawl be tahratin ziangah so ka thin in hengter? Leilung tlun mi hmuahhmuah ih puahcok dingah le nan hmin hi mi camsiatnak ih hman dingah nanmah le nanmah siatsuah awk ṭheh nan tum maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Judah ram ih khua pawl sungah le Jerusalem khawsung lamzin par in nan pupa pawl le Judah siangpahrang le an nupi pawl le nanmah le nan nupi pawl ih thil ṭha lo nan rak tuahmi pawl kha nan hngilh ṭheh zo maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cubangtuk a si naón tuihsun tiangah thinlung neemnak nan nei hrih lo; Keimah upatnak le ṭihzahnak zianghman nan nei lo ih nanmah le nan pupa pawl hnenih ka pekmi daan vekin nan nung duh fawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Curuangah Cungnungbik Bawipa keimah, Israel ih Pathian in ka lo ral ding ih Judah ram cu ka siatter ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A taangsun Judah mi pawl, Izipt ram ah vung feh ih vung um a tum ṭengṭengtu pawl cu an zatein an cemral ṭheh ding. An zatein a tum a seen in Izipt ram ah ral kut in maw, rawl loin maw, an thi ṭheh ding a si. Mi hmuh ah tuksumza an si ding; hmuhsuam mi ah an cang ding ih an hmin cu mi camsiatnak le mi sulhnak ah an hmang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jerusalem ka hrem zo vekin Izipt ram ih a ummi pawl cu raldonak le paamnak le natnak in ka hrem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A taangsun Judah mipawl, Izipt ram a thleng mipawl cu minung pakhat hman a nungmi le a luatmi an um lo ding. Kirsal in um leh an duhzetnak Judah ram ah zohman an kir thei lo ding. Ral tlanmi pahnih khat siar le zohman an kir lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule mipa pawl, an nupi pawl ih khawzing dangdang hnenah thawinak an pek ti a theitu pawl le cutawkih a dingtu nunau hmuahhmuah le Izipt ram thlanglam ih a ummi Israel mipawl tiang mi tamzet an zatein ka hnenah an ra ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“ Bawipaió hmin in in simmi thu hmuahhmuah cu kan ngai duh lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kan tuah ding kan timi hmuahhmuah cu kan tuah ko ding. Kan khawzing nu Vancung Khumpinu hnenah raithawinak kan pe ding ih kanmah le kan pupa pawl in siseh, kan siangpahrang pawl le in hotu pawl in siseh, Judah ram khua pawl le Jerusalem khua lamzin parih an rak tuah zo vekin raithawinak ih pekmi sabitti cu a parah kan burh ko ding. Cuti kan rak tuah lai ahcun rawl kan paṭha ih mineinung kan si ih zianghman harsatnak kan tong lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Vancung Khumpinu hnenah thawinak kan pek nawn lo hnu le a hnenih pekmi sabitti kan burh nawn lo hnu ahcun ziang hmuahhmuah kan tlasam ih kan minung pawl cu ral kut in le rawl loin an thi ciamco a si,” tiah in ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cuih tlunah nunau pawl in, “Vancung Khumpinu hmuihmel cuangin sang kan rawh ih a hnen ih thawinak kan pekmi sabitti pawl kan burh tikah kan pasal pawl cu kan tuahmi parah an lung a hmui ngaingai a si,” tiah in ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cutiih i sawntu mipa le nunau pawl hnenah cun kei in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Nanmah le nan pupa pawl in siseh, nan siangpahrang pawl le nan hotu pawl in siseh, mipi pawl khal in siseh, Judah ram khawsung ah le Jerusalem khua lamzin parih thil nan tuahmi hmuahhmuah cu Bawipa in a thei lo ih a theih hmanah a hngilh zo tiah maw si nan ruat?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuihsun tiangah nan ram cu hnawmpen in a um ih milai zohman an um lo a si. Tuksumza ah an cang ih nan thilsual tuah mi le thil ṭha lo nan tuahmi pawl cu Bawipa in a zawi thei nawn lo ruangah nan ram cu a ṭhing ih mi in siatcamnak ah an hmang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bawipa ih thupekmi nan thlun lo ih khawzing dangdang hnenih raithawinak nan pek ruangah hi bangtuk siatralnak nan parah a thleng a si,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel Pathian ih ṭongmi cu Izipt ram ih a ummi Judah mi pawl hnenah ka sim. A hleice in nunau pawl hnenah ka sim a si: “Nanmah le nan nupi pawl in Vancung Khumpinu hnenah siatcam in thukamnak nan tuah. A hnenah thawinak pe dingin le sabit thawinak pekmi a par ih burh dingih thukamnak nan tuah ih nan thukammi vekin nan tuah ngaingai. A ṭha; nan thukamnak cu thlun uh. Siatcam ih nan thukammi vekin tuah ṭheh ko uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sikhalsehla keimah Bawipa in Izipt ramih a ummi Israel mipawl nan hnenah, a makzetmi ka hmin in siatcam in thu ka kammi hi ngaihnik uh: Ka hmin saal tahratin, ‘A nungmi Cungnungbik Bawipa hmin in thu ka kam aw,’ tiah zohman in nan ti nawn lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka mithmuh ah neinung in nan um nawn lo ding; siatsuah mi nan si sawn ding. Mi pakhat hman taang lo tiangin ral kut in maw, paamnak in maw, nan thi ṭheh ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Asinain mi malte lawng thi loin nan luat ding ih Izipt ram ihsin Judah ram ah nan kir ding. Cutik lawngah zo ih ṭong so a dik sawn, keimah ih ṭong maw, nanmah ih ṭong so, tikha a taangsunmi malte cun an thei leh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hi hmunah hin ka lo hrem ding ih nan parah siatralnak ka thlenter ding ti ih ka thukamnak a kim ding a si, ti langternak ah keimah Bawipa in khihhmuhnak ka lo pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Judah siangpahrang Zedekiah cu amah thah a duhtu a ral Babilon siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar kut sungih ka pek vekin Izipt siangpahrang Hofra cu a ral le amah thah a duhtu pawl ih kut ah ka pe ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah ih fapa Jehoiakim in Judah siangpahrang a ṭuannak kum li kum ah Baruk in ka auh-mi ca cu a ngan. Cule a hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa , Israel Pathian ih ṭongmi cu ka sim, “Baruk,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />nang cun ‘Ka bei a dong zo. Bawipa in ka harsatnak hmuahhmuah tlunah riahsiatnak a beet sinsin a si. Ka ai-hramnak ruangah ka bang ih ka vuai ṭheh zo. Colh damnak ka ngah lo,’ na ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Sikhalsehla keimah Bawipa cun ka sak ciami ka bal ṭheh ih ka phun ciami ka phawi ṭheh sal. Leilung pumpi hi cuti cun ka tuah ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na hrangah a hleice ih nunnomnak na hawl duh maw si? Hawl duh hlah! Miphun kip parah siatralnak ka thlenter ding. Asinain nang cu na fehnak kip ah thi loin na luat ding. Bawipa Keimah in ka sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in miphun pawl ih thuhla ka hnenah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Izipt thu in a thok. Jehoiakim in Judah siangpahrang a ṭuannak kum li kumah Eufrates Tivapi kiang Karkhemish khua ah Babilon siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar in Izipt siangpahrang Neko cu a neh ih Izipt ram thu ah Bawipa in hiti in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Izipt ralbawi pawl cu an au, ‘Nan ralphaw tiar cia in um uhla, raldonak hmun ah feh uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nan rang pawl timtuah uhla a parah to uh! Artlang in ding uhla nan thir lukhuh khum uh! Nan feipi tat hriam uhla, nan thir angki pawl hruk uh,’ an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Asinain ka hmuhmi hi ziangso a si? Thinphang in dung ih an kir ka hmu. An ralkap pawl dunglamah an rak nor ka hmu! An ṭih tukah an tlan thei tawp in an tlan. Dunglam an hoikir nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asinain tlan cak pawl khal an tlan suak lo. Ralkap pawl cu an luat cuang lo. Saklam ah Eufrates tiva kiang ah cun an sawn ih an ril.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nail tiva vekih a ṭhang ciamco hi zoso a si? Tikap tlun tiangih a liammi tiva bangin!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Izipt a si, Nail vekih a ṭhang ciamcotu cu! A kap tlun tiangih a liammi tiva bangin. Izipt cun ‘Ka ṭhang dingih leilung pumpi ka khuh ṭheh ding; Khawpi hmuahhmuah ka siatter ṭheh ding. A sungih ummi minung pawl thawn!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Rang pawl feh dingah thu pe uh, Rangleeng pawl tla tlan vutvo dingah! Ralkap pawl kuat uh, Sudan le Libia ram ralkap pawl, ralphaw keng phah in feh hai seh! Lidia ih conkiang sai thiam pawl tla,’ an ti.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuihsun hi a maksak mi, Cungnungbik Bawipa ih ni a si. Tuihsun ah phu a la ding. Tuihsun ah a ral pawl a hrem ding a si. A ralnam cun a ei ding ih a puar zet ding; An thisen a in ding ih a khop zet ding. Tuihsun ah Cungnungbik in thawinak a pek a si; Saklam ram Eufrates tiva kap ahcun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maw Izipt mipawl, Gilead ah feh uhla damnak sii va hawl uh! Nan sii pawl cu santlai lo an si; Zianghman in a lo damter thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Miphun hmuahhmuah in na ningzah nak an thei zo. Na ṭahnak cu leilung pumpi ah a thang. Ralkap pakhat cu a dang ralkap par ah a sawn. An pahnih in leilung ah an tlu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Babilon siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar cu Izipt do dingih a ra thlen tikah Bawipa ih ṭong cu ka hnenah a thleng:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Izipt khua pawl hnenah than aw, Migdol, Memfis le Tahfanhes hnen ahcun; ‘Tho uhla ṭang ṭha uh; Nan neihmi pawl cu raldonak ah, siatsuah ṭheh an si ding!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ziangah so nan khawzing maktak Apis cu a tluk? Bawipa in a vuak thlak ruangah,’ ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nan ralkap pawl cu an sawn ih an tlu. Pakhat le pakhat an biak aw ih, ‘Zamrang uh, kan suahnak ram le kan minung hnenah kir uhsi; Kan ral pawl ih ralnam ihsin kan tlan pei,’ an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Izipt siangpahrang hnenah hmin thar pe uh; ‘Tikcu ṭha A Luantertu Pontam Pa!’ ti uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cungnungbik keimah Bawipa hi siangpahrang ka si. Keimah hi a nungmi Pathian ka si. Tlang dang hnakin Tabor Tlang a saan bangin, Tifinriat tlun ih Karmel Tlang a din bangin, Nangmah a lo dotu ih cahnak cu a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Maw Izipt mipawl, salkaih hruaihlomi si dingah tiar aw uh. Memfis khua cu nelrawn ah a cang ding. Zohman um duh lonak ramṭhing ah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Izipt cu caw thau zet a bang. Asinain saklam ihsin tur nei thothe in a do ih a hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hlawh pekmi ralkap pawl hman cu, caw faate bangin ziang ṭhahnem lo an si. Ṭang tahratin raldotu zohman an um lo. An zatein an let ih an tlan hlo; An vanduai ni a ra thleng zo. An siatralnak caan cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Izipt cu thawm neizet in a tlan hlo, Rul vekih thlik phah in, Ral pawl an ra thlen tikah cun! Hreitlung thawn an ra do, Thingkung an hau theh ih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tupi thing an ṭhiam ṭheh vekin, An minung cu siar cawk lo an si, An ral pawl cu sihte hnakin an tam sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Izipt mipawl cu ningzak in an um, Saklam mi pawl in an neh. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa Israel ih Pathian in, “Thebes khua ih an khawzing Amon cu Izipt le a khawzing pawl le a siangpahrang pawl thawn ka hrem ding. Izipt siangpahrang le amah a rinsantu pawl hmuahhmuah cu ka lak ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Anmah thah a duhtu Babilon siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar le a ralkap kutah ka pe ding. Asinain neta lam ahcun Izipt ram sungah khuahlan ih mi an rak um vekin an um sal ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Ka minung pawl, ṭih hlah uh; Israel mipawl, nan thinphang hlah uh. Thawng nan tlaknak ram hlapi ihsin kan lo run ding. Nan kirsal dingih hnangamte in nan um ding. Him zetin nan um ding ih, zohman in an lo ṭihter lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nan hnenah ka ra ding ih ka lo hum ding; Ka lo ṭhekdarhnak ram le miphun pawl cu ka siatsuah ding. Asinain nannih cu ka lo siatsuah lo ding. Hrem lo cun ka lo thlah men lo ding; Asinain ka lo hrem tikah, dikzet in ka lo tuah ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Izipt siangpahrang in Gaza a do hlan ah Bawipa in Filistin ram thuhla i sim;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Zohhnik! Saklam ah tidai a ṭhang ciamco; Tilian bangin tiva kap ah a liam ding. Leilung le a par ummi hmuahhmuah a khuh thluh ding; Khawpi le a sung ummi milai pawl tla a khuh ding; Cupawl in bomnak duh ah an au ding. Leitlun mi hmuahhmuah nasa zetin an ṭap ding an ai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Rangcang pawl ih ke vuak thawm an thei ding; Rangleeng tlan thawm le lengke ril thawm tla. Pale pawl in an faale pawl bawm dingah an kir hnawh lo ding. An kut cu an siir ah tha nei loin an thlai-aw ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Filistin ram siatsuahnak tikcu a ra thleng zo, ṭai-ar le Sidon ihsin bomnak an ngahsunmi sahtannak tikcu cu! Keimah Bawipa in Filistin pawl ka siatter ding, Krete tikulh ihsin a rami pawl cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gaza mi hnenah riahsiatnak tumpi a ra thleng; Ashkelon mi pawl cu an dai ziarzi. Ziangtik tiangso Filistin ram hrekkhat pawl cu mithi ngai in an um ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />‘ Bawipa ih ralnam, Ziangtik tiangso mi na saat vivo hrih ding? Na kawm sungah kir sal awla, cutawkah daiteón um thlang aw,’ tiah na au!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sikhalsehla ziangtinso daiteón a um thei ding? Tuah ding ṭuanvo ka pek hnu ahcun? Ashkelon do dingah le tipikap ih a ummi pawl saat dingah thu ka pek zo a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in Moab ram thu ah hiti in a sim: “Nebo khuami pawl cu zaangfakza an si! An khawpi a siatral zo! Kiriathaim khua cu lak a si zo; An ralhruang bal ṭheh a si zo; An mipawl cu mualpho in an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moab ram sunlawinak a cem zo; Ral pawl in Heshbon khua an lak; Moab miphun siatsuah ṭheh dingin an ngaihtuah. Madmen khua cu a ṭhing reprep ding, Ralkap pawl in an ciil ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Horonaim mipawl cu, ‘Siatsuahnak, Thisen luannak,’ tiah an au!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Moab cu a siat ṭheh zo; Nauhak ṭah thawm cu ngaihnik uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An ai thawmvang cu ngaihnik uh, Lamzin thlun in saklam ah Luhith tiang a thang. Ninghan riahsiatnak ai-thawm cu ngaihnik uh, Thlanglam ah Horonaim tiang a thang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />‘Zamrang in, luat dingah tlan uh, Nelrawn ih laak lauzet bangin tlan uh,’ an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Maw Moab, na cahnak le na lennak na rinsan; Asinain atu-ah nehmi na si thlang ding. Na khawzing Khemosh cu sal taannak hmun ah a feh ve ding. A bawi pawl le a puithiam pawl thawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khua pakhat hman siatral loin a luat lo ding. Phairawn le hmunrawn tiangin an siat ṭheh ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moab hrangah lungphun phun uh, Tuan ah siat ṭheh a si thlang ding. A khawpi pawl cu khawrop ah an cang ṭheh ding. Zohman an um sal nawn lo ding.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnaṭuan ah a muangcaangtu cu siatserh siseh! Mi a saat lotu le a that lotu cu siatserh siseh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Moab cu himzet le daizetin a um ringring. Ral kaihmi a si dah lo. Moab cu beel pakhat in a dang pakhat ah tleng reromi sabitti vek a si lo. Zohman ih puah lomi a hran vekih retmi sabitti bangtuk a si. A rim a siat dah lo ih a thaw ringringmi sabitti vek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Asinain a tu-ah mi ka thlah ding ih Moab cu an thlet hlomi sabitti bangin an thlet hlo tikcu a ra thleng ding. A sabitti an thlet hlo ding ih a beel cu cip seksek in an khuai ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule Israel mipawl in an rinsan zetmi an khawzing Bethel cu a kim lo le zahpi tlak ih an theih vekin Moab mipawl khal in an khawzing Khemosh cu a kim lo le zahpi tlak in an thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Maw Moab mipawl, ziangah so mi ralṭha le raldo thiam kan si tiah nan puar thau rero?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moab le a khua pawl cu siatsuah ṭheh an si ding; An tlangval ṭha bik pawl tla thah ṭheh an si. Keimah hi siangpahrang ka si, Cungnungbik Bawipa ka si. Keimah in ka sim zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Moab ram ih vanduai ni a nai zo, A siatral ni a thleng cing ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Hi miphun hrangah ṭap uh, A kiangkap ih a umtu pawl, A hmin thannak a theitu pawl khal ṭap uh. ‘A nasa zetmi a mi uknak a cem zo, A sunlawinak le a cahnak a um nawnta lo,’ ti uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nannih Dibon khuami pawl, Nan sunlawinak hmun ihsin ṭum uhla leivut lakah to uh. Moab siatsuahtu a ra zo. A ruhkulh pawl hnawmpen ah a canter ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nannih Aroer khua a ummi pawl, Lamzin kiangah ding tahrat in hngak uh; An khua a tlansantu pawl hi sut uh; Ziangvek thil so a thleng ti sut uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />‘Moab cu a tlu zo,’ tiah an lo sim ding; ‘A hrangah ṭap uh, mualpho in a um zo; Moab cu a siat ṭheh zo, Arnon Tivapi tluan ah than uh,’ an lo ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Tlangpar ih a ummi khua pawl parah thuṭhen ni a thleng zo. Cuih khua pawl cu Holon, Jahzah, Mefaath,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dibon, Nebo, Beth Diblathaim,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kiriathaim, Bethgamul, Bethmeon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kerioth, le Bozrah khua an si. A hlat siseh, a nai siseh, Moab ram ih khua hmuahhmuah parah cun thuṭhennak a thleng zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Moab ih ki cu sahtan ṭheh a si zo; a cakmi a baan tla an khiak ṭheh zo. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Moab kha ri-ter uh, ziangahtile keimah dodaltu a si. Moab cu amah ih luak lakah a lawngtaal ding ih mi in an hnihsan ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Maw Moab, hnihsuahsainak men ih Israel na rak hman kha na ciinglai maw? Fifir an kaih ih an tisiat bangin Israel na tisiat a si kha!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Moab ram ih a ummi pawl, nan khua pawl tlansan uh! Feh uhla khukhaam lakah va um uh. Khukhaam kiangkap ih bu a saktu thuro bangin um uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moab cu a hngalzet. A minung pawl an hngalzia, an puarthau le an zum awkzia le ziangvek in an ruat-aw ti ka thei ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bawipa keimah rori in an hngalnak cu ka thei a si. A puarthaunak cu zianghman a si lo; an thil tuahmi tla rei a daih lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Curuangah Moab ram sung mi hmuahhmuah le Kir Heres mi hrangah ka mitthli a tla ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jazer mipawl hrang hnakih na deuh in Sibmah mipawl hrangah ka ṭap ding. Maw Sibmah khua, Rili Thi le Jazer tiang a ruang a thleng mi sabit hri vek na rak si. Asinain atu ahcun ṭhal caan ih na rah le na rah ding hmuahhmuah khal siat ṭheh an si zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lungawinak le thinnomnak cu Moab ram ṭha sung ihsin laksak ṭheh a si. Sabit rialnak hmun ihsin sabitti luang nawn loin ka phit ṭheh. Sabit tuahtu le lungawi in a autu zohman an um nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Heshbon le Elealeh khuami pawl an ṭap ih, an ṭah aw cu Jahaz tiang a thang. Zoar khuami tla in an thei ih, Horanaim le Eglath Shelishiyah khua pawl tiang a thang a si. Nimrim Tiva hman a kang thluh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Moab mipawl cu an khuavang biaknak hmun ah mei-ur thawinak pe thei lo le an khawzing pawl hnenah hlannak pe thei loin ka kham ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Curuangah cawnglai tum phah ih mithi phumnak hla satu bangin Moab le Kir Heres mi hrangah ka thinlung mitthli a tla, ziangahtile an neihmi hmuahhmuah a cem thluh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />An zatein an sam le an khahmul an met. An zatein an baan an sat ih buri hnipuan an hruk ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Moab ram sungih inn par hmuahhmuah ah le khawkip ih khawhnar pawn ah mithi ngainak lawng a khat, ziangahtile Moab cu zohman ih duh lomi beel kuai siava bangin ka khuai ṭheh zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Moab cu a siatdarh ṭheh zo! ṭap in ai uh! Moab mualpho in a um zo. Hnawmpen ah a cang zo. A kiangkap miphun pawl in hnihsuahsainak ah an hmang a si. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Bawipa in hiti in a sim cia: Moab cu miphun phunkhat in khaupi bangin a thla phar tahrat in a nam ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Khua pawl siseh, ruhkulh pawl siseh, a lak ṭheh ding. Cuih ni ahcun Moab ralkap pawl cu nau neizik nunau bangin thinphang in an um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ka parah hngalzet ih a um ruangah Moab cu siatsuah ṭheh a si ding ih miphun phunkhat a si nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Moab cu tuksumnak, khur thukpipi le mi awktu thang pawl in an bawh. Cucu Bawipa ih ṭong a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuksumnak ihsin tlanhlo a tumtu cu khur sungah an tla ding. Khur thuk sung ihsin suak tahratin a tlantu pawl cu thang in a awk ding. Ziangahtile Bawipa in Moab siatsuah dingah ni a khiah cia zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Bawmtu nei lo raltlan pawl cu siangpahrang Sihon in a rak ukmi Heshbon khawsung ah himnak an hawl. Asinain meisa in cuih khua cu a kang ṭheh. Raldo hiarzet Moab mi pawl ih ram le tlang saangpipi pawl an kang ṭheh zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Moab mi pawl cu zaangfakza an si! Khemosh khawzing a biatu pawl cu siatralnak an tong ih an fanu le an fapa pawl cu ralkaih thawng thlakmi ah an cang zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Sikhalsehla hmailam tikcu caan ahcun Bawipa in Moab cu neinungzet ah a tuah sal ding. Himi cu Bawipa ih ṭongmi a si ih Moab parah a kim ding a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ammon ram ih thu ah Bawipa in hiti in a sim, “Israel mipawl khuiah so an si? An ram a humtu zohman an um lo maw? Ziangah so Gad ram cu Molek khawzing a biatu pawl an lakter ih an luahter?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Rabbah khawpi ih a ummi pawl in raldonak thawmvang an theihnak tikcu ka thlengter ding ih an khawpi a siatral ding ih an khawte pawl tla ciam ko in ur ṭheh an si ding. Cutikah an rak lon ciami ram cu Israel mi pawl in an longkir ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw Heshbon mipawl, ṭap in ai uh! Ai khua cu a cem zo a si! Maw Rabbah nunau pawl, ṭap in ai rero uh! Buri hnipuan hruk uhla mithi ngai in um uh! Tawivak in suk le so ah tlan uh! Nan khawzing Molek cu a puithiam pawl le a bawi pawl thawn ralkaih mi sal ah an cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nannih rintlak lo pawl, ziangah so tluang nan khawn ciamco? Nan cahnak a cem zo a si. Ziangah so nan cahnak ring tahratin zohman in in tawng ngam lo ding, tiah nan ti?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nan kimvel in tuksumza ka suahter ding. Nan zatein nan tlanhlo ṭheh ding. Zokhal luat duh ah nan tlan ding ih nan ralkap pawl a kokhawmtu zohman nan um lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Sikhalsehla netalam ahcun Ammon ram cu neinungzet ah ka canter sal ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in Edom thu ah hiti in a sim: Edom mi pawl hi thudik an ruat thei nawm lo maw si? An thuronmi pawl in ziangtuah ding an sim thei lo maw si? An fimnak hmuahhmuah a cem ṭheh zo maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maw Dedan mipawl, her uhla tlan uh! Relh uh! Esau tesinfa pawl ka siatsuah ding, ziangahtile anmah ka hremnak tikcu a ra thleng zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi in sabit rah an lawh tikah a hri parah malte tal an hlah; rukru pawl in zanih mi an ram tikah an duhmi thil lawng an lak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Esau tesinfa pawl cu an tak lawng in ka ret; an relhnak hmun khal ihsin ka phorhsuak ih an relh thei nawn lo. Edom mi hmuahhmuah an hloral ṭheh zo a si. Mi pakhat hman an taang nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nupa nei lo ngakṭah pawl ka hnenah tanta uh, ka kilkhawi ding. Nan nuhmei pawl khal in in ring thei ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Hremnak a tuar lo ding pawl hman ih hremnak khuat hai an in a si ahcun hrem lo ih luat dingah nan ruat aw maw si? Sihlah! Cuih khuat hai cu nan in tengteng pei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keimah rori in Bozrah khawpi cu mi hmuh ah tuksumza le ramṭhing ah a cang ding. Khawte hmuahhmuah cu kumkhua in an siatral ta ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei in, “Maw Edom, Bawipa hnen ihsin thu ka ngah. Miphun pawl in an ralkap timtuah in nangmah do dingih tiar dingah palai an thlah zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipa in a lo ṭawnṭaiter ding ih zohman in an lo upat lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na hngalnak hi a lo bumtu a si. In ṭih hmang na ti vek hin zohman in an lo ṭih lo. Lungto khukhaam saangpi le tlang saangpi zim ah na um; muvanlai tlukih hmunsang ih na um hmanah Bawipa in a lo dirthla ding. Bawipa in a sim zo a si,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Edom parih a thleng dingmi siatsuahnak cu a nasa tuk ding ih a kiangih a fehtu hmuahhmuah an mangbang in an ṭih ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sodom le Gomorrah parah le a kiangkap khua pawl parih a thleng mi thil ṭihnung cu Edom par khalah a thleng ding. Cuih hmunah minung zohman an um sal nawn lo ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jordan Tiva kap tupi sungih sin suak tahratin ṭilva tlannak lenkolh ih a hung suakmi kiosa bangin keimah ka ra thleng ding ih rinlopi in Edom mipawl cu an ram ihsin ka tlanhloter ding. Cule hotu ka hrilmi in ram cu a uk ding. Keimah thawn ṭhim ding zoso a um? Keimah i zuam ngamtu zoso a um? I dodal ngamtu uktu zoso a um?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Curuangah Edom mipawl siatsuahnak ding ka tummi le Teman khua sung mipawl ziangtluk in tisiat ka tum tikha ngaihnik uh! An faate pawl hman caihhlo an si ding ih mi hmuahhmuah an tuk a sum ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Edom a tluuk tikah cun a thawm a nasa tuk ding ih leilung pumpi hman a hnin ṭheh ding. Ṭihphannak awn-au thawm cu Agaba Tikel tiang a thang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khaupi in ar a nam bangin Bozrah cu ral in an nam ding. Cuih ni ah Edom ralkap pawl cu nau neizik nunau bangin thinphang in an um ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bawipa in Damaskas thu ah hiti in a sim: “Thusia an theih ruangah Hamath le Arpad khawsung mipawl cu donhar le thinphang in an um. Thinharnak in tipi bangin a khuh ih colhdamnak an ngah thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Damaskas mi pawl cu an ṭawnṭai ih thinphang in an tlanhlo. Nau neizik nunau bangin mangbang vansaang le harsa in an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khua nuamzet le khua hminthangzet cu ṭiosan ṭhehmi khua ah a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cuih ni ah an tlangval pawl cu khawsung lamzin ah thah an si ding ih a ralkap pawl cu an siatral ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Damaskas kulhnak ralhruang pawl cu meisa in ka ur ding ih siangpahrang Benhadad inn pawl cu ciamko in ka ur ṭheh ding. Keimah Cungnungbik Bawipa in ka sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Babilon siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar ih nehmi Kedar hrin le Hazor ih ukmi peng pawl thu ah Bawipa in hiti in a sim: “Kedar mi pawl khi do uhla nisuahnak lam hrin cu siatsuah uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />An puanthlam le an tuu rual pawl, an puanthlam puanzar pawl le an puanthlam sungih a ummi thilri hmuahhmuah long ṭheh uh. An kalauk pawl hruai uhla mipi hnenah, ‘Nan kiangkap khuazakip ah ṭihphannak a um,’ ti uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Hazor mi pawl, keimah Bawipa in ralrinnak ka lo pe: Tlan uhla relh uh. Babilon siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar in a lo phiar ih hiti in a ṭong:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />‘Ra uh, kan him a si tiah a ruattu pawl kan do ding. An khawpi cu kotka a nei lo; tawhkalh hrennak khal a nei lo ih zohman in an kilveng lo a si,’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“An kalauk le an caw pawl la uh! An sam tawite ih a mettu pawl cu hmunkip ah ka ṭhekdarh ding ih hmunkip ihsin an hnenah siatralnak ka thlenter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hazor cu kumkhua in hmunṭhing ah ka tuah ding ih cinghnia lawng umnak hmunah a cang ding. Cuih hmun ah minung zohman an um sal nawn lo ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Zedekiah cu Judah siangpahrang a can ṭheh vete in Elam ram thu ah Cungnungbik Bawipa in ka hnenah a sim:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Elam ram a caktertu conkiang saithiam pawl kha ka that ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hmunkip ihsin Elam parah thlipi ka hranter ding ih hmunkip ah a minung pawl cu ka ṭhekdarh ṭheh ding. A minung raltlan pawl an thlen lonak ram pakhat hman a um lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Anmah thah a tumtu an ral pawl kha an ṭih ding ih Elam mi thinlung ah ṭihnak ka umter ding. Ka thinheng in Elam mipawl cu ka siatsuah ding ih an ci ka mitter lai hlanlo anmah dotu ah ralkap ka thlah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />An siangpahrang pawl le an hotu pawl ka hloralter ding ih an rak tonak hmunah ka siangpahrang tokham ka ret ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Asinain netalam ahcun Elam mipawl cu mineinung ka siter sal ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Babilon khawpi le a minung pawl thu-ah hi bangtuk in i sim:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mi phunkip hnenah hi thuthang cu sim awla than vivo aw. Thantar tuah awla tlang-aupi aw; Daite in umpi hlah. Babilon a tlu zo a si; A khawzing Marduk cu a kuai ṭheh zo! Babilon ih milem pawl cu ningzak in an um zo, Fihnungza an milem pawl cu rialdip ṭheh an si zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Saklam ihsin miphun phunkhat Babilon do dingah a rung zo ih Babilon cu ramṭhingah a cangter ding. Milai le ṭilva pawl an tlan hlo ṭheh ding ih minung zohman an um lo ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Cuih tikcu a ra thlen tikah Israel le Judah mi pawl an ra ding ih Kei an Pathian hi ṭapphah in in ra hawl ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zion fehnak lamzin an sut ding ih cuih lamzin in an ra ding. Kumkhua hrangin thukamnak keimah thawn an tuah ding ih ziangtik hmanah an siatbal nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ka minung pawl hi tuukhaltu pawl in tlangsaang hramlakih an hlohtermi tuu bangtuk an si. A hlomi tuu vekin tlang pakhat hnu pakhat ah an vak ih an inn hman an thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hmutu hmuahhmuah in an do ih an that. An ral pawl in, ‘An tlannak tlimno a si mi le an pupa pawl ih an ruahsanmi an Bawipa hnenih an sual ruangah hi bangtuk thil kan tuah mi hi kan sual lo a si,’ an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Maw Israel mipawl, Babilon ihsin tlan uh. Hiram hi tlansan uh! A tlan hmaisabiktu si uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saklam ih a ummi miphun pawl ka tokhrok ding ih Babilon ka doter ding. Hiram do dingah an tiar-aw ding ih an neh ngaingai ding. Sakah thiam pawl an si ih conkiang in hmui an bat tikah a ṭhelh dah lo pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Babilon cu an siim ding ih a siimtu pawl cun an duhmi hmuahhmuah an long ṭheh ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Maw Babilon mipawl, ka miphun nan siim. Cutikah nan lung a awi ih nan ai a puang. Fangrialtu cawcang vekin le a feh phah in a ai mi rangcang bangin nan feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Asinain nanmah ih khua, khawpi nasazet cu, ningzak le mualpho in a um ding. Babilon hi miphun hmuahhmuah lakah a ṭawnṭai bik miphun ah a cang ding. Ramcaar le tidai um lonak nelrawn ah a cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka thinhengnak ruangah Babilon ah minung zohman an um lo ding. Khawrop ah a cang ding ih a kiangih a fehtu hmuahhmuah cu mangbang le khawruahhar in an um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Conkiang saithiamtu pawl, Babilon do dingah tiar-aw uhla kulh ṭheh uh. Nan conkiang thawn Babilon cu sai uh. Ziangahtile Bawipa keimah parah an sual a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Babilon khawpi kimvel in raldo au in au uh. Babilon a sung zo! Khawkulhnak phardawl cu an bal ih an cim ṭheh zo. Babilon mi parah phu ka la a si. An parah nan phu la uhla midang an tuah vekin anmah parah tuah ve uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hiram sungah thlaici tuh si hlah seh; rawl lak ti khal um hlah seh. Ramdangmi a rak ummi pawl in Babilon a dotu ralkap pawl an ṭih ding ih an khua le an ram ah an kir sal ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Israel mipawl cu kiosa ih dawimi le ṭhekdarhmi tuu vek an si. Hmaisa ah Assiria siangpahrang in a nam ih neta ah Babilon siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar in an ruh a ṭam a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cuih ruangah keimah Cungnungbik Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in Assiria siangpahrang ka hrem zo vekin siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar le a ram cu ka hrem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel mipawl cu an ram ah ka tlungter ding. Karmel Tlang le Bahan ram ih a khomi rawl pawl an ei ding ih Efraim ram le Gilead ram ihsin a suakmi rawl cu an duhzat in an ei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cuih tikcu a thlen tikah cun Israel ram ah sualnak a um lo ding ih Judah ram ah thil ṭha lo a um lo ding. Ziangahtile an nunnak ka zuahmi pawl cu an sualnak ka ngaithiam ṭheh ding a si. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Merathaim mi le Pekod mipawl do uh. That uhla siatsuah ṭheh uh. Ka thupekmi vekin tuah ṭheh uh. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hiram ah raldonak thawm a thang ih siatsuahnak nasazet a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sobul a si mi Babilon in leilung pumpi hi sop ṭheh ko in a deng. Asinain atu ahcun cuih sobul cu a kiak ṭheh zo! Hiram parih a thlengmi thil an hmuh tikah mi hmuahhmuah an mang a bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Maw Babilon, keimah i rak do. Asinain na theih loin thang ka rak kam ih cuih thang cun a lo awk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka hriamnam retnak inn ka ong ih ka thinheng in ka hriamnam cu ka suah hai. Ziangahtile a maksak bikmi Cungnungbik keimah Bawipa in Babilon ah thil tuah ding ka nei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hmunkip ihsin do uhla a rawl retnak inn pawl cu bauh ṭheh uh. Nan lonmi pawl cu rawl bangin vuun liailiai in khawl uh. An ram cu siat ṭheh uh. Zianghman zuah hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ralkap hmuahhmuah that uh. That ṭheh hai uh. Babilon mipawl an cem a si. Hremnak an tuar tikcu a ra thleng zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Babilon ihsin raltlan a luatmi pawl Jerusalem ah an ra thleng ih, Bawipa ih Biakinn parah ih thil an rak tuah sualmi ruangah Babilon mipawl parah Bawipa kan Pathian in ziangvek in phu a lak, ti kha an ra sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Babilon do dingah conkiang saithiam pawl sim uh. Li le thal a hmang thiamtu hmuahhmuah feh ṭheh uh. Babilon khawpi cu kulh theh uhla zohman luat hlah hai seh. Thil a rak tuahmi vekin leh ruul uh. Midang parih a tuah vekin a parah tuah ruul ve uh; ziangahtile Israel mipawl ih A thianghlim Keimah parah hngalzet in hna a ṭuan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Curuangah a tlangval pawl khawpi lamzin ah thah an si ding ih a ralkap pawl hmuahhmuah cuih ni ah siatsuah ṭheh an si ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Babilon, hngalnak in na khat a si; curuangah Ziangkimtithei Cungnungbik Bawipa keimah in ka lo ral a si! Ka lo hremnak tikcu a ra thleng zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A puarthaumi na ram hi a sawn ding ih a tlu ding; zohman in an lo thawhsak lo ding. Na khua pawl cu meisa in ka ur ding ih a kiangkap thil hmuahhmuah cu an siatral ṭheh ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ziangkimtithei Bawipa in, “Israel mi le Judah mipawl cu namnuaimi an si. An kaih hai ih pakhat hman thlah loin an kil ṭhepṭhep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Sikhalsehla anmah a runsuaktu ding cu a cakzet; a hmin cu Ziangkimtithei Bawipa a si. Amah rori in an thu cu a dinpi ding ih leilung parah daihnak a thlenter ding. Asinain Babilon mi hnen ahcun buainak a thlenter ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Babilon ah ralnam a thleng; Thihnak cu a minung pawl, a mi uktu le a mifim pawl parah a thleng a si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ralnam cu thuphanpertu, a profet pawl parah a thleng. Ziangtluk mi aa so an si. Thihnak cu a ralkap pawl parah a thleng; Ziangtluk in so an tuk a suum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A rang le a rangleng pawl siat suah uh. A saancopmi a ralkap pawl parah thihnak a thleng; An ṭawnṭaihzia cu! A sumsaw le a hlawnthil siatsuah ṭheh uh; Long uhla ram ṭheh uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A leilung le tiva pawl khal caar thluh hai seh. Babilon cu ṭihnungza milem an umnak ram a si; A minung pawl an lung a molhter ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“Curuangah Babilon cu khawsia le ramhuai le a thianglo vate pawl ih umnak ram ah a cang ding. Milai an um nawn lo ding. Ziangtik san hmanah an um dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Sodom le Gomorrah ka siatsuah ih a kiangkap khua pawl ka siatter ṭheh vekin Babilon par khalah a thleng ding. Cuih hmunah milai zohman an um nawn lo ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Saklam ih a ummi ram ihsin milai an ra; a hlatzet le ram cakzet ihsin. Raldo dingah siangpahrang tampi an tim aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />An li le thal le an ralnam pawl an pai; Mi zaangfah nei lo le mi thinsia pawl an si. Tifinriat thlipi thawm bangtuk an si, An rang an to tikah cun! Raldo dingah an tiar aw, Babilon do dingah cun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Babilon siangpahrang cu a kut a zawng ṭheh; Cuih thu a theih tikah cun! Donharnak le thinharnak in a khat, Nau neizik nunau na bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Jordan Tiva kap tupi sung ihsin suak tahratin ṭilva tlannak lenkolh ih a hung suakmi kiosa bangin Bawipa keimah ka ra ding ih rinlopi in Babilon mipawl cu an khawpi ihsin ka tlanhloter ṭheh hai ding. Cule hotu dingih ka hrilmi in an ram cu a uk ding. Keimah thawn ṭhim ding zoso a um? Keimah i zuam ngamtu zoso a um? I dodal ngamtu uktu zoso a um?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Curuangah Babilon khawpi siatsuah ding ka tummi le an minung pawl ziangtlukin tisiat ka tum daan hi ngai hnik uh! An faate pawl hman dir hlo an si ding ih mi hmuahhmuah an tuk a suum ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Babilon a tluuk tikah cun a thawm a nasa tuk ding ih leilung pumpi a hnin ṭheh ding. An thinphannak awn-au cu miphun dang pawl in an thei ṭheh ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Babilon le a minung pawl parah siatsuahtu thlipi ka ratter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thlipi in fanghi a semhlo bangin Babilon siatsuahtu dingah ramdangmi ka thlah ding. Cuih siatsuahnak ni a thlen tikah cun hmunkip in an do ding ih an ram cu kolh ṭheh in an tuah hnuah an taanta ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An ralkap pawl conkiang sainak tikcu pe hlah uh. An thir angki hruknak tikcu khal pe hlah uh. Tlangval a si ti ah zohman zuah hlah uh. An ralkap zatein that ṭheh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hriamhma an pu ding ih an khua pawl ih lamzin ah an thi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel ih A thianghlim Keimah parah an sual zo naón Bawipa , Ziangkimtithei Pathian keimah in Israel le Judah mi pawl cu ka dungtun hrih lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Babilon ihsin tlanhlo uh. Luat dingah tlan uh. Babilon sualnak ruangah thahnak tuar duh hlah uh. A parah phu ka la ih a tuar ding zat in ka hrem a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Babilon cu ka kut sungih sui khuat hai, leilung pumpi a ritertu bangtuk a si. Mi phunkip in a zu an in ih an thinlung a molh ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Babilon cu rinlopi in a tlu ih a siatral ṭheh zo. Ṭah ciamco uh. A hma hnih dingah sii hawl uh. A dam sal tla a si thei men.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutawkih a ummi ramdangmi pawl in, ‘Babilon kan bawm tum naón a tlai tuk zo. Fehsan uhsila kan ram le kan khua ah tlung uhsi. Pathian in a cahnak hmuahhmuah thawn Babilon cu a hrem ih a siat ṭheh zo a si,’ an ti,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Ka minung pawl in ‘ Bawipa in kan diknak a langter zo. Feh uhsila Bawipa kan Pathian ih thil tuahmi cu Jerusalem mi hnenah sim uhsi,’ tiah an au,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa in Babilon siatsuah a tum ruangah Media siangpahrang pawl a tokhrok hai. A Biakinn an siatter ruangah cuvekin phu a la tum a si. Ralkap pawl hotu ralbawi cun, “Nan conkiang tathriam uh. Nan ralphaw keng uhla tiar cia uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Babilon khawkulhnak phardawl do dingah theihternak pe uh. Ral kiltu thlah beet uh. Kilvengtu ret uh. Ral bawhtu ding thlah uh!” a ti. Bawipa in Babilon mi parih ka tuah ding a timi cu a tuah zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khi ram ah tiva tampi le sumsaw tampi a um; asinain tikcu a nei nawn lo; a nunnak hri cu sahtan a si zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ziangkimtithei Bawipa in Babilon do dingah minung tam ngaingai, sihte zat ka run thlah ding ih ralnehnak thawn an au ding, tiah amah ih nunnak saal in thu a kam zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipa in leilung hi a huham in a tuah; A fimnak in lei hi a seemsuah ih, van khal a pharh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amah ih thupeknak in van tlun ih tidai a huuk; Vanhram deng ihsin khawdur a rak keng. Ruah lakah nimthla a kauter ih, a thil retnak inn ihsin thli a run kuat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cumi an hmuh tikah minung cu, zianghman an thei lo ih mi-aa vek an si. Milem a tuahtu pawl cu, beidong le ninghang in an um. Ziangahtile an tuahmi an khuavang pawl cu nunnak nei lo, a lem lawng an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zianghman ih ṭhahnem lo an si ih, hmuhsuam tlak an si; An siatral ṭheh ding; Bawipa a rat ih a hrem tikah cun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jakob ih Pathian cu cubangtuk a si lo; Amah cu ziang hmuahhmuah tuahtu a si. Israel mipawl cu Amah ih tabul si dingah a hril a si; Amah ih hmin cu Ziangkimtithei Bawipa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Babilon, nang cu ka sobul na si; Ka raldonak hriamnam na si. Miphun le uknak tampi sutkuainak ah ka lo hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Rang le a totu pawl sutbalnak ah, Rangleeng le a mawngtu pawl sutkuainak ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nunau le mipa thahnak ah, Mino le upa thahnak ah, Fala le tlangval thahnak ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuukhal le an tuu pawl thahnak ah, Lothlo le an leilehnak caw pawl thahnak ah, Uktu le bawi pawl thahnak ah,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Jerusalem parih thilsual an tuah ruangah Babilon le a minung pawl hnenih phu ka lak kha nan hmu ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Maw Babilon, nang cu leilung pumpi a siatsuahtu tlangsaangpi vek na si; sikhalsehla Bawipa keimah hi na ral ka si. Ka lo kaihrem ding ih leilung ah ka lo hlon ding ih vutcam ah ka lo canter hnuah ka lo tlansan ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khawrop ah na cang ding ih na lungto pakhatte hman inn saknak ah hman sal a si nawn lo ding. Kumkhua in nelrawn ah na cangta ding a si. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Raldo dingah theihter hminsinnak pe uh! Miphun pawl ih theih dingah tawtawrawt tum uh. Babilon do dingah miphun pawl timtuah uh. Raldo dingah Ararat ram, Minni ram le Ashkenaz ram pawl sim uh. Raldo hotu dingah ralbawi pakhat hril uh. Kharbok rual tamzet bangin raldonak rang pawl khal rak keng uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Babilon do dingah miphun pawl timtuah uh. Media siangpahrang pawl, an hotu le an bawi pawl, an ralkap le an ukmi ram hmuahhmuah ko ṭheh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Leilung pumpi cu a khur ih a hnin ciamco. Ziangahtile Babilon ram cu nelrawn ah canter ih zohman um lonak ramṭhing ih canter dingah Bawipa in a tumtahmi a tuahsuak zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Babilon ralkap pawl cu raldo nawn loin an ṭannak ruhkulh sungah an cawl. An thin a nau zo ih nunau vek an si zo. Khawpi kotka pawl cu bal ṭheh an si ih inn pawl cu meisa in a kang ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Babilon khawpi cu hmunkip in an bal vivo zo a si, tiah Babilon siangpahrang sim dingah thuthantu pakhat hnu pakhat an tlan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ral pawl in tiva tannak hmun cu an lak zo ih ruhkulh pawl cu meisa in an ur a si. Babilon ralkap pawl cu uk thei an si nawn lo ih sukso ah an vakvai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Reilote ah ral pawl in an saat thluk ding ih fangcilnak hmun ih fang an pal bangin leilung ah palcih an si ding. Keimah Ziangkimtithei Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in ka sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar in, Jerusalem cu a saattan ih a ei. Tidai retnak beel bangin a thlet ṭheh. Sahrang bangin a dolh ṭheh a si. A duhmi lawng a lak ih, a dang cu a hlonhlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Zion mi pawl in, “Kan thisen an luanter ruangah, Babilon mipawl in tuar hai seh,” ti hai seh. Jerusalem mipawl in, “Harnak kan tuar ruangah hin, Babilon mi pawl cawh siseh,” ti hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa in Jerusalem mi hnenah, “Nan thu hi ka dinpi ding ih nan parih thilsual an tuahmi ruangah nan ral pawl ka cawh ding. Babilon ram ih tidai dawhhna pawl ka caarter ding ih an tiva pawl ka kangter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Khi ram cu hnawmpen ah ka cangter ding ih hramlak ramsa umnak lawngah a cang ding. Zoh ngam lo dingah a cang ding ih a hmutu hmuahhmuah an tuk a suum ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Babilon mipawl cu kiosa bangin an huuk ding ih kiosa no bangin an ai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Mi hamṭam pawl an si maw? Rawl ei puai ka tuahsak ding ih zu an ri ding ih lungnuam in an um ding. An it that ding ih an ṭhang nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuufaate, me le tuucang an that vekih thah dingah ka hruaihlo ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Bawipa in Babilon thu ah hiti in a sim: “Leilung pumpi ih porhmi khawpi cu ral in an lak zo. Mi phunkip hmaiah Babilon cu tuksumza ah a cang zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tipi in Babilon a khuh ih tilet cu a parah a huuk ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A dang khua pawl cu zoh duh-awk lo ah an cang ih zohman um duh lonak, pal duak ding hmanah duh lo dingmi, nelrawn caar ah an cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Babilon ih khuavang Beel cu ka hrem ding ih a rak rukmi thilri pawl ka khirhter ding. Miphun pawl in an bia nawn lo ding. Babilon kulhnak phardawl pawl an tlu zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Israel mipawl, tlan thluh uh. Nun nan duh a si ahcun ṭihnungza ka thinhengnak hi tlansan uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Nan theihmi thawmvang ruangah ṭih hlah uh. Nan thin khal nau hlah seh. Kumtinte thu dangdang, ram sungah thah awknak le siangpahrang pakhat le pakhat an do-aw ti thu a thang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Curuangah Babilon ka tisiatnak tikcu a ra thleng ding. Ram pumpi cu ningzak le mualpho in ret a si ding ih a minung pawl cu thah an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Saklam ihsin siatsuah dingih a rami minung pawl kut sungih Babilon a tluk tikah cun lei le van ih um ziang hmuahhmuah cu lungawi in an au ciamco ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Leilung pumpuluk ah mi tampi Babilon in a thihter; atu-ah Babilon cu Israel mi tampi a thihter ruangah a tlu ve thlang ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Bawipa in Babilon ih a minung pawl hnenah, “Thihnak ihsin nan luat zo! Atu feh uh! Zianghman hngak hlah uh! Nan khua le nan ram cu a hlazet naón Bawipa keimah hi in thei uhla, Jerusalem khal ciing uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Nannih in ‘Ningzak le mualpho in kan um zo. Ramdangmi pawl in Biakinn sung hmun thianghlim pawl cu an lak ṭheh zo ih zianghman ti theimi kan nei lo,’ nan ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Curuangah ka lo sim: Tikcu a ra thleng ding ih Babilon milem pawl ka siatsuah ṭheh ding. Hmapu pawl cu ram sungah an ai an kio ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Babilon cu van ah kai thei tahrat in a khohzetmi ral ṭannak ruhkulh ralhruang va sak thei hmansehla cumi siatsuahtu dingah mi ka thlah thotho ding. Keimah Bawipa in ka sim zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Babilon ihsin ṭahnak aw le, ramsung siatsuahnak ruangih riahsiat ṭah thawm cu ngai uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Babilon cu ka siatsuah ih, A thawmvang neihmi cu ka vuakdai a si. Ralkap pawl in a huuk reromi tilet bangin an nam ih, Ring zetzet ih au phah in an do.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Babilon siatsuah dingah an ra; A ralkap pawl an kai; An conkiang pawl an khiak ṭheh; Miṭha lo a hremtu cu Pathian Keimah ka si; Babilon parah phu ka la ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />A ram uktu pawl, a mifim pawl, a hotu pawl le a ralkap pawl zu ka riter ding. An it that dingih an ṭhang sal nawn lo ding. Keimah siangpahrang in ka sim zo. Ziangkimtithei Bawipa ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />A nasa zetmi Babilon ih phar pawl cu, leilung ah a cim ṭheh ding. A saangzetmi kotka pawl cu, meisa in a kang ṭheh ding. Miphun pawl ih hnaṭuanmi cu zianghman a si lo; An zonzaihnak hmuahhmuah cu, meisa hrang lawngah a si. Ziangkimtithei Bawipa Keimah in ka sim zo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Siangpahrang Zedekiah a bawmtu pakhat cu Seraiah a si. Seraiah cu Neriah fapa, Mahseiah fasuan a si. Zedekiah cu Judah siangpahrang a ṭuan kum linak ah Babilon ah a feh ih a hnenah Seraiah khal a feh ve. Cutikah Seraiah hnenah cun thu ka cah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Babilon parah siseh, Babilon hrangih thu dangdang siseh, cabu sungah ka ngan. Siatsuahnak a thleng dingmi hmuahhmuah ka ngan ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Seraiah hnenah cun, “Babilon na thlen tikah hi cazual sungih ka nganmi hmuahhmuah hi mipi hnenah va siar tengteng aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Cule Bawipa hnenah, ‘Maw Bawipa , hi hmun hi ka siatsuah ding ih kumkhua in ramṭhing ah a cang ding ih a nungmi thil, minung siseh, ramsa siseh, an um lo ding, tiah na sim zo,’ tiah thlacam aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Cule Seraiah, hi cabu hi mipi hnenih na siar ṭheh hnuah nangmah rori in lungto thawn ṭemcih awla Eufrates Tivapi sungah hlon aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Na hlon tikah, ‘Hi vekin Babilon parah a kim ding. Ti sungah a pil ding ih a suak sal nawn lo ding. Ziangahtile Bawipa in siatsuahnak cu Babilon parah a thlenter ding a si,’ tiah ti aw,” ka ti. Jeremiah ih ṭong cu hi hmuah hi a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zedekiah cu Judah siangpahrang a ṭuan tikah kum kul hluankhat a si ih Jerusalem ihsin kum hleikhat a uk. A nu ih hmin cu Hamutal a si ih Libnah khua ih ummi Jeremiah ih fanu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Siangpahrang Jehoiakim vek thotho in siangpahrang Zedekiah khal Bawipa ih parah a sual.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa cu Jerusalem mi le Judah mipawl parah a thin a heng ngaingai ih a mit hmuhlonak hmunah a dawihlo hai a si. Babilon siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar do duh ah Zedekiah cu ral a tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar cu a ralkap thawn a feh ih Zedekiah siangpahrang a ṭuannak kum kua kum, thla hra thla, ni hra ni ah Jerusalem a do. Khawpi lengah riahbuk an sak ih khawpi phardawl leng ihsin a kimvel in leilung an dawl ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zedekiah siangpahrang a ṭuannak kum hleikhat kum tiang an kulh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cuih kum hleikhat kum, thla li thla, ni kua ni ah paam a nasat tuk ruangah khawsung mipawl zianghman ei ding an nei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule khawkulh phardawl cu an balcim ih Babilon ralkap pawl in Jerusalem khawpi cu an kulh ṭhepṭhep naón Judah ralkap pawl cu zan khawthim ah an rak tlanhlo ṭheh. Siangpahrang hmuan lakin an feh ih phar pahnih a pehtu kotka zin in an feh ih Jordan phairawn lam ah an tlan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asinain Babilon ralkap pawl in siangpahrang Zedekiah cu an dawi ih Jerikho khua kiang hmunrawn ah an kai ngah; a ralkap pawl in an tlansan ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule Zedekiah cu siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar hnenah an fehpi. Culai ah Nebuchadnezzar cu Hamath ram Riblah khua ah a um ih cutawkah Zedekiah ih thu cu a relsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar in Riblah ahcun Zedekiah ih fapa pakhat cu a pa ih mithmuh rori ah a that; Judah ram bawi dangdang khal a that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Zedekiah ih mit a phorh ih thir cikcin in a khih ih Babilon ah a kuat. Babilon ah Zedekiah cu a thih ni tiangin thawng sungah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar ih Babilon siangpahrang a ṭuannak kum hleikua kum, thla nga thla, ni hra ni ah, siangpahrang hnenih ruahnak petu le a ralkap hotu ralbawi Nebuzaradan cu Jerusalem khua sungah a lut ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Biakinn le siangpahrang inn le Jerusalem khawsung ih bawi upa pawl ih inn hmuahhmuah meisa in a ur ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A ralkap pawl in khawpi kulhnak phardawl pawl an rak bal ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule Nebuzaradan in Jerusalem ih a taangmi minung pawl, zungthiam pawl le Babilon ralkap pawl hnenih a relhtu pawl hmuahhmuah cu Babilon ah a fehpi ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cule Judah ram ahcun mi farah bik pawl le thilri zianghman a nei lo pawl kha a taan ih lo hnaṭuantu dingah le sabit hmuan thlotu dingah a ret a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Babilon mi pawl in Biakinn sungih a ummi dar ih tuahmi ṭhuam pawl le leng pawl an denkuai ṭheh ih dar tikuang tumpi khal an siat ṭheh. A dang dar ih tuahmi thilri hmuahhmuah cu Babilon ah an phur ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cule sawhleek pawl le biakṭheng thianfai tikih hmanmi vutcam khawlnak kheng pawl, meisa vanmi mei-inn ih thuam pawl, thawinak pek tikih sathi donnak maihum pawl, rimhmui ur tikih hmanmi khengkuum pawl le Biakinn sungih hmanmi dar thilthuam hmuahhmuah an lak ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngun le sui ih tuahmi thilri hmuahhmuah khal an lak ṭheh; pakan kuum pawl, meivam laknak kheng pawl, raithawi tikih sathi khawlnak maihum pawl, vutcam retnak kheng pawl, mei-inn ṭhuam pawl, rimhmui urnak kheng pawl le sabitti thawinak pek tikih sabitti thletnak maihum pawl khal an lak ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Siangpahrang Solomon in dar ih a tuahmi thilri pawl: ṭhuam pahnih, leng pawl, tikuang tumpi le tikuang dotu cawcang hleihnih pawl cu cuai ih thlai theih lo ding in an rit.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ṭhuam pahnih cu an bang aw; pakhat cu pi kul hluansarih a sang ih pi hleiriat a tum; a sung a kua ih a thir cu pi thum a sah. Ṭhuam ziik ah dar ih tuahmi lubo a um ih pi sarih le a hrek a sang; a kimvel ah taleti rah cuang in mawiternak sermi a um ih a zatein dar ih tuah ṭhehmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cutiih mawiternak sermi taleti rah cu ṭhuam lu pakhat ah zakhat a um ih cuih sungah sawmkua le paruk cu leilung ihsin hmuh thei an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cuih tlunah Babilon ralkap hotu ralbawi Nebuzaradan in Puithiam Sang Seraiah le puithiam sang sangtu puithiam Zefaniah le Biakinn ih bawi tumpipi pathum kha thawng thlak dingah a hruaihlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khawpi sungih ralkap pawl hotu ralbawi pakhat, khawpi sungih a taang hrihmi siangpahrang ruahnak petu sungin minung pasarih, ralkap zung ih cazin kaitu le ralbawi sangtu pakhat le mi upa deuhdeuh minung sawmruk tla a fehpi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nebuzaradan in Hamath ram, Riblah khua ih a rak ummi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Babilon siangpahrang hnenah a hruai. Cutawkah Babilon siangpahrang in a thawiter ih a thahter hai. Cuticun Judah mi pawl cu an ram ihsin saltaannak ram ah hruaihlo an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar in sal dingih a hruaihlo mi minung cazin cu a thuailam vekin a si: Siangpahrang a ṭuannak kum sarih kum ah minung thawng thum le kul hluan thum;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A kum hleiriat kum ah Jerusalem ihsin minung zariat le sawmthum le pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kum kul hluanthum kum ah minung za sarih le sawmli le panga; an zate in minung thawngli le zaruk Nebuchadnezzar in a hruaihlo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Evilmerodak cu Babilon siangpahrang a can kum ah Judah siangpahrang Jehoiakhin parih zaangfahnak a neih ruangah thawng inn ihsin a suah. Cutiih a suah cu Jehoiakhin thawng thlak dingih an hruaihlo hnu kum sawm thum le kum sarih kum, thla hlei hnih thla, ni kul hluannga ni ah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Evilmerodak in Jehoiakhin cu ṭhatein a zoh ih Babilon ih thawng a tla vemi siangpahrang dangdang hnenih upatnak a pekmi hnakin tam sawn in upatnak a pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cuti cun Jehoiakhin cu a zoh ṭha ih a thawng tlaknak hnipuan a thleng awkter ih a nunsung hmuahhmuah siangpahrang cabuai ah rawl a eiter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A nun sung nitinte a ṭulmi leinak ih hman dingah Babilon siangpahrang in Jehoiakhin cu tangka a pek ringring.
  </para>
</usx>
